msgid "<p> The forum is an discussion tool for asynchronous written work.  In contrast to e-mail, a forum is for public, or semi-public, group discussion. </p>To use the Chamilo forum, members can simply use their browser - they do not require any distinct client software. </p>To organize forums, click on the Forums tool. Discussions are organized hierarchically according to the following structure: </ p><b> Category> Forum> Topic> Post</ b> </ p> To ensure members can participate in the forum tidily and effectively, it is essential in the first instance to create categories and forums; it's then up to the participants to create topics and posts. By default, the forum contains a single (public) category, an example topic and an example post. You can add forums to the category,  change its title or create other categories within which you could then create new forums. (Don't confuse categories and forums, and remember that a category that contains no forum is useless and not displayed.)</p>\n<p>The forum description might include a list of its members, a definition of its purpose, a target a task, a theme etc.</p><p>Group forums should not be created via the Forum tool but instead via the Groups tool, where you can determine whether your group forums should be private or public, at the same time providing a location for sharing groups of documents.</p><b> Teaching Tips</ b></ p> A learning forum is not quite the same as the forums you are used to seeing on the internet. For one thing, it is not possible for learners to alter their posts once they have been published as the course is logically archived to allow tracking of what has been said in the past. Furthermore, Chamilo forums allow for specific uses  relevant to teaching. For example, some teachers/trainers publish corrections directly within forums in the following way: <li> A learner is asked to post a report directly into the forum, </ li> The teacher corrects it by clicking Edit (yellow pencil) and marking it using the graphics editor (color, underlining, etc.) </ li> Finally, other learners benefit from viewing the corrections was made on the production of one of of them, </ li> Note that the same principle can be applied between learners, but will require his copying/pasting the message of his fellow student because students / trainees can not edit one another's posts. <. li> </ ul>"
msgstr "<p> Il-forum huwa għodda ta' diskussjoni għal xogħol miktub asinkroniku.  B'differenza mill-email, forum huwa għal diskussjoni pubblika jew semi-pubblika tal-grupp. </p>Biex tuża l-forum ta' Chamilo, il-membri jistgħu sempliċement jużaw il-browser tagħhom - m'għandhomx bżonn software tal-klijent separat. </p>Biex torganizza l-forums, ikklikkja fuq l-għodda Forums. Id-diskussjonijiet huma organizzati b'mod ġerarkiku skont l-istruttura li ġejja: </ p><b> Kategorija> Forum> Suġġett> Post</ b> </ p> Biex tiżgura li l-membri jistgħu jipparteċipaw fil-forum b'mod ordnat u effettiv, huwa essenzjali fl-ewwel istanza li jinħolqu kategoriji u forums; imbagħad jiddependi fuq il-parteċipanti biex joħolqu suġġetti u posts. B'mod awtomatiku, il-forum fih kategorija waħda (pubblika), suġġett eżempju u post eżempju. Tista' żżid forums mal-kategorija, tibdel it-titlu tagħha jew toħloq kategoriji oħra li fihom tista' toħloq forums ġodda. (Tħawwadx kategoriji u forums, u ftakar li kategorija li ma jkun fiha l-ebda forum hija inutli u ma tidhirx.)</p>\n<p>Id-deskrizzjoni tal-forum tista' tinkludi lista tal-membri tagħha, definizzjoni tal-iskop tagħha, mira, kompitu, tema eċċ.</p><p>Forums tal-gruppi m'għandhomx jinħolqu permezz tal-għodda Forum iżda permezz tal-għodda Gruppi, fejn tista' tiddetermina jekk il-forums tal-grupp tiegħek għandhomx ikunu privati jew pubbliċi, fl-istess ħin tipprovdi post għall-qsim ta' gruppi ta' dokumenti.</p><b> Pariri dwar it-Tagħlim</ b></ p> Forum ta' tagħlim mhuwiex eżattament l-istess bħall-forums li inti mdorri tara fuq l-internet. Għal ħaġa waħda, mhuwiex possibbli għall-istudenti jbiddlu l-posts tagħhom ladarba jkunu ġew ippubblikati peress li l-kors huwa arkivjat b'mod loġiku biex jippermetti t-traċċar ta' dak li ntqal fil-passat. Barra minn hekk, forums ta' Chamilo jippermettu użi speċifiċi rilevanti għat-tagħlim. Per eżempju, xi għalliema/jittrenjaw jippubblikaw korrezzjonijiet direttament fil-forums bil-mod li ġej: <li> Studenti jintalab jippubblika rapport direttament fil-forum, </ li> L-għalliem jikkoreġih billi jikkklikkja Edit (lapes isfar) u jimmarkah billi juża l-editur grafiku (kulur, sottolinja, eċċ.) </ li> Fl-aħħarnett, studenti oħra jibbenefikaw mill-vista tal-korrezzjonijiet li saru fuq il-produzzjoni ta' wieħed minnhom, </ li> Innota li l-istess prinċipju jista' jiġi applikat bejn l-istudenti, iżda se jkun jeħtieġ li jikkopja/jwaħħal il-messaġġ tal-kollega tiegħu minħabba li l-istudenti/jittrenjaw ma jistgħux jeditjaw il-posts ta' xulxin. <. li> </ ul>"

