msgstr "Whitelist - setting"

msgid "The blacklist is used to filter the files extensions by removing (or renaming) any file which extension figures in the blacklist below. The extensions should figure without the leading dot (.) and separated by semi-column (;) like the following:  exe;com;bat;scr;php. Files without extension are accepted. Letter casing (uppercase/lowercase) doesn't matter."
msgstr "Il-blacklist tintuża biex tiffiltra l-estensjonijiet tal-fajls billi tneħħi (jew tbiddel l-isem) kwalunkwe fajl li l-estensjoni tiegħu tidher fil-blacklist hawn taħt. L-estensjonijiet għandhom jidhru mingħajr il-punt (.) u separati b'semi-colon (;) bħal: exe;com;bat;scr;php. Fajls mingħajr estensjoni huma aċċettati. Il-kapitalizzazzjoni (maġġusku/minuskula) ma tagħmilx differenza."

msgid "The whitelist is used to filter the file extensions by removing (or renaming) any file whose extension does *NOT* figure in the whitelist below. It is generally considered as a safer but more restrictive approach to filtering. The extensions should figure without the leading dot (.) and separated by semi-column (;) such as the following:  htm;html;txt;doc;xls;ppt;jpg;jpeg;gif;sxw. Files without extension are accepted. Letter casing (uppercase/lowercase) doesn't matter."
msgstr "Il-whitelist tintuża biex tiffiltra l-estensjonijiet tal-fajls billi tneħħi (jew tbiddel l-isem) kwalunkwe fajl li l-estensjoni tiegħu ma tidhirx fil-whitelist hawn taħt. Ġeneralment titqies bħala approċċ aktar sigur iżda aktar restrittiv għall-filtrazzjoni. L-estensjonijiet għandhom jidhru mingħajr il-punt (.) u separati b'semi-colon (;) bħal: htm;html;txt;doc;xls;ppt;jpg;jpeg;gif;sxw. Fajls mingħajr estensjoni huma aċċettati. Il-kapitalizzazzjoni (maġġusku/minuskula) ma tagħmilx differenza."

msgid "Filtering behaviour (skip/rename)"
msgstr "Imġiba tal-filtrazzjoni (aqbeż/biddel l-isem)"

msgid "If you choose to skip, the files filtered through the blacklist or whitelist will not be uploaded to the system. If you choose to rename them, their extension will be replaced by the one defined in the extension replacement setting. Beware that renaming doesn't really protect you, and may cause name collision if several files of the same name but different extensions exist."
msgstr "Jekk tagħżel li taqbeż, il-fajls iffiltrati permezz tal-blacklist jew whitelist ma jiġux ittellgħa fis-sistema. Jekk tagħżel li tbiddel l-isem tagħhom, l-estensjoni tagħhom tiġi sostitwita b'dik definita fis-setting tal-estensjoni ta' sostituzzjoni. Oqgħod attent li l-bdil tal-isem ma jipproteġikx verament, u jista' jikkawża ħabta ta' ismijiet jekk ikun hemm diversi fajls bl-istess isem iżda estensjonijiet differenti."

