msgid "Start using the Ephorus anti plagiarism service in Chamilo.<br /> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>With Ephorus, you will prevent internet plagiarism without any additional effort.</strong><br /> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t You can use our unique open standard webservice to build your own integration or you can use one of our Chamilo-integration modules."
msgstr "Ibda tuża s-servizz Ephorus kontra l-plaġjariżmu f'Chamilo.<br /> 														<strong>Bl-Ephorus, tipprevjeni l-plaġjariżmu fuq l-internet mingħajr ebda sforz addizzjonali.</strong><br /> 														 Tista' tuża s-servizz web uniku tagħna b'istandard miftuħ biex tibni l-integrazzjoni tiegħek jew tista' tuża wieħed mill-moduli ta' integrazzjoni tagħna ma' Chamilo."

msgid "<strong>Leaders in <br />anti plagiarism </strong>\t\t\t\t"
msgstr "<strong>Mexxejja fil-<br />antiplagjariżmu</strong>\t\t\t\t"

msgid "Click here for more information and prices\t\t\t"
msgstr "Ikklikkja hawn għal aktar informazzjoni u prezzijiet\t\t\t"

msgid "This user isn't subscribed in a session"
msgstr "Dan l-utent mhuwiex irreġistrat f'sessjoni"

msgid "Display categories on home page"
msgstr "Uri l-kategoriji fuq il-paġna ewlenija"

msgid "This option will display or hide courses categories on the portal home page"
msgstr "Din l-għażla turi jew taħbi l-kategoriji tal-korsijiet fuq il-paġna ewlenija tal-portal"

msgid "Tabs in the header"
msgstr "Tabs fl-intestatura"

msgid "Check the tabs you want to see appear in the header. The unchecked tabs will appear on the right hand menu on the portal homepage and my courses page if these need to appear"
msgstr "Iċċekkja t-tabs li trid tara jidhru fl-intestatura. It-tabs mhux iċċekkjati jidhru fil-menu tal-lemin fuq il-paġna ewlenija tal-portal u l-paġna tal-korsijiet tiegħi jekk dawn ikollhom bżonn jidhru"

msgid "Default forum view"
msgstr "Dehra default tal-forum"

msgid "What should be the default option when creating a new forum. Any trainer can however choose a different view for every individual forum"
msgstr "X'għandha tkun l-għażla default meta jinħoloq forum ġdid. Kwalunkwe trainer jista' madankollu jagħżel dehra differenti għal kull forum individwali"

msgid "Courses tab"
msgstr "Tab tal-korsijiet"

msgid "Portal homepage tab"
msgstr "Tab tal-paġna ewlenija tal-portal"

msgid "Reporting tab"
msgstr "Tab tar-rapporti"

msgid "Platform Administration tab"
msgstr "Tab tal-Amministrazzjoni tal-Pjattaforma"

msgid "No course for this session"
msgstr "L-ebda kors għal din is-sessjoni"

msgid "No Users for this session"
msgstr "L-ebda Utenti għal din is-sessjoni"

msgid "The last name cannot be empty"
msgstr "Il-kunjom ma jistax ikun vojt"

msgid "The first name cannot be empty"
msgstr "L-isem ma jistax ikun vojt"

msgid "The email cannot be empty"
msgstr "L-email ma jistax ikun vojt"

msgid "Agenda tab"
msgstr "Tab tal-Aġenda"

msgid "The notice will be not displayed on the homepage"
msgstr "L-avviż mhux se jintwera fuq il-paġna ewlenija"

msgid "Let those fields empty to hide the notice"
msgstr "Ħalli dawk il-qasam vojta biex taħbi l-avviż"

msgid "The voice recording feature in the course editor relies on a Red5 streaming server. This server's parameters can be configured in the videoconference section on the current page."
msgstr "Il-karatteristika tar-reġistrazzjoni tal-vuċi fl-editur tal-kors tiddependi fuq server ta' streaming Red5. Il-parametri ta' dan is-server jistgħu jiġu kkonfigurati fis-sezzjoni tal-vidjokonferenza fuq il-paġna attwali."

msgid "Character set"
msgstr "Set ta' karattri"

msgid "The character set is what pilots the way specific languages can be displayed in Chamilo. If you use Russian or Japanese characters, for example, you might want to change this. For all english, latin and west-european characters, the default UTF-8 should be alright."
msgstr "Is-set ta' karattri huwa dak li jmexxi l-mod kif lingwi speċifiċi jistgħu jintwerew f'Chamilo. Jekk tuża karattri Russi jew Ġappuniżi, per eżempju, tista' trid tibdel dan. Għall-karattri Ingliżi, Latini u tal-Ewropa tal-Punent kollha, l-UTF-8 default għandu jkun tajjeb."

msgid "Portfolio fields at registration"
msgstr "Qasam tal-portafoll fir-reġistrazzjoni"

msgid "Which of the following fields of the portfolio have to be available in the user registration process? This requires that the portfolio option be enabled (see above)."
msgstr "Liema mill-qasam li ġejjin tal-portafoll għandhom ikunu disponibbli fil-proċess tar-reġistrazzjoni tal-utent? Dan jirrikjedi li l-għażla tal-portafoll tkun attivata (ara hawn fuq)."

msgid "Required portfolio fields in registration"
msgstr "Qasam tal-portafoll meħtieġ fir-reġistrazzjoni"

msgid "Which of the following fields of the portfolio are *required* in the user registration process? This requires that the portfolio option be enabled and that the field be also available in the registration form (see above)."
msgstr "Liema mill-qasam li ġejjin tal-portafoll huma *meħtieġa* fil-proċess tar-reġistrazzjoni tal-utent? Dan jirrikjedi li l-għażla tal-portafoll tkun attivata u li l-qasam ikun ukoll disponibbli fil-formola tar-reġistrazzjoni (ara hawn fuq)."

msgid "No-reply e-mail address"
msgstr "Indirizz tal-email bla tweġiba"

msgid "This is the e-mail address to be used when an e-mail has to be sent specifically requesting that no answer be sent in return. Generally, this e-mail address should be configured on your server to drop/ignore any incoming e-mail."
msgstr "Dan huwa l-indirizz tal-email li għandu jintuża meta email trid tintbagħat speċifikament titlob li l-ebda tweġiba ma tintbagħat lura. Ġeneralment, dan l-indirizz tal-email għandu jkun ikkonfigurat fuq is-server tiegħek biex iwaqqa'/jinjora kwalunkwe email li tidħol."

msgid "Survey e-mail sender (no-reply)"
msgstr "Mittent tal-email tal-istħarriġ (bla tweġiba)"

msgid "Should the survey invitations use the coach e-mail address or the no-reply address defined in the main configuration section?"
msgstr "L-istedinijiet tal-istħarriġ għandhom jużaw l-indirizz tal-email tal-coach jew l-indirizz bla tweġiba definit fis-sezzjoni tal-konfigurazzjoni ewlenija?"

msgid "Coach e-mail address"
msgstr "Indirizz tal-email tal-coach"

msgid "Enable the OpenID URL-based authentication (displays an additional login form on the homepage)"
msgstr "Attiva l-awtentikazzjoni bbażata fuq URL OpenID (turi formola ta' login addizzjonali fuq il-paġna ewlenija)"

msgid "Version check enabled"
msgstr "Iċċekkjar tal-verżjoni attivat"

msgid "The main/install directory of your Chamilo system is still accessible to web users. This might represent a security threat for your installation. We recommend that you remove this directory or that you change its permissions so web users cannot use the scripts it contains."
msgstr "Id-direttorju main/install tas-sistema Chamilo tiegħek għadu aċċessibbli għall-utenti tal-web. Dan jista' jirrappreżenta theddida għas-sigurtà għall-installazzjoni tiegħek. Nirrakkomandaw li tneħħi dan id-direttorju jew li tibdel il-permessi tiegħu sabiex l-utenti tal-web ma jkunux jistgħu jużaw l-iskripts li fih."

msgid "Assessments tool activation"
msgstr "Attivazzjoni tal-għodda tal-Valutazzjonijiet"

msgid "The Assessments tool allows you to assess competences in your organization by merging classroom and online activities evaluations into Performance reports. Do you want to activate it?"
msgstr "L-għodda tal-Valutazzjonijiet tippermettilek tivvaluta l-kompetenzi fl-organizzazzjoni tiegħek billi tgħaqqad il-valutazzjonijiet tal-attivitajiet fil-klassi u online f'rapporti tal-Prestazzjoni. Trid tattivaha?"

msgid "Theme (stylesheet)"
msgstr "Tema (stylesheet)"

msgid "User theme selection"
msgstr "Għażla tat-tema tal-utent"

msgid "Allow users to select their own visual theme in their profile. This will change the look of Chamilo for them, but will leave the default style of the portal intact. If a specific course or session has a specific theme assigned, it will have priority over user-defined themes."
msgstr "Ħalli l-utenti jagħżlu t-tema viżwali tagħhom stess fil-profil tagħhom. Dan se jibdel id-dehra ta' Chamilo għalihom, iżda jħalli l-istil default tal-portal intatt. Jekk kors jew sessjoni speċifika għandha tema speċifika assenjata, din se jkollha prijorità fuq it-temi definiti mill-utent."

msgid "Videoconference streaming server hostname or IP address"
msgstr "Hostname jew indirizz IP tas-server tal-istreaming tal-vidjokonferenza"

msgid "Videoconference streaming server port"
msgstr "Port tas-server tal-istreaming tal-vidjokonferenza"

msgid "Videoconference streaming server password"
msgstr "Password tas-server tal-istreaming tal-vidjokonferenza"

