msgstr "Immarka l-kaxxa biex turi l-limitu superjuri tal-punteġġ"

msgid "Enable score's upper limit display"
msgstr "Attiva l-wiri tal-limitu superjuri tal-punteġġ"

msgid "Possible values"
msgstr "Valuri possibbli"

msgid "Only given for repetitive fields, split by semi-column (;)"
msgstr "Mogħti biss għal oqsma ripetittivi, separati b'punt u virgola (;)"

msgid "Date"
msgstr "Data"

msgid "Date and time"
msgstr "Data u ħin"

msgid "Adding a user field is very easy:<br />- pick a one-word, lowercase identifier,<br />- select a type,<br />- pick a text that should appear to the user (if you use an existing translated name like BirthDate or UserSex, it will automatically get translated to any language),<br />- if you picked a multiple type (radio, select, multiple select), provide the possible choices (again, it can make use of the language variables defined in Chamilo), split by semi-column characters,<br />- for text types, you can choose a default value.<br /><br />Once you're done, add the field and choose whether you want to make it visible and modifiable. Making it modifiable but not visible is useless."
msgstr "Iż-żieda ta' qasam tal-utent hija faċli ħafna:<br />- agħżel identifikatur ta' kelma waħda, b'ittri żgħar,<br />- agħżel tip,<br />- agħżel test li għandu jidher lill-utent (jekk tuża isem tradott eżistenti bħal BirthDate jew UserSex, dan jiġi tradott awtomatikament għal kwalunkwe lingwa),<br />- jekk għażilt tip multiplu (radju, għażla, għażla multipla), ipprovdi l-għażliet possibbli (jistgħu wkoll jużaw il-varjabbli tal-lingwa definiti f'Chamilo), separati b'karattri ta' punt u virgola,<br />- għal tipi ta' test, tista' tagħżel valur awtomatiku.<br /><br />Ladarba tlesti, żid il-qasam u agħżel jekk tridx tagħmlu viżibbli u modifikabbli. Li tagħmlu modifikabbli iżda mhux viżibbli huwa inutli."

msgid "Allow course themes"
msgstr "Ħalli temi tal-kors"

msgid "Allows course graphical themes and makes it possible to change the style sheet used by a course to any of the possible style sheets available to Chamilo. When a user enters the course, the style sheet of the course will have priority over the user's own style sheet and the platform's default style sheet."
msgstr "Jippermetti temi grafiċi tal-kors u jagħmel possibbli li jinbidel il-folju tal-istil użat minn kors għal kwalunkwe wieħed mill-folji tal-istil disponibbli għal Chamilo. Meta utent jidħol fil-kors, il-folju tal-istil tal-kors ikollu prijorità fuq il-folju tal-istil tal-utent u l-folju tal-istil awtomatiku tal-pjattaforma."

msgid "Display the small month calendar in the agenda tool"
msgstr "Uri l-kalendarju żgħir tax-xahar fl-għodda tal-aġenda"

msgid "This setting enables or disables the small month calendar that appears in the left column of the agenda tool"
msgstr "Din l-issettjar tippermetti jew tiddiżattiva l-kalendarju żgħir tax-xahar li jidher fil-kolonna tax-xellug tal-għodda tal-aġenda"

msgid "Display the upcoming events in the agenda tool"
msgstr "Uri l-avvenimenti li ġejjin fl-għodda tal-aġenda"

msgid "This setting enables or disables the upcoming events that appears in the left column of the agenda tool of the course"
msgstr "Din l-issettjar tippermetti jew tiddiżattiva l-avvenimenti li ġejjin li jidhru fil-kolonna tax-xellug tal-għodda tal-aġenda tal-kors"

msgid "Number of upcoming events that have to be displayed."
msgstr "Numru ta' avvenimenti li ġejjin li għandhom jintwerew."

msgid "The number of upcoming events that have to be displayed in the agenda. This requires that the upcoming event functionlity is activated (see setting above)."
msgstr "In-numru ta' avvenimenti li ġejjin li għandhom jintwerew fl-aġenda. Dan jirrikjedi li l-funzjonalità tal-avvenimenti li ġejjin tkun attivata (ara l-issettjar hawn fuq)."

msgid "Display closed courses on login page and portal start page?"
msgstr "Uri korsijiet magħluqa fil-paġna tal-login u fil-paġna tal-bidu tal-portal?"

msgid "Display closed courses on the login page and courses start page? On the portal start page an icon will appear next to the courses to quickly subscribe to each courses. This will only appear on the portal's start page when the user is logged in and when the user is not subscribed to the portal yet."
msgstr "Uri korsijiet magħluqa fil-paġna tal-login u fil-paġna tal-bidu tal-korsijiet? Fil-paġna tal-bidu tal-portal jidher ikona ħdejn il-korsijiet biex tissabbona malajr għal kull kors. Dan jidher biss fil-paġna tal-bidu tal-portal meta l-utent ikun illoggjat u meta l-utent għadu ma ssabbonax għall-portal."

msgid "LDAP Connection Error"
msgstr "Żball fil-Konnessjoni LDAP"

msgid "LDAP"
msgstr "LDAP"

msgid "Enable LDAP"
msgstr "Attiva LDAP"

msgid "If you have an LDAP server, you will have to configure its settings below and modify your configuration file as described in the installation guide, and then activate it. This will allow users to authenticate using their LDAP logins. If you don't know what LDAP is, please leave it disabled"
msgstr "Jekk għandek server LDAP, ikollok tikkonfigura l-issettjar tiegħu hawn taħt u timmodifika l-fajl tal-konfigurazzjoni tiegħek kif deskritt fil-gwida tal-installazzjoni, u mbagħad tattivah. Dan jippermetti lill-utenti jidentifikaw ruħhom billi jużaw il-login LDAP tagħhom. Jekk ma tafx x'inhu LDAP, ħallih diżattivat"

msgid "Main LDAP server address"
msgstr "Indirizz tas-server LDAP prinċipali"

msgid "The IP address or url of your main LDAP server."
msgstr "L-indirizz IP jew l-URL tas-server LDAP prinċipali tiegħek."

msgid "Main LDAP server's port."
msgstr "Port tas-server LDAP prinċipali."

msgid "The port on which the main LDAP server will respond (usually 389). This is a mandatory setting."
msgstr "Il-port li fuqu s-server LDAP prinċipali jirrispondi (normalment 389). Dan huwa setting obbligatorju."

msgid "LDAP domain"
msgstr "Dominju LDAP"

msgid "This is the LDAP domain (dc) that will be used to find the contacts on the LDAP server. For example: dc=xx, dc=yy, dc=zz"
msgstr "Dan huwa d-dominju LDAP (dc) li jintuża biex jinstabu l-kuntatti fuq is-server LDAP. Per eżempju: dc=xx, dc=yy, dc=zz"

msgid "Replicate server address"
msgstr "Indirizz tas-server replikat"

msgid "When the main server is not available, this server will be accessed. Leave blank or use the same value as the main server if you don't have a replicate server."
msgstr "Meta s-server prinċipali ma jkunx disponibbli, dan is-server jiġi aċċessat. Ħalli vojt jew uża l-istess valur bħas-server prinċipali jekk m'għandekx server replikat."

msgid "Replicate server's port"
msgstr "Port tas-server replikat"

msgid "The port on which the replicate server will respond."
msgstr "Il-port li fuqu s-server replikat jirrispondi."

msgid "Search term"
msgstr "Termini tat-tiftix"

msgid "This term will be used to filter the search for contacts on the LDAP server. If you are unsure what to put in here, please refer to your LDAP server's documentation and configuration."
msgstr "Dan it-terminu jintuża biex jiffiltra t-tiftix għall-kuntatti fuq is-server LDAP. Jekk m'intix ċert x'għandek tpoġġi hawn, jekk jogħġbok irreferi għad-dokumentazzjoni u l-konfigurazzjoni tas-server LDAP tiegħek."

msgid "LDAP version"
msgstr "Verżjoni LDAP"

msgid "Please select the version of the LDAP server you want to use. Using the right version depends on your LDAP server's configuration."
msgstr "Jekk jogħġbok agħżel il-verżjoni tas-server LDAP li trid tuża. L-użu tal-verżjoni t-tajba jiddependi mill-konfigurazzjoni tas-server LDAP tiegħek."

msgid "LDAP 2"
msgstr "LDAP 2"

msgid "LDAP 3"
msgstr "LDAP 3"

msgid "Tutor identification field"
msgstr "Qasam tal-identifikazzjoni tat-tutor"

msgid "A check will be done on this LDAP contact field on new users insertion. If this field is not empty, the user will be considered as a tutor and inserted in Chamilo as such. If you want all your users to be recognised as simple users, leave this field empty. You can modify this behaviour by changing the code. Please read the <a href=\"../../documentation/installation_guide.html\">installation guide</a> for more information."
msgstr "Se ssir verifika fuq dan il-qasam tal-kuntatt LDAP meta jiddaħħlu utenti ġodda. Jekk dan il-qasam mhux vojt, l-utent jitqies bħala tutor u jiddaħħal f'Chamilo bħala tali. Jekk trid li l-utenti kollha tiegħek jiġu rikonoxxuti bħala utenti sempliċi, ħalli dan il-qasam vojt. Tista' tibdel dan l-imġiba billi tibdel il-kodiċi. Jekk jogħġbok aqra l-<a href=\"../../documentation/installation_guide.html\">gwida tal-installazzjoni</a> għal aktar informazzjoni."

msgid "Authentication login"
msgstr "Login tal-awtentikazzjoni"

msgid "If you are using an LDAP server that does not support or accept anonymous access, fill the following field with the user login that should be used. Do not include \"cn=\". Leave empty for anonymous access."
msgstr "Jekk qed tuża server LDAP li ma jappoġġjax jew ma jaċċettax aċċess anonimu, imla l-qasam li jmiss bil-login tal-utent li għandu jintuża. Tinkludix \"cn=\". Ħalli vojt għall-aċċess anonimu."

msgid "Authentication password"
msgstr "Password tal-awtentikazzjoni"

msgid "If you are using an LDAP server that does not support or accept anonymous access, fill the following field with the user password that should be used."
msgstr "Jekk qed tuża server LDAP li ma jappoġġjax jew ma jaċċettax aċċess anonimu, imla l-qasam li jmiss bil-password tal-utent li għandu jintuża."

