msgstr "Aqra t-Termini u l-Kundizzjonijiet"

msgid "I have read and I accept the Terms and Conditions"
msgstr "Qrajt u naċċetta t-Termini u l-Kundizzjonijiet"

msgid "You have to accept our Terms and Conditions to proceed."
msgstr "Trid taċċetta t-Termini u l-Kundizzjonijiet tagħna biex tipproċedi."

msgid "Your request for a new course has been sent successfully. You may receive a reply soon, within one or two days."
msgstr "It-talba tiegħek għal kors ġdid intbagħtet b'suċċess. Tista' tirċievi tweġiba dalwaqt, fi żmien ġurnata jew tnejn."

msgid "Review incoming course requests"
msgstr "Irrevedi t-talbiet għal korsijiet li ġejjin"

msgid "Accepted course requests"
msgstr "Talbiet għal korsijiet aċċettati"

msgid "Rejected course requests"
msgstr "Talbiet għal korsijiet miċħuda"

msgid "Create this course request"
msgstr "Oħloq din it-talba għal kors"

msgid "Request date"
msgstr "Data tat-talba"

msgid "Accept this course"
msgstr "Aċċetta dan il-kors"

msgid "A new course %s is going to be created. Is it OK to proceed?"
msgstr "Kors ġdid %s se jinħoloq. Tkompli?"

msgid "Additional information about %s course request is going to be asked through an e-mail message. Is it OK to proceed?"
msgstr "Informazzjoni addizzjonali dwar it-talba għall-kors %s se tintalab permezz ta' messaġġ bl-email. Tkompli?"

msgid "Ask for additional information"
msgstr "Itlob informazzjoni addizzjonali"

msgid "Your browser does not support SVG files. To use the drawing tool you must have an advanced browser such as Firefox or Chrome"
msgstr "Il-brawżer tiegħek ma jappoġġjax fajls SVG. Biex tuża l-għodda tad-disinn trid ikollok brawżer avvanzat bħal Firefox jew Chrome"

msgid "Browscap loading browscap.ini file that contains a large amount of data on the browser and its capabilities, so it can be used by the function get_browser () PHP"
msgstr "Browscap qed jittella' l-fajl browscap.ini li fih ammont kbir ta' data dwar il-brawżer u l-kapaċitajiet tiegħu, sabiex jista' jintuża mill-funzjoni get_browser() ta' PHP"

msgid "Delete this course request"
msgstr "Ħassar din it-talba għall-kors"

msgid "The course request %s is going to be deleted. Is it OK to proceed?"
msgstr "It-talba għall-kors %s se titħassar. Trid tipproċedi?"

msgid "Reject this course request"
msgstr "Irrifjuta din it-talba għall-kors"

msgid "The course request %s is going to be rejected. Is it OK to proceed?"
msgstr "It-talba għall-kors %s se tiġi rrifjutata. Trid tipproċedi?"

msgid "The course request %s has been accepted. A new course %s has been created."
msgstr "It-talba għall-kors %s ġiet aċċettata. Ġie maħluq kors ġdid %s."

msgid "The course request %s has not been accepted due to internal error."
msgstr "It-talba għall-kors %s ma ġietx aċċettata minħabba żball intern."

msgid "The course request %s has been rejected."
msgstr "It-talba għall-kors %s ġiet irrifjutata."

msgid "The course request %s has not been rejected due to internal error."
msgstr "It-talba għall-kors %s ma ġietx irrifjutata minħabba żball intern."

msgid "Additional information about the course request %s has been asked."
msgstr "Ġiet mitluba informazzjoni addizzjonali dwar it-talba għall-kors %s."

msgid "Additional information about the course request %s has not been asked due to internal error."
msgstr "Informazzjoni addizzjonali dwar it-talba għall-kors %s ma ġietx mitluba minħabba żball intern."

msgid "The course request %s has been deleted."
msgstr "It-talba għall-kors %s ġiet imħassra."

msgid "The course request %s has not been deleted due to internal error."
msgstr "It-talba għall-kors %s ma ġietx imħassra minħabba żball intern."

msgid "Delete selected course request(s)"
msgstr "Ħassar it-talbiet magħżula għall-kors(i)"

msgid "The selected course requests have been deleted."
msgstr "It-talbiet magħżula għall-kors ġew imħassra."

msgid "Some of the selected course requests have not been deleted due to internal error."
msgstr "Xi wħud mit-talbiet magħżula għall-kors ma ġewx imħassra minħabba żball intern."

msgid "%s A request for a new course %s"
msgstr "%s Talba għal kors ġdid %s"

msgid "We registered the following request for a new course:"
msgstr "Irreġistrajna t-talba li ġejja għal kors ġdid:"

msgid "This course request can be approved on the following page:"
msgstr "Din it-talba għall-kors tista' tiġi approvata fil-paġna li ġejja:"

msgid "The \"Course validation\" feature is not enabled at the moment. In order to use this feature, please, enable it by using the  %s setting."
msgstr "Il-karatteristika \"Validazzjoni tal-kors\" mhix attivata bħalissa. Biex tuża din il-karatteristika, jekk jogħġbok, attivaha billi tuża s-settings %s."

msgid "The information about this course request is considered protected; it can be used only to open a new course within our e-learning portal; it should not be revealed to third parties."
msgstr "L-informazzjoni dwar din it-talba għall-kors titqies protetta; tista' tintuża biss biex tiftaħ kors ġdid fil-portal tal-e-learning tagħna; m'għandhiex tiġi żvelata lil terzi persuni."

msgid "Courses validation"
msgstr "Validazzjoni tal-korsijiet"

msgid "When the 'Courses validation' feature is enabled, a teacher is not able to create a course alone. He/she fills a course request. The platform administrator reviews the request and approves it or rejects it.<br />This feature relies on automated e-mail messaging; set Chamilo to access an e-mail server and to use a dedicated an e-mail account."
msgstr "Meta l-karatteristika 'Validazzjoni tal-korsijiet' tkun attivata, għalliem ma jkunx jista' joħloq kors waħdu. Huwa/hija jimla talba għall-kors. L-amministratur tal-pjattaforma jirrevedi t-talba u japprovaha jew jirrifjutaha.<br />Din il-karatteristika tiddependi fuq messaġġi awtomatiċi tal-email; issettja Chamilo biex jaċċessa server tal-email u juża kont tal-email iddedikat."

msgid "%s A request for additional information about the course request %s"
msgstr "%s Talba għal informazzjoni addizzjonali dwar it-talba għall-kors %s"

msgid "We have received your request for a new course with code %s. Before we consider it for approval, we need some additional information.\n\nPlease, provide brief information about the course content (description), the objectives, the learners or the users that are to be involved in the proposed course. If it is applicable, mention the name of the institution or the unit on which behalf you made the course request."
msgstr "Irċevejna t-talba tiegħek għal kors ġdid bil-kodiċi %s. Qabel ma nikkunsidrawha għall-approvazzjoni, għandna bżonn xi informazzjoni addizzjonali.\n\nJekk jogħġbok, ipprovdi informazzjoni qasira dwar il-kontenut tal-kors (deskrizzjoni), l-għanijiet, l-istudenti jew l-utenti li se jkunu involuti fil-kors propost. Jekk ikun applikabbli, semmi l-isem tal-istituzzjoni jew l-unità li għaliha għamilt it-talba għall-kors."

msgid "%s The course request %s has been approved"
msgstr "%s It-talba għall-kors %s ġiet approvata"

msgid "Your course request %s has been approved. A new course %s has been created and you are registered in it as a teacher.\n\nYou can access your newly created course from: %s"
msgstr "It-talba tiegħek għall-kors %s ġiet approvata. Kors ġdid %s ġie maħluq u int irreġistrat fih bħala għalliem.\n\nTista' taċċessa l-kors li għadek kif ħloqt minn: %s"

msgid "%s The course request %s has been rejected"
msgstr "%s It-talba għall-kors %s ġiet irrifjutata"

msgid "To our regret we have to inform you that your course request %s has been rejected due to not fulfilling the requirements of our Terms and Conditions."
msgstr "Għal dispjaċir tagħna rridu ninfurmawk li t-talba tiegħek għall-kors %s ġiet irrifjutata minħabba li ma tissodisfax ir-rekwiżiti tat-Termini u l-Kundizzjonijiet tagħna."

msgid "Course validation - a link to the terms and conditions"
msgstr "Validazzjoni tal-kors - link għat-termini u l-kundizzjonijiet"

msgid "This is the URL to the 'Terms and Conditions' document that is valid for making a course request. If the address is set here, the user should read and agree with these terms and conditions before sending a course request.<br />If you enable Chamilo's 'Terms and Conditions' module and if you want its URL to be used, then leave this setting empty."
msgstr "Dan huwa l-URL għad-dokument 'Termini u Kundizzjonijiet' li huwa validu biex tagħmel talba għall-kors. Jekk l-indirizz ikun issettjat hawn, l-utent għandu jaqra u jaqbel ma' dawn it-termini u l-kundizzjonijiet qabel ma jibgħat talba għall-kors.<br />Jekk tattiva l-modulu 'Termini u Kundizzjonijiet' ta' Chamilo u trid li l-URL tiegħu jintuża, allura ħalli din is-settings vojta."

msgid "The course has not been created due to an internal error."
msgstr "Il-kors ma ġiex maħluq minħabba żball intern."

msgid "The course request has not been created due to an internal error."
msgstr "It-talba għall-kors ma ġietx maħluqa minħabba żball intern."

msgid "Edit a course request"
msgstr "Editja talba għall-kors"

msgid "The course request you wanted to access has not been found or it does not exist."
msgstr "It-talba għall-kors li ridt taċċessa ma nstabitx jew ma teżistix."

msgid "This file name already exists, choose another to save your image."
msgstr "Dan l-isem tal-fajl diġà jeżisti, agħżel ieħor biex tissejvja l-immaġni tiegħek."

msgid "The course request %s has not been updated due to internal error."
msgstr "It-talba għall-kors %s ma ġietx aġġornata minħabba żball intern."

msgid "The course request %s has been updated."
msgstr "It-talba għall-kors %s ġiet aġġornata."

msgid "Fill with demo content"
msgstr "Imli b'kontenut demo"

msgid "Single Sign On"
msgstr "Single Sign On"

msgid "Enabling Single Sign On allows you to connect this platform as a slave of an authentication master, for example a Drupal website with the Drupal-Chamilo plugin or any other similar master setup."
msgstr "L-attivazzjoni ta' Single Sign On tippermettilek tikkonnettja din il-pjattaforma bħala slave ta' master tal-awtentikazzjoni, pereżempju websajt Drupal bil-plugin Drupal-Chamilo jew kwalunkwe setup master simili ieħor."

msgid "Domain of the Single Sign On server"
msgstr "Dominju tas-server Single Sign On"

msgid "The domain of the Single Sign On server (the web address of the other server that will allow automatic registration to Chamilo). This should generally be the address of the other server without any trailing slash and without the protocol, e.g. www.example.com"
msgstr "Id-dominju tas-server Single Sign On (l-indirizz web tas-server l-ieħor li jippermetti reġistrazzjoni awtomatika għal Chamilo). Dan ġeneralment għandu jkun l-indirizz tas-server l-ieħor mingħajr slash finali u mingħajr il-protokoll, eż. www.example.com"

msgid "Single Sign On server authentication URL"
msgstr "URL tal-awtentikazzjoni tas-server Single Sign On"

msgid "The address of the page that deals with the authentication verification. For example /?q=user in Drupal's case."
msgstr "L-indirizz tal-paġna li tittratta l-verifika tal-awtentikazzjoni. Pereżempju /?q=user fil-każ ta' Drupal."

msgid "Single Sign On server's logout URL"
msgstr "URL tal-logout tas-server Single Sign On"

msgid "The address of the page on the server that logs the user out. This option is useful if you want users logging out of Chamilo to be automatically logged out of the authentication server."
msgstr "L-indirizz tal-paġna fuq is-server li joħroġ lill-utent. Din l-għażla hija utli jekk trid li l-utenti li joħorġu minn Chamilo jiġu awtomatikament imħassra mis-server tal-awtentikazzjoni."

msgid "Single Sign On server's protocol"
msgstr "Protokoll tas-server Single Sign On"

msgid "The protocol string to prefix the Single Sign On server's domain (we recommend you use https:// if your server is able to provide this feature, as all non-secure protocols are dangerous for authentication matters)"
msgstr "Il-katina tal-protokoll biex tipprefissa d-dominju tas-server Single Sign On (nirrakkomandaw li tuża https:// jekk is-server tiegħek jista' jipprovdi din il-karatteristika, peress li l-protokolli mhux siguri huma perikolużi għall-kwistjonijiet tal-awtentikazzjoni)"

msgid "WIRIS mathematical editor"
msgstr "Editur matematiku WIRIS"

msgid "Enable WIRIS mathematical editor. Installing this plugin you get WIRIS editor and WIRIS CAS.<br/>This activation is not fully realized unless it has been previously downloaded the <a href='http://www.wiris.com/es/plugins3/ckeditor/download' target='_blank'>PHP plugin for CKeditor WIRIS</a> and unzipped its contents in the Chamilo's directory main/inc/lib/javascript/ckeditor/plugins/.<br/>This is necessary because Wiris is proprietary software and his services are <a href='http://www.wiris.com/store/who-pays' target='_blank'>commercial</a>. To make adjustments to the plugin, edit configuration.ini file or replace his content by the file configuration.ini.default shipped with Chamilo."
msgstr "Attiva l-editur matematiku WIRIS. Billi tinstalla dan il-plugin tikseb l-editur WIRIS u WIRIS CAS.<br/>Din l-attivazzjoni ma titwettaqx għal kollox sakemm ma tkunx diġà niżżilt il-<a href='http://www.wiris.com/es/plugins3/ckeditor/download' target='_blank'>plugin PHP għal CKeditor WIRIS</a> u żżippajt il-kontenut tiegħu fid-direttorju ta' Chamilo main/inc/lib/javascript/ckeditor/plugins/.<br/>Dan huwa meħtieġ minħabba li Wiris huwa softwer proprjetarju u s-servizzi tiegħu huma <a href='http://www.wiris.com/store/who-pays' target='_blank'>kummerċjali</a>. Biex tagħmel aġġustamenti għall-plugin, editja l-fajl configuration.ini jew ibdel il-kontenut tiegħu bil-fajl configuration.ini.default li jiġi ma' Chamilo."

msgid "File export as"
msgstr "Esporta fajl bħala"

msgid "Spell check"
msgstr "Kontroll tal-ortografija"

msgid "Enable spell check"
msgstr "Attiva l-kontroll tal-ortografija"

msgid "Create and edit SVG files"
msgstr "Oħloq u editja fajls SVG"

msgid "This option allows you to create and edit SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics) multilayer online, as well as export them to png format images."
msgstr "Din l-għażla tippermettilek toħloq u teditja SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics) b'ħafna saffi online, kif ukoll tesportahom f'immaġnijiet format png."

msgid "Forcing pasting as plain text in the wiki"
msgstr "Tħeġġeġ l-inkullar bħala test sempliċi fil-wiki"

msgid "This will prevent many hidden tags, incorrect or non-standard, copied from other texts to stop corrupting the text of the Wiki after many issues; but will lose some features while editing."
msgstr "Dan se jipprevjeni ħafna tags moħbija, żbaljati jew mhux standard, ikkuppjati minn testi oħra milli jħassru t-test tal-Wiki wara ħafna problemi; iżda se jintilfu xi karatteristiċi waqt l-editjar."

msgid "Activate Google maps"
msgstr "Attiva mapep Google"

msgid "Activate the button to insert Google maps. Activation is not fully realized if not previously edited the file main/inc/lib/fckeditor/myconfig.php and added a Google maps API key."
msgstr "Attiva l-buttun biex tiddaħħal mapep Google. L-attivazzjoni ma titwettaqx għal kollox jekk ma tkunx editjat qabel il-fajl main/inc/lib/fckeditor/myconfig.php u miżjud ċavetta API tal-mapep Google."

msgid "Activate Image maps"
msgstr "Attiva mapep tal-immaġni"

msgid "Activate the button to insert Image maps. This allows you to associate URLs to areas of an image, creating hotspots."
msgstr "Attiva l-buttuna biex tiddaħħal mapep tal-immaġni. Dan jippermetti li tgħaqqad URLs ma' żoni ta' immaġni, u toħloq hotspots."

msgid "Clean search results"
msgstr "Naddaf ir-riżultati tat-tfittxija"

msgid "Exercise can't be edited after being added to the Learning Path"
msgstr "L-eżerċizzju ma jistax jiġi editjat wara li jkun ġie miżjud fil-Mogħdija tat-Tagħlim"

msgid "Course tool"
msgstr "Għodda tal-kors"

msgid "Results of learning paths exercises by session"
msgstr "Riżultati tal-eżerċizzji tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim skont is-sessjoni"

msgid "Learning paths exercises results list"
msgstr "Lista tar-riżultati tal-eżerċizzji tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "Please select a course"
msgstr "Jekk jogħġbok agħżel kors"

msgid "Learner score average is calculated bases on all learning paths and all attempts"
msgstr "Il-medja tal-punteġġ tal-istudent tiġi kkalkulata abbażi tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim kollha u l-attentati kollha"

msgid "Average score"
msgstr "Medja tal-punteġġ"

msgid "Last connexion date"
msgstr "Data tal-aħħar konnessjoni"

msgid "Videoconference"
msgstr "Videokonferenza"

msgid "BigBlueButton videoconference tool"
msgstr "Għodda tal-videokonferenza BigBlueButton"

msgid "Choose whether you want to enable the BigBlueButton videoconference tool. Once enabled, it will show as an additional course tool in all courses' homepage, and teachers will be able to launch a conference at any time. Learners will not be able to launch a conference, only join one. If you don't have a BigBlueButton server, please <a href=\"http://bigbluebutton.org/\" target=\"_blank\">set one up</a> or ask the <a href=\"http://www.chamilo.org/en/providers\" target=\"_blank\">Chamilo official providers</a> for a quote."
msgstr "Agħżel jekk tridx tippermetti l-għodda tal-videokonferenza BigBlueButton. Ladarba tkun attivata, tidher bħala għodda addizzjonali tal-kors fil-homepage tal-korsijiet kollha, u l-għalliema jkunu jistgħu jibdew konferenza fi kwalunkwe ħin. L-istudenti ma jkunux jistgħu jibdew konferenza, iżda biss jissieħbu f'waħda. Jekk m'għandekx server BigBlueButton, jekk jogħġbok <a href=\"http://bigbluebutton.org/\" target=\"_blank\">waqqaf wieħed</a> jew itlob kwotazzjoni mingħand <a href=\"http://www.chamilo.org/en/providers\" target=\"_blank\">il-fornituri uffiċjali ta' Chamilo</a>."

msgid "BigBlueButton server host"
msgstr "Host tas-server BigBlueButton"

msgid "This is the name of the server where your BigBlueButton server is running. Might be <i>localhost</i>, an IP address (e.g. 192.168.13.54) or a domain name (e.g. my.video.com)."
msgstr "Dan huwa l-isem tas-server fejn qed jaħdem is-server BigBlueButton tiegħek. Jista' jkun <i>localhost</i>, indirizz IP (eż. 192.168.13.54) jew isem tad-dominju (eż. my.video.com)."

msgid "Security key of the BigBlueButton server"
msgstr "Ċavetta tas-sigurtà tas-server BigBlueButton"

msgid "This is the security key of your BigBlueButton server, which will allow your server to authentify the Chamilo installation. Refer to the BigBlueButton documentation to locate it."
msgstr "Din hija ċ-ċavetta tas-sigurtà tas-server BigBlueButton tiegħek, li tippermetti lis-server tiegħek jivverifika l-installazzjoni ta' Chamilo. Irreferi għad-dokumentazzjoni ta' BigBlueButton biex issibha."

msgid "Select a picture (SVG, PNG)"
msgstr "Agħżel stampa (SVG, PNG)"

msgid "Only accessible from your group"
msgstr "Aċċessibbli biss mill-grupp tiegħek"

msgid "This will create a special wiki page in which the teacher can describe the task and which will be automatically linked to the wiki pages where learners perform the task. Both the teacher's and the learners' pages are created automatically. In these tasks, learners can only edit and view theirs pages, but this can be changed easily if you need to."
msgstr "Dan joħloq paġna wiki speċjali fejn l-għalliem jista' jiddeskrivi l-kompitu u li tkun marbuta awtomatikament mal-paġni wiki fejn l-istudenti jwettqu l-kompitu. Kemm il-paġni tal-għalliem kif ukoll dawk tal-istudenti jinħolqu awtomatikament. F'dawn il-kompiti, l-istudenti jistgħu jeditjaw u jaraw biss il-paġni tagħhom, iżda dan jista' jinbidel faċilment jekk ikun meħtieġ."

msgid "Folders of users"
msgstr "Folders tal-utenti"

msgid "User folder"
msgstr "Folder tal-utent"

msgid "INFORMATION VISIBLE TO THE TEACHER ONLY:\nThe users folder contains a folder for each user who has accessed it through the documents tool, or when any file has been sent in the course through the online editor. If neither circumstances has occurred, then no user folder will have been created. In the case of groups, files that are sent through the editor will be added in the folder of each group, which is only accessible by students from this group."
msgstr "INFORMAZZJONI VIŻIBBLI LILL-GĦALLIEMA BISS:\nIl-folder tal-utenti fih folder għal kull utent li aċċessaha permezz tal-għodda tad-dokumenti, jew meta xi fajl ikun intbagħat fil-kors permezz tal-editur online. Jekk l-ebda waħda minn dawn iċ-ċirkostanzi ma seħħet, allura l-ebda folder tal-utent ma jkun ġie maħluq. Fil-każ ta' gruppi, fajls li jintbagħtu permezz tal-editur jiżdiedu fil-folder ta' kull grupp, li huwa aċċessibbli biss mill-istudenti ta' dan il-grupp."

msgid "INFORMATION VISIBLE TO THE TEACHER ONLY:\nThis folder contains all sessions that have been opened in the chat. Although the chat sessions can often be trivial, others can be really interesting and worthy of being incorporated as an additional work document. To do this without changing the visibility of this folder, make the file visible and link it from where you deem appropriate. It is not recommended to make this folder visible to all."
msgstr "INFORMAZZJONI VIŻIBBLI LILL-GĦALLIEMA BISS:\nDan il-folder fih is-sessjonijiet kollha tal-chat li nfetħu. Għalkemm is-sessjonijiet tal-chat ħafna drabi jkunu trivjali, oħrajn jistgħu jkunu interessanti ħafna u jistħoqqilhom jiġu inkorporati bħala dokument ta' xogħol addizzjonali. Biex tagħmel dan mingħajr ma tibdel il-viżibilità ta' dan il-folder, agħmel il-fajl viżibbli u rabtu minn fejn tqis xieraq. Mhuwiex rakkomandat li tagħmel dan il-folder viżibbli għal kulħadd."

msgid "INFORMATION VISIBLE TO THE TEACHER ONLY:\nThis folder contains the various certificates templates that have been created for the rating tool. It is not recommended to make this folder visible to all."
msgstr "INFORMAZZJONI VIŻIBBLI LILL-GĦALLIEMA BISS:\nDan il-folder fih it-templati varji taċ-ċertifikati li ġew maħluqa għall-għodda tal-valutazzjoni. Mhuwiex rakkomandat li tagħmel dan il-folder viżibbli għal kulħadd."

msgid "Destination folder"
msgstr "Folder tad-destinazzjoni"

msgid "Chat conversations history"
msgstr "Storja tal-konversazzjonijiet tal-chat"

msgid "Flash"
msgstr "Flash"

msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

msgid "Images"
msgstr "Immaġnijiet"

msgid "Upload corrections"
msgstr "Tella' korrezzjonijiet"

msgid "Enable online services for text to speech conversion"
msgstr "Attiva servizzi online għall-konverżjoni minn test għal diskors"

msgid "Online tool to convert text to speech. Uses speech synthesis technology to generate audio files saved into your course."
msgstr "Għodda online biex tikkonverti test għal diskors. Tuża teknoloġija ta' sinteżi tal-kelma biex tiġġenera fajls awdjo ssejvjati fil-kors tiegħek."

msgid "Show users folders in the documents tool"
msgstr "Uri folders tal-utenti fl-għodda tad-dokumenti"

msgid "This option allows you to show or hide to teachers the folders that the system generates for each user who visits the tool documents or send a file through the web editor. If you display these folders to the teachers, they may make visible or not the learners and allow each learner to have a specific place on the course where not only store documents, but where they can also create and edit web pages and to export to pdf, make drawings, make personal web templates, send files, as well as create, move and delete directories and files and make security copies from their folders. Each user of course have a complete document manager. Also, remember that any user can copy a file that is visible from any folder in the documents tool (whether or not the owner) to his/her portfolios or personal documents area of social network, which will be available for his/her can use it in other courses."
msgstr "Din l-għażla tippermettilek turi jew taħbi lill-għalliema l-folders li s-sistema tiġġenera għal kull utent li jżur l-għodda tad-dokumenti jew jibgħat fajl permezz tal-editur tal-web. Jekk turi dawn il-folders lill-għalliema, huma jistgħu jagħmlu viżibbli jew le lill-istudenti u jippermettu lil kull student ikollu post speċifiku fil-kors fejn mhux biss jaħżnu dokumenti, iżda wkoll fejn jistgħu joħolqu u jeditjaw paġni tal-web u jesportaw għal pdf, jagħmlu tpinġijiet, joħolqu templates tal-web personali, jibagħtu fajls, kif ukoll joħolqu, jimxu u jħassru direttorji u fajls u jagħmlu kopji ta' sigurtà mill-folders tagħhom. Kull utent tal-kors għandu maniġer tad-dokumenti komplut. Ukoll, ftakar li kwalunkwe utent jista' jikkopja fajl li huwa viżibbli minn kwalunkwe folder fl-għodda tad-dokumenti (kemm jekk huwa s-sid jew le) għall-portfolios jew l-erja tad-dokumenti personali tan-netwerk soċjali tiegħu/tagħha, li tkun disponibbli biex jista' jużaha f'korsijiet oħra."

msgid "Show in documents tool all folders containing multimedia resources supplied by default"
msgstr "Uri fl-għodda tad-dokumenti l-folders kollha li fihom riżorsi multimedjali forniti b'mod awtomatiku"

msgid "Multimedia file folders containing files supplied by default organized in categories of video, audio, image and flash animations to use in their courses. Although you make it invisible into the document tool, you can still use these resources in the platform web editor."
msgstr "Folders tal-fajls multimedjali li fihom fajls forniti b'mod awtomatiku organizzati f'kategoriji ta' video, awdjo, immaġni u animazzjonijiet flash biex jintużaw fil-korsijiet tagħhom. Għalkemm tagħmilhom inviżibbli fl-għodda tad-dokumenti, xorta tista' tuża dawn ir-riżorsi fl-editur tal-web tal-pjattaforma."

