msgstr "Uża kors mudell għal korsijiet ġodda"

msgid "Set this to use the same template course (identified by its course numeric ID in the database) for all new courses that will be created on the platform. Please note that, if not properly planned, this setting might have a massive impact on space usage. The template course will be used as if the teacher did a copy of the course with the course backup tools, so no user content is copied, only teacher material. All other course-backup rules apply. Leave empty (or set to 0) to disable."
msgstr "Issettja dan biex tuża l-istess kors mudell (identifikat bl-ID numeriku tal-kors fid-database) għall-korsijiet kollha ġodda li se jinħolqu fuq il-pjattaforma. Jekk jogħġbok innota li, jekk ma jkunx ippjanat kif suppost, din l-issettjar jista' jkollu impatt kbir fuq l-użu tal-ispazju. Il-kors mudell se jintuża bħallikieku l-għalliem għamel kopja tal-kors bl-għodod tal-backup tal-kors, għalhekk ma jiġi kopjat l-ebda kontenut tal-utent, biss materjal tal-għalliem. Japplikaw ir-regoli l-oħra kollha tal-backup tal-kors. Ħalli vojt (jew issettja għal 0) biex tiddiżattiva."

msgid "Password strength checker"
msgstr "Kontroll tas-saħħa tal-password"

msgid "Enable this option to add a visual indicator of password strength, when the user changes his/her password. This will NOT prevent bad passwords to be added, it only acts as a visual helper."
msgstr "Attiva din l-għażla biex iżżid indikatur viżwali tas-saħħa tal-password, meta l-utent ibiddel il-password tiegħu/tagħha. Dan MA jipprevjenix passwords ħżiena milli jiżdiedu, iżda jaġixxi biss bħala għajnuna viżwali."

msgid "CAPTCHA"
msgstr "CAPTCHA"

msgid "Enable a CAPTCHA on the login form, inscription form and lost password form to avoid password hammering"
msgstr "Attiva CAPTCHA fuq il-formola tal-login, tal-iskrizzjoni u tal-password mitlufa biex tevita attakki fuq il-password"

msgid "CAPTCHA mistakes allowance"
msgstr "Numru ta' żbalji permessi fil-CAPTCHA"

msgid "The number of times a user can make a mistake on the CAPTCHA box before his account is locked out."
msgstr "In-numru ta' drabi li utent jista' jagħmel żball fil-kaxxa tal-CAPTCHA qabel ma l-kont tiegħu jiġi msakkar."

msgid "CAPTCHA account locking time"
msgstr "Ħin ta' qfil tal-kont wara CAPTCHA"

msgid "If the user reaches the maximum allowance for login mistakes (when using the CAPTCHA), his/her account will be locked for this number of minutes."
msgstr "Jekk l-utent jilħaq l-akbar numru ta' żbalji permessi fil-login (meta juża l-CAPTCHA), il-kont tiegħu/jew tagħha jiġi msakkar għal dan in-numru ta' minuti."

msgid "HR directors access all session content"
msgstr "Id-diretturi tar-Riżorsi Umani jkollhom aċċess għall-kontenut kollu tas-sessjonijiet"

msgid "If enabled, human resources directors will get access to all content and users from the sessions (s)he follows."
msgstr "Jekk attivat, id-diretturi tar-riżorsi umani jkollhom aċċess għall-kontenut u l-utenti kollha tas-sessjonijiet li jsegwu."

msgid "Display group forums in general forum"
msgstr "Uri l-forums tal-gruppi fil-forum ġenerali"

msgid "Display group forums in the forum tool at the course level. This option is enabled by default (in this case, group forum individual visibilities still act as an additional criteria). If disabled, group forums will only be visible through the group tool, be them public or not."
msgstr "Uri l-forums tal-gruppi fl-għodda tal-forum fil-livell tal-kors. Din l-għażla hija attivat b'mod awtomatiku (f'dan il-każ, il-viżibilità individwali tal-forums tal-gruppi tibqa' kriterju addizzjonali). Jekk diżattivat, il-forums tal-gruppi jkunu viżibbli biss permezz tal-għodda tal-gruppi, kemm jekk pubbliċi kif ukoll jekk le."

msgid "Tutors can assign students to sessions"
msgstr "Il-kowċis jistgħu jassenjaw studenti għas-sessjonijiet"

msgid "When enabled, course coaches/tutors in sessions can subscribe new users to their session. This option is otherwise only available to administrators and session administrators."
msgstr "Meta attivat, il-kowċis/tuturi tal-korsijiet fis-sessjonijiet jistgħu jirreġistraw utenti ġodda fis-sessjoni tagħhom. Din l-għażla hija disponibbli biss għall-amministraturi u l-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet."

msgid "Images will be resized (up or down) to 200x150 pixels. For a better rendering of the question, we recommend you upload only images of this size."
msgstr "L-immaġini jiġu ridimensjonati (ikbar jew iżgħar) għal 200x150 pixels. Għal riżultat aħjar tal-mistoqsija, nirrakkomandaw li ttella' biss immaġini ta' din id-daqs."

msgid "Show learning paths return link"
msgstr "Uri l-link tar-ritorn tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "Disable this option to hide the 'Return to homepage' button in the learning paths"
msgstr "Diżattiva din l-għażla biex taħbi l-buttuna 'Irritorna għall-homepage' fil-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "Hide SCORM Export"
msgstr "Aħbi l-esportazzjoni SCORM"

msgid "Hide the SCORM Export icon from the Learning Paths list"
msgstr "Aħbi l-ikona tal-Esportazzjoni SCORM mil-lista tal-Mogħdijiet tat-Tagħlim"

msgid "Hide SCORM Copy"
msgstr "Aħbi l-Kopja SCORM"

msgid "Hide the Learning Path Copy icon from the Learning Paths list"
msgstr "Aħbi l-ikona tal-Kopja tal-Mogħda tat-Tagħlim mil-lista tal-Mogħdijiet tat-Tagħlim"

msgid "Hide Learning Path PDF export"
msgstr "Aħbi l-esportazzjoni PDF tal-Mogħda tat-Tagħlim"

msgid "Hide the Learning Path PDF Export icon from the Learning Paths list"
msgstr "Aħbi l-ikona tal-Esportazzjoni PDF tal-Mogħda tat-Tagħlim mil-lista tal-Mogħdijiet tat-Tagħlim"

msgid "Default coach access days before session"
msgstr "Numru ta' ġranet ta' aċċess default għall-kowċ qabel is-sessjoni"

msgid "Default number of days a coach can access his session before the official session start date"
msgstr "Numru ta' ġranet default li kowċ jista' jaċċessa s-sessjoni tiegħu qabel id-data uffiċjali tal-bidu tas-sessjoni"

msgid "Default coach access days after session"
msgstr "Numru ta' ġranet ta' aċċess default għall-kowċ wara s-sessjoni"

msgid "Default number of days a coach can access his session after the official session end date"
msgstr "Numru ta' ġranet default li kowċ jista' jaċċessa s-sessjoni tiegħu wara d-data uffiċjali tat-tmiem tas-sessjoni"

msgid "PDF header logo"
msgstr "Logo tal-header tal-PDF"

msgid "Whether to use the image at var/themes/[your-theme]/images/pdf_logo_header.png as the PDF header logo for all PDF exports (instead of the normal portal logo)"
msgstr "Jekk tużax l-immaġni f'var/themes/[your-theme]/images/pdf_logo_header.png bħala l-logo tal-header tal-PDF għall-esportazzjonijiet PDF kollha (minflok il-logo normali tal-portal)"

msgid "Order users by official code"
msgstr "Ordna l-utenti skont il-kodiċi uffiċjali"

msgid "Use the 'official code' to sort most students list on the platform, instead of their lastname or firstname."
msgstr "Uża l-'kodiċi uffiċjali' biex issortja l-biċċa l-kbira tal-listi tal-istudenti fuq il-pjattaforma, minflok il-kunjom jew l-isem tagħhom."

msgid "Default e-mail alert setting on new quiz"
msgstr "Issettjar default ta' twissija bl-email għal quiz ġdid"

msgid "Whether you want course managers (teachers) to be notified by e-mail when a quiz is answered by a student. This is the default value to be given to all new courses, but each teacher can still change this setting in his/her own course."
msgstr "Jekk tridx li l-maniġers tal-korsijiet (għalliema) jiġu nnotifikati bl-email meta student iwieġeb quiz. Dan huwa l-valur default li jingħata lil korsijiet ġodda kollha, iżda kull għalliem jista' jibdel dan l-issettjar fil-kors tiegħu/tagħha."

msgid "Display official code in exercises results"
msgstr "Uri l-kodiċi uffiċjali fir-riżultati tal-eżerċizzji"

msgid "Whether to show the students' official code in the exercises results reports"
msgstr "Jekk turi l-kodiċi uffiċjali tal-istudenti fir-rapporti tar-riżultati tal-eżerċizzji"

msgid "Hide private courses from catalogue"
msgstr "Aħbi l-korsijiet privati mill-katalgu"

msgid "Whether to hide the private courses from the courses catalogue. This makes sense when you use the course catalogue mainly to allow students to auto-subscribe to the courses."
msgstr "Jekk taħbi l-korsijiet privati mill-katalgu tal-korsijiet. Dan jagħmel sens meta tuża l-katalgu tal-korsijiet prinċipalment biex tippermetti lill-istudenti jirreġistraw waħedhom fil-korsijiet."

msgid "Sessions and courses catalogue"
msgstr "Katalgu tas-sessjonijiet u l-korsijiet"

msgid "Whether you want to show only courses, only sessions or both courses *and* sessions in the courses catalogue."
msgstr "Jekk tridx turi biss korsijiet, biss sessjonijiet jew kemm korsijiet *kif ukoll* sessjonijiet fil-katalgu tal-korsijiet."

msgid "Enable language auto-detect in custom pages"
msgstr "Attiva d-detezzjoni awtomatika tal-lingwa fil-paġni personalizzati"

msgid "If you use custom pages, enable this if you want to have a language detector there present the page in the user's browser language, or disable to force the language to be the default platform language."
msgstr "Jekk tuża paġni personalizzati, attiva dan jekk trid li jkun hemm detettur tal-lingwa li jippreżenta l-paġna bil-lingwa tal-browser tal-utent, jew iddiżattiva biex tissieġel il-lingwa bħala l-lingwa default tal-pjattaforma."

msgid "Learning paths: show reduced report"
msgstr "Mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim: uri rapport imnaqqas"

msgid "Inside the learning paths tool, when a user reviews his own progress (through the stats icon), show a shorten (less detailed) version of the progress report."
msgstr "Ġewwa l-għodda tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim, meta utent jirrevedi l-progress tiegħu (permezz tal-ikona tal-istatistika), uri verżjoni mqassra (inqas dettaljata) tar-rapport tal-progress."

msgid "Allow session-to-session copy for teachers"
msgstr "Ippermetti l-kopja minn sessjoni għal sessjoni għall-għalliema"

msgid "Enable this option to let teachers copy their content from one course in a session to a course in another session. By default, this option is only available to platform administrators."
msgstr "Attiva din l-għażla biex tħalli l-għalliema jikkopjaw il-kontenut tagħhom minn kors f'sessjoni għal kors f'sessjoni oħra. B'mod default, din l-għażla hija disponibbli biss għall-amministraturi tal-pjattaforma."

msgid "Hide logout button"
msgstr "Aħbi l-buttuna tal-ħruġ"

msgid "Hide the logout button. This is usually only interesting when using an external login/logout method, for example when using Single Sign On of some sort."
msgstr "Aħbi l-buttuna tal-ħruġ. Dan huwa normalment interessanti biss meta tuża metodu estern ta' login/logout, pereżempju meta tuża Single Sign On ta' xi tip."

msgid "Redirect admin to courses list"
msgstr "Irridirezzjona l-amministratur għal-lista tal-korsijiet"

msgid "The default behaviour is to send administrators directly to the administration panel (while teachers and students are sent to the courses list or the platform homepage). Enable to redirect the administrator also to his/her courses list."
msgstr "L-imġiba default hija li tibgħat l-amministraturi direttament għall-pannell tal-amministrazzjoni (filwaqt li l-għalliema u l-istudenti jintbagħtu għal-lista tal-korsijiet jew għall-homepage tal-pjattaforma). Attiva biex tirridirezzjona l-amministratur ukoll għal-lista tal-korsijiet tiegħu/tagħha."

msgid "Courses custom icons"
msgstr "Ikoni personalizzati tal-korsijiet"

msgid "Use course images as the course icon in courses lists (instead of the default green blackboard icon)."
msgstr "Uża l-immaġini tal-kors bħala l-ikona tal-kors fil-listi tal-korsijiet (minflok l-ikona default tal-blackboard ħadra)."

msgid "Assignment considered for gradebook"
msgstr "Assenjament ikkunsidrat għall-gradebook"

msgid "In the assignments tool, students can upload more than one file. In case there is more than one for a single assignment, which one should be considered when ranking them in the gradebook? This depends on your methodology. Use 'first' to put the accent on attention to detail (like handling in time and handling the right work first). Use 'last' to highlight collaborative and adaptative work."
msgstr "Fl-għodda tal-assenjamenti, l-istudenti jistgħu jtellgħu aktar minn fajl wieħed. Jekk ikun hemm aktar minn wieħed għal assenjament wieħed, liema wieħed għandu jiġi kkunsidrat meta jiġu klassifikati fil-gradebook? Dan jiddependi mill-metodoloġija tiegħek. Uża 'l-ewwel' biex tpoġġi l-enfasi fuq l-attenzjoni għad-dettall (bħal li tissottometti fil-ħin u tissottometti x-xogħol it-tajjeb l-ewwel). Uża 'l-aħħar' biex tenfasizza x-xogħol kollaborattiv u adattattiv."

msgid "Certificates filter by official code"
msgstr "Iffiltra ċ-ċertifikati skont il-kodiċi uffiċjali"

msgid "Add a filter on the students official code to the certificates list."
msgstr "Żid filtru fuq il-kodiċi uffiċjali tal-istudenti fil-lista taċ-ċertifikati."

msgid "Max editors in exercise result screen"
msgstr "Numru massimu ta' edituri fl-iskrin tar-riżultat tal-eżerċizzju"

msgid "Because of the sheer number of questions that might appear in an exercise, the correction screen, allowing the teacher to add comments to each answer, might be very slow to load. Set this number to 5 to ask the platform to only show WYSIWYG editors up to a certain number of answers on the screen. This will speed up the correction page loading time considerably, but will remove WYSIWYG editors and leave only a plain text editor."
msgstr "Minħabba n-numru kbir ta' mistoqsijiet li jistgħu jidhru f'eżerċizzju, l-iskrin tal-korrezzjoni, li jippermetti lill-għalliem iżid kummenti għal kull tweġiba, jista' jkun bil-mod ħafna biex jitgħabba. Issettja dan in-numru għal 5 biex titlob lill-pjattaforma turi biss l-edituri WYSIWYG sa ċertu numru ta' tweġibiet fuq l-iskrin. Dan jħaffef ħafna l-ħin tat-tagħbija tal-paġna tal-korrezzjoni, iżda jneħħi l-edituri WYSIWYG u jħalli biss editur ta' test sempliċi."

msgid "Default document upload mode"
msgstr "Mod default tal-upload tad-dokumenti"

msgid "Default upload method in the courses documents. This setting can be changed at upload time for all users. It only represents a default setting."
msgstr "Metodu default tal-upload fid-dokumenti tal-korsijiet. Dan is-setting jista' jinbidel fil-ħin tal-upload għall-utenti kollha. Jirrappreżenta biss setting default."

msgid "Certificates auto-generation on WS call"
msgstr "Ġenerazzjoni awtomatika taċ-ċertifikati fuq sejħa WS"

msgid "When enabled, and when using the WSCertificatesList webservice, this option will make sure that all certificates have been generated by users if they reached the sufficient score in all items defined in gradebooks for all courses and sessions (this might consume considerable processing resources on your server)."
msgstr "Meta mbixxel, u meta jintuża s-servizz tal-web WSCertificatesList, din l-għażla tiżgura li ċ-ċertifikati kollha jkunu ġew iġġenerati mill-utenti jekk dawn laħqu l-punteġġ suffiċjenti fl-oġġetti kollha definiti fil-gradebooks għall-korsijiet u s-sessjonijiet kollha (dan jista' jikkonsma riżorsi konsiderevoli tal-ipproċessar fuq is-server tiegħek)."

msgid "OpenBadges backpack URL"
msgstr "URL tal-backpack OpenBadges"

msgid "The URL of the OpenBadges backpack server that will be used by default for all users wanting to export their badges. This defaults to the open and free Mozilla Foundation backpack repository: https://backpack.openbadges.org/"
msgstr "L-URL tas-server tal-backpack OpenBadges li se jintuża b'mod awtomatiku għall-utenti kollha li jridu jesportaw il-badges tagħhom. Dan jiddefawtja għar-repożitorju miftuħ u b'xejn tal-Mozilla Foundation: https://backpack.openbadges.org/"

msgid "Cookie privacy notification"
msgstr "Notifika tal-privatezza tal-cookies"

msgid "If enabled, this option shows a banner on top of your platform that asks users to acknowledge that the platform is using cookies necessary to provide the user experience. The banner can easily be acknowledged and hidden by the user. This allows Chamilo to comply with EU web cookies regulations."
msgstr "Meta mbixxel, din l-għażla turi banner fuq il-pjattaforma li titlob lill-utenti jikkonfermaw li l-pjattaforma qed tuża cookies meħtieġa biex tipprovdi l-esperjenza tal-utent. Il-banner jista' jiġi kkonfermat u moħbi faċilment mill-utent. Dan jippermetti lil Chamilo jikkonforma mar-regolamenti tal-UE dwar il-cookies tal-web."

msgid "If enabled *and* the sessions catalogue is enabled, users will be able to subscribe to active sessions by themselves using the 'Subscribe' button, without any type of restriction."
msgstr "Meta mbixxel *u* il-katalgu tas-sessjonijiet ikun attiv, l-utenti jkunu jistgħu jissottoskrivu għal sessjonijiet attivi waħedhom billi jużaw il-buttuna 'Abbona', mingħajr ebda tip ta' restrizzjoni."

msgid "Hide course group if no tool"
msgstr "Aħbi grupp tal-kors jekk ma jkunx hemm għodda"

msgid "If no tool is available in a group and the user is not registered to the group itself, hide the group completely in the groups list."
msgstr "Jekk ma tkunx disponibbli ebda għodda f'grupp u l-utent ma jkunx irreġistrat fil-grupp innifsu, aħbi l-grupp kompletament fil-lista tal-gruppi."

msgid "Auto-subscription in sessions catalogue"
msgstr "Abbonament awtomatiku fil-katalgu tas-sessjonijiet"

msgid "Web services: decode UTF-8"
msgstr "Servizzi tal-web: iddekkodifika UTF-8"

msgid "Decode UTF-8 from web services calls. Enable this option (passed to the SOAP parser) if you have issues with the encoding of titles and names when inserted through web services."
msgstr "Iddekkodifika UTF-8 mis-sejħiet tas-servizzi tal-web. Attiva din l-għażla (mgħoddija lill-parser SOAP) jekk ikollok problemi bl-ikkodifikazzjoni tat-titoli u l-ismijiet meta dawn jiddaħħlu permezz tas-servizzi tal-web."

msgid "Attendances: enable deletion"
msgstr "Attendenzi: ippermetti t-tħassir"

msgid "The default behaviour in Chamilo is to hide attendance sheets instead of deleting them, just in case the teacher would do it by mistake. Enable this option to allow teachers to *really* delete attendance sheets."
msgstr "L-imġiba awtomatika f'Chamilo hija li taħbi l-folji tal-attendenza minflok tħassarhom, biex il-għalliem ma jagħmilx dan bi żball. Attiva din l-għażla biex tippermetti lill-għalliema jħassru *verament* il-folji tal-attendenza."

msgid "Gravatar user pictures"
msgstr "Ritratti tal-utenti Gravatar"

msgid "Enable this option to search into the Gravatar repository for pictures of the current user, if the user hasn't defined a picture locally. This is great to auto-fill pictures on your site, in particular if your users are active internet users. Gravatar pictures can be configured easily, based on the e-mail address of a user, at http://en.gravatar.com/"
msgstr "Attiva din l-għażla biex tfittex fir-repożitorju Gravatar għal ritratti tal-utent attwali, jekk l-utent ma jkunx iddefinixxa ritratt lokalment. Dan huwa tajjeb biex timla awtomatikament ir-ritratti fuq is-sit tiegħek, b'mod partikolari jekk l-utenti tiegħek huma utenti attivi tal-internet. Ir-ritratti Gravatar jistgħu jiġu kkonfigurati faċilment, ibbażati fuq l-indirizz tal-email tal-utent, fuq http://en.gravatar.com/"

msgid "Gravatar avatar type"
msgstr "Tip ta' avatar Gravatar"

msgid "If the Gravatar option is enabled and the user doesn't have a picture configured on Gravatar, this option allows you to choose the type of avatar that Gravatar will generate for each user. Check <a href='http://en.gravatar.com/site/implement/images#default-image'>http://en.gravatar.com/site/implement/images#default-image</a> for avatar types examples."
msgstr "Jekk l-għażla Gravatar tkun attivata u l-utent ma jkollux ritratt ikkonfigurat fuq Gravatar, din l-għażla tippermettilek tagħżel it-tip ta' avatar li Gravatar jiġġenera għal kull utent. Iċċekkja <a href='http://en.gravatar.com/site/implement/images#default-image'>http://en.gravatar.com/site/implement/images#default-image</a> għal eżempji tat-tipi ta' avatars."

msgid "Limit session admins permissions"
msgstr "Limita l-permessi tal-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet"

msgid "If enabled, the session administrators will only see the User block with the 'Add user' option and the Sessions block with the 'Sessions list' option."
msgstr "Meta mbixxel, l-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet jaraw biss il-blokk tal-Utenti bl-għażla 'Żid utent' u l-blokk tas-Sessjonijiet bl-għażla 'Lista tas-sessjonijiet'."

msgid "Show session description"
msgstr "Uri d-deskrizzjoni tas-sessjoni"

msgid "Show the session description wherever this option is implemented (sessions tracking pages, etc)"
msgstr "Uri d-deskrizzjoni tas-sessjoni kull fejn din l-għażla tkun implimentata (paġni tat-traċċar tas-sessjonijiet, eċċ.)"

msgid "Certificates: hide export link from students"
msgstr "Ċertifikati: aħbi l-link tal-esportazzjoni mill-istudenti"

msgid "If enabled, students won't be able to export their certificates to PDF. This option is available because, depending on the precise HTML structure of the certificate template, the PDF export might be of low quality. In this case, it is best to only show the HTML certificate to students."
msgstr "Meta mbixxel, l-istudenti ma jkunux jistgħu jesportaw iċ-ċertifikati tagħhom għal PDF. Din l-għażla hija disponibbli għaliex, skont l-istruttura preċiża tal-HTML tat-template taċ-ċertifikat, l-esportazzjoni għal PDF tista' tkun ta' kwalità baxxa. F'dan il-każ, huwa aħjar li turi biss iċ-ċertifikat HTML lill-istudenti."

msgid "Certificates: hide PDF export link for all"
msgstr "Ċertifikati: aħbi l-link tal-esportazzjoni PDF għal kulħadd"

msgid "Enable to completely remove the possibility to export certificates to PDF (for all users). If enabled, this includes hiding it from students."
msgstr "Attiva biex tneħħi kompletament il-possibbiltà li jiġu esportati ċ-ċertifikati għal PDF (għall-utenti kollha). Meta mbixxel, dan jinkludi li jkun moħbi mill-istudenti."

msgid "Dropbox: hide course coach"
msgstr "Dropbox: aħbi l-coach tal-kors"

msgid "Hide session course coach in dropbox when a document is sent by the coach to students"
msgstr "Aħbi l-coach tal-kors tas-sessjoni fid-dropbox meta dokument jintbagħat mill-coach lill-istudenti"

msgid "Single Sign On: force redirect"
msgstr "Single Sign On: forza r-ridirezzjoni"

msgid "Enable this option to force users to authenticate on the master authentication portal when a Single Sign On method is enabled. Only enable once you are sure that your Single Sign On procedure is correctly set up, otherwise you might prevent yourself from logging in again (in this case, change the SSO settings in the settings_current table through direct access to the database, to unlock)."
