msgstr "Iddefinixxi liema rwoli huma moħbija mill-utenti normali"

msgid "The roles set to 'true' will only appear to administrators. Other users will not be able to see them."
msgstr "Ir-rwoli ssettjati għal 'true' jidhru biss lill-amministraturi. Utenti oħra ma jkunux jistgħu jarawhom."

msgid "Hide the option to send an announcement copy to HRM"
msgstr "Aħbi l-għażla li tibgħat kopja ta' avviż lil HRM"

msgid "In the announcements form, an option normally appears to allow teachers to send a copy of the announcement to the user's HRM. Set this to 'Yes' to remote the option (and *not* send the copy)."
msgstr "Fil-formola tal-avviżi, normalment tidher għażla li tippermetti lill-għalliema jibagħtu kopja tal-avviż lil HRM tal-utent. Issettja dan għal 'Iva' biex tneħħi l-għażla (u *ma* tibgħatx il-kopja)."

msgid "Disable attachment to announcements"
msgstr "Iddiżattiva l-attachements għall-avviżi"

msgid "Even though attachments in this version are dealt in an elegant way and do not multiply on disk, you might want to disable attachments altogether if you want to avoid excesses."
msgstr "Minkejja li l-attachements f'din il-verżjoni huma mmaniġġjati b'mod eleganti u ma jimmultiplikawx fuq id-disk, tista' tixtieq tiddiżattiva l-attachements kompletament jekk trid tevita eċċessi."

msgid "Disable editor announcements"
msgstr "Iddiżattiva l-editur tal-avviżi"

msgid "Choose 'Yes' to stop announcements from the software editor to appear on the administrative homepage (only admins see it). This will also remove security update announcements."
msgstr "Agħżel 'Iva' biex twaqqaf l-avviżi mill-editur tas-softwer milli jidhru fuq il-homepage amministrattiva (biss l-amministraturi jarawhom). Dan se jneħħi wkoll l-avviżi tal-aġġornamenti tas-sigurtà."

msgid "Enable scheduled announcements in sessions"
msgstr "Attiva l-avviżi skedati fis-sessjonijiet"

msgid "Allows the sessions managers to set announcements that will be triggered on specific dates or after/before a number of days of start/end of the session. Enabling this feature requires you to setup a cron task."
msgstr "Tippermetti lill-maniġers tas-sessjonijiet jissettjaw avviżi li jiġu attivati f'dati speċifiċi jew wara/qabel numru ta' ġranet mill-bidu/tmiem tas-sessjoni. L-attivazzjoni ta' din il-karatteristika teħtieġ li tissettja kompitu cron."

msgid "Disable button to delete all announcements"
msgstr "Iddiżattiva l-buttun biex tħassar l-avviżi kollha"

msgid "Select 'Yes' to remove the button to delete all announcements, as this can be used by mistake by teachers."
msgstr "Agħżel 'Iva' biex tneħħi l-buttun biex tħassar l-avviżi kollha, peress li dan jista' jintuża bi żball mill-għalliema."

msgid "Hide 'sent to' in announcements"
msgstr "Aħbi 'mibgħut lil' fl-avviżi"

msgid "Select 'Yes' to avoid showing to whom an announcement has been sent."
msgstr "Agħżel 'Iva' biex tevita li turi lil min intbagħat avviż."

msgid "Send all e-mails to"
msgstr "Ibgħat l-emails kollha lil"

msgid "Give a list of e-mail addresses to whom *all* e-mails sent from the platform will be sent. The e-mails are sent to these addresses as a visible destination."
msgstr "Agħti lista ta' indirizzi tal-email lil min *l-emails kollha* mibgħuta mill-pjattaforma se jintbagħtu. L-emails jintbagħtu lil dawn l-indirizzi bħala destinazzjoni viżibbli."

msgid "Link global announcements with careers and promotions"
msgstr "Irbaħ l-avviżi globali mal-karrieri u l-promozzjonijiet"

msgid "Link global calendar events with careers and promotions"
msgstr "Linkja avvenimenti tal-kalendarju globali mal-karrieri u promozzjonijiet"

msgid "Allow coaches to always edit announcements"
msgstr "Ħalli l-kowċis jeditjaw dejjem l-avviżi"

msgid "Allow coaches to always edit announcements inside active or past sessions."
msgstr "Ħalli l-kowċis jeditjaw dejjem l-avviżi f'sessjonijiet attivi jew li għaddew."

msgid "Date-based announcements"
msgstr "Avviżi bbażati fuq id-data"

msgid "Allow teachers to configure announcements that will be sent at specific dates. This requires you to setup a cron task on cron/course_announcement.php running at least once daily."
msgstr "Ħalli l-għalliema jikkonfiguraw avviżi li jintbagħtu f'dati speċifiċi. Dan jirrikjedi li tissettja kompitu cron fuq cron/course_announcement.php li jħaddem mill-inqas darba kuljum."

msgid "Default calendar display mode"
msgstr "Mod ta' wiri default tal-kalendarju"

msgid "Set this to dayGridMonth, basicWeek, agendaWeek or agendaDay to change the default view of the calendar."
msgstr "Issettja dan għal dayGridMonth, basicWeek, agendaWeek jew agendaDay biex tibdel il-vista default tal-kalendarju."

msgid "Display sessions occupations in personal agenda"
msgstr "Uri l-okkupazzjonijiet tas-sessjonijiet fl-aġenda personali"

msgid "Display all agenda events in personal agenda"
msgstr "Uri l-avvenimenti kollha tal-aġenda fl-aġenda personali"

msgid "Do not hide events from expired sessions."
msgstr "M'għandekx taħbi avvenimenti minn sessjonijiet skaduti."

msgid "Allow HRM role to edit or delete agenda events"
msgstr "Ħalli r-rwol HRM jeditja jew iħassar avvenimenti tal-aġenda"

msgid "This gives the HRM a little more power by allowing them to edit/delete agenda events in the course-session."
msgstr "Dan jagħti lill-HRM ftit iktar setgħa billi jippermettilhom jeditjaw/jħassru avvenimenti tal-aġenda fil-kors-sessjoni."

msgid "Agenda colour legends"
msgstr "Leġġendi tal-kuluri tal-aġenda"

msgid "Add a small text as legend describing the colours used for the events."
msgstr "Żid test żgħir bħala leġġenda li tiddeskrivi l-kuluri użati għall-avvenimenti."

msgid "Agenda colours"
msgstr "Kuluri tal-aġenda"

msgid "Set HTML-code colours for each type of event to change the colour when displaying the event."
msgstr "Issettja kuluri tal-kodiċi HTML għal kull tip ta' avveniment biex tibdel il-kulur meta turi l-avveniment."

msgid "Agenda hover info"
msgstr "Informazzjoni tal-aġenda meta tgħaddi fuqha"

msgid "Customize the agenda on cursor hovering. Show agenda comment and/or description."
msgstr "Ippersonalizza l-aġenda meta l-kursur jgħaddi fuqha. Uri kumment u/jew deskrizzjoni tal-aġenda."

msgid "Calendar customization"
msgstr "Personalizzazzjoni tal-kalendarju"

msgid "Extra settings for the agenda, allowing you to configure the specific calendar library we use."
msgstr "Settings żejda għall-aġenda, li jippermettulek tikkonfigura l-librerija speċifika tal-kalendarju li nużaw."

msgid "Attendance signing"
msgstr "Firma tal-attendenza"

msgid "Enable taking signatures to confirm one's attendance."
msgstr "Ippermetti li jittieħdu firem biex tikkonferma l-attendenza ta' wieħed."

msgid "Duration of attendance events"
msgstr "Tul ta' żmien tal-avvenimenti tal-attendenza"

msgid "Option to define the duration for an event in attendance sheet."
msgstr "Għażla biex tiddefinixxi t-tul ta' żmien għal avveniment fil-folja tal-attendenza."

msgid "Allow comments in attendance sheets"
msgstr "Ħalli kummenti fil-folji tal-attendenza"

msgid "Teachers and students can comment on each individual attendance (to justify)."
msgstr "L-għalliema u l-istudenti jistgħu jikkummentaw fuq kull attendenza individwali (biex jiġġustifikaw)."

msgid "Hide 'my certificate' link"
msgstr "Aħbi l-link 'iċ-ċertifikat tiegħi'"

msgid "Hide the certificates page for non-admin users."
msgstr "Aħbi l-paġna taċ-ċertifikati għall-utenti mhux amministraturi."

msgid "Add footer to PDF certificate exports"
msgstr "Żid footer għall-esportazzjonijiet PDF taċ-ċertifikati"

msgid "Hide videochat option in global chat"
msgstr "Aħbi l-għażla tal-videochat fiċ-chat globali"

msgid "Restrict course chat to coaches"
msgstr "Irrestrinġi ċ-chat tal-kors għall-kowċis"

msgid "Only allow students to talk to the tutors in the course (not other students)."
msgstr "Ħalli biss lill-istudenti jitkellmu mat-tuturi fil-kors (mhux studenti oħra)."

msgid "Active tools on course creation"
msgstr "Għodod attivi meta jinħoloq kors"

msgid "Select the tools that will be *active* after the creation of a course."
msgstr "Agħżel l-għodod li jkunu *attivi* wara l-ħolqien ta' kors."

msgid "Splash screen for courses"
msgstr "Skrin splash għall-korsijiet"

msgid "Show a splash screen when creating a new course."
msgstr "Uri skrin splash meta jinħoloq kors ġdid."

msgid "Block public courses access to authenticated users"
msgstr "Imblokka l-aċċess għall-korsijiet pubbliċi għall-utenti awtentikati"

msgid "Only show public courses. Do not allow registered users to access courses with 'open' visibility unless they are subscribed to each of these courses."
msgstr "Uri biss korsijiet pubbliċi. M'għandekx tħalli utenti reġistrati jaċċessaw korsijiet b'viżibilità 'miftuħa' sakemm ma jkunux abbonati għal kull wieħed minn dawn il-korsijiet."

msgid "Add Bootstrap lib headers to HTML documents viewer"
msgstr "Żid headers tal-librerija Bootstrap għall-viewer tad-dokumenti HTML"

msgid "When this setting is set to 'Yes', the HTML documents viewer adds the HTML headers for the inclusion of Bootstrap and Font Awesome, which were used in Chamilo 1. This might help compatibility between old content and a newer version of the platform."
msgstr "Meta din l-issettjar ikun 'Iva', il-viewer tad-dokumenti HTML iżid l-headers HTML għall-inklużjoni ta' Bootstrap u Font Awesome, li kienu jintużaw f'Chamilo 1. Dan jista' jgħin fil-kompatibilità bejn kontenut antik u verżjoni aktar ġdida tal-pjattaforma."

msgid "View courses in a grid layout"
msgstr "Ara korsijiet f'layout tal-grilja"

msgid "View courses in a layout with several courses per line. Otherwise, the layout will show one course per line."
msgstr "Ara korsijiet f'layout b'diversi korsijiet għal kull linja. Inkella, il-layout juri kors wieħed għal kull linja."

msgid "Show simple session info"
msgstr "Uri informazzjoni sempliċi tas-sessjoni"

msgid "Add coach and dates to the session's subtitle in the sessions' list."
msgstr "Żid kowċ u dati fis-sottotitolu tas-sessjoni fil-lista tas-sessjonijiet."

msgid "Only show courses in the user's language"
msgstr "Uri biss korsijiet bil-lingwa tal-utent"

msgid "If enabled, this option will hide all courses not set in the user's language."
msgstr "Jekk attivat, din l-għażla taħbi l-korsijiet kollha li mhumiex issettjati bil-lingwa tal-utent."

msgid "Access public courses with terms and conditions"
msgstr "Aċċessa korsijiet pubbliċi b'termini u kundizzjonijiet"

msgid "With this option enabled, if a course has public visibility and terms and conditions, those terms are disabled while the course is public."
msgstr "B'din l-għażla attivat, jekk kors għandu viżibilità pubblika u termini u kundizzjonijiet, dawk it-termini jkunu diżattivati waqt li l-kors ikun pubbliku."

msgid "Show all sessions on 'My courses' page"
msgstr "Uri s-sessjonijiet kollha fil-paġna 'Il-korsijiet tiegħi'"

msgid "If enabled, this option show all sessions of the user in calendar-based view."
msgstr "Jekk attivat, din l-għażla turi s-sessjonijiet kollha tal-utent f'vista bbażata fuq kalendarju."

msgid "Disable the ability to edit course coaches"
msgstr "Iddiżattiva l-possibbiltà li jkunu editjati l-kowċis tal-kors"

msgid "When disabled, admins do not have a link to quickly assign coaches to session-courses on the course edition page."
msgstr "Meta tkun iddiżattivata, l-amministraturi ma jkollhomx link biex jassenjaw malajr kowċis għal sessjonijiet-korsijiet fil-paġna tal-editjar tal-kors."

msgid "Use course categories from top URL"
msgstr "Uża kategoriji tal-korsijiet mill-URL prinċipali"

msgid "In multi-URL settings, allow admins and teachers to assign categories from the top URL to courses in the children URLs."
msgstr "F’konfigurazzjonijiet b’URL multipli, ħalli lill-amministraturi u lill-għalliema jassenjaw kategoriji mill-URL prinċipali għal korsijiet fl-URLs tat-tfal."

msgid "Hide courses block in the sidebar"
msgstr "Aħbi l-blokk tal-korsijiet fil-bar laterali"

msgid "When on screens where the left menu is visible, do not display the « Courses » section."
msgstr "Meta tkun fuq skreens fejn il-menu tax-xellug huwa viżibbli, ma turi s-sezzjoni « Korsijiet »."

msgid "Allow using extra fields in course catalogue"
msgstr "Ħalli l-użu ta’ oqsma addizzjonali fil-katalgu tal-korsijiet"

msgid "Add new search fields dynamically to the course catalogue based on searchable course extra fields."
msgstr "Żid oqsma ta’ tiftix ġodda b’mod dinamiku fil-katalgu tal-korsijiet ibbażati fuq oqsma addizzjonali tal-korsijiet li jistgħu jintfittxu."

msgid "Show multi-URL shared course marker"
msgstr "Uri l-markatur tal-kors kondiviż bejn URLs multipli"

msgid "Adds a link icon to courses that are shared between URLs, so users (in particular teachers) know they have to take special care when editing the course content."
msgstr "Iżżid ikona ta’ link għal korsijiet li huma kondiviżi bejn URLs, sabiex l-utenti (b’mod partikolari l-għalliema) ikunu jafu li għandhom jieħdu attenzjoni speċjali meta jeditjaw il-kontenut tal-kors."

msgid "Restrict course templates to one course category"
msgstr "Irrestriġi t-templates tal-korsijiet għal kategorija waħda tal-korsijiet"

msgid "Give a category code to use as course templates. Only those courses will show in the drop-down at course creation time, and users won’t see the courses in this category from the courses catalogue."
msgstr "Agħti kodiċi ta’ kategorija biex tintuża bħala templates tal-korsijiet. Dawn il-korsijiet biss jidhru fil-drop-down fil-ħin tal-ħolqien tal-kors, u l-utenti ma jarawx il-korsijiet f’din il-kategorija mill-katalgu tal-korsijiet."

msgid "Show unsubscribe button in ‘My courses’"
msgstr "Uri l-buttuna tal-irtirat f’‘Il-korsijiet tiegħi’"

msgid "Add a button to unsubscribe from a course on the ‘My courses’ page."
msgstr "Żid buttuna biex tirtira minn kors fil-paġna ‘Il-korsijiet tiegħi’."

msgid "Show donate message on course creation page"
msgstr "Uri messaġġ ta’ donazzjoni fil-paġna tal-ħolqien tal-kors"

msgid "Add a message box in the course creation page for teachers, asking them to donate to the project."
msgstr "Żid kaxxa ta’ messaġġ fil-paġna tal-ħolqien tal-kors għall-għalliema, titlobhom jagħmlu donazzjoni għall-proġett."

msgid "Donation link on course creation page"
msgstr "Link tad-donazzjoni fil-paġna tal-ħolqien tal-kors"

msgid "The page the donation message should link to (full URL)."
msgstr "Il-paġna li l-messaġġ tad-donazzjoni għandu jillinkja għaliha (URL sħiħ)."

msgid "Type of link for the session title"
msgstr "Tip ta’ link għat-titlu tas-sessjoni"

msgid "On the courses/sessions page, the session title can be either of the following : 0 = no link (hide session title) ; 1 = link title to a special session page ; 2 = link to the course if there is only one course ; 3 = session title makes the courses list foldable ; 4 = no link (show session title)."
msgstr "Fil-paġna tal-korsijiet/sessjonijiet, it-titlu tas-sessjoni jista’ jkun wieħed minn dawn li ġejjin: 0 = l-ebda link (aħbi t-titlu tas-sessjoni); 1 = link tat-titlu għal paġna speċjali tas-sessjoni; 2 = link għall-kors jekk hemm biss kors wieħed; 3 = it-titlu tas-sessjoni jagħmel il-lista tal-korsijiet li tista’ titwitta; 4 = l-ebda link (uri t-titlu tas-sessjoni)."

msgid "Hide course rating"
msgstr "Aħbi l-klassifikazzjoni tal-kors"

msgid "The course rating feature comes by default in different places. If you don’t want it, enable this option."
msgstr "Il-karatteristika tal-klassifikazzjoni tal-kors tiġi b’mod awtomatiku f’postijiet differenti. Jekk ma tridux, attiva din l-għażla."

msgid "Hide columns from course logs"
msgstr "Aħbi kolonni mil-logs tal-korsijiet"

msgid "This array gives you the possibility to configure which columns to hide in the main course stats page and in the total time report."
msgstr "Dan l-array jagħtik il-possibbiltà li tikkonfigura liema kolonni għandhom jinħbew fil-paġna ewlenija tal-istatistika tal-kors u fir-rapport totali tal-ħin."

msgid "Course student info display"
msgstr "Wirja tal-informazzjoni tal-istudent tal-kors"

msgid "On the ‘My courses’/’My sessions’ pages, show additional information regarding the score, progress and/or certificate acquisition by the student."
msgstr "Fil-paġni ‘Il-korsijiet tiegħi’/‘Is-sessjonijiet tiegħi’, uri informazzjoni addizzjonali dwar il-punteġġ, il-progress u/jew l-akkwist taċ-ċertifikat mill-istudent."

msgid "Course catalogue settings"
msgstr "Settings tal-katalgu tal-korsijiet"

msgid "This array gives you the possibility to configure many aspects of the course catalogue."
msgstr "Dan l-array jagħtik il-possibbiltà li tikkonfigura ħafna aspetti tal-katalgu tal-korsijiet."

msgid "Show dependencies in course intro"
msgstr "Uri d-dipendenzi fl-introduzzjoni tal-kors"

msgid "When using resources sequencing with courses or sessions, show the dependencies of the course on the course’s homepage."
msgstr "Meta tuża s-sekwenzar tar-riżorsi b’korsijiet jew sessjonijiet, uri d-dipendenzi tal-kors fil-homepage tal-kors."

msgid "Display course catalogue on homepage"
msgstr "Uri l-katalgu tal-korsijiet fil-homepage"

msgid "Set course category mandatory"
msgstr "Agħmel il-kategorija tal-kors obbligatorja"

msgid "When creating a course, make the course category a required setting."
msgstr "Meta toħloq kors, agħmel il-kategorija tal-kors setting obbligatorju."

msgid "Remove course code field from course creation form"
msgstr "Neħħi l-qasam tal-kodiċi tal-kors mill-formola tal-ħolqien tal-kors"

msgid "If not provided, the course code is generated by default based on the course title, so enable this option to remove the code field from the course creation form altogether."
msgstr "Jekk ma jkunx ipprovdut, il-kodiċi tal-kors jiġi ġġenerat b’mod awtomatiku abbażi tat-titlu tal-kors, għalhekk attiva din l-għażla biex tneħħi l-qasam tal-kodiċi mill-formola tal-ħolqien tal-kors għal kollox."

msgid "Hide course teacher info on course details page"
msgstr "Aħbi l-informazzjoni tal-għalliem tal-kors fil-paġna tad-dettalji tal-kors"

msgid "On the course details page, hide the teacher information."
msgstr "Fil-paġna tad-dettalji tal-kors, aħbi l-informazzjoni tal-għalliem."

msgid "Course visibility changes for admins only"
msgstr "Bidliet fil-viżibilità tal-kors għall-amministraturi biss"

msgid "Remove the possibility for non-admins to change the course visibility. Visibility can be an issue when there are too many teachers to control directly. Forcing visibilities allows the organization to better manage courses catalogues."
msgstr "Neħħi l-possibbiltà għal dawk li mhumiex amministraturi li jibdlu l-viżibilità tal-kors. Il-viżibilità tista’ tkun problema meta jkun hemm wisq għalliema biex jiġu kkontrollati direttament. Li tiġi sfurzata l-viżibilità tippermetti lill-organizzazzjoni timmaniġġja aħjar il-katalgi tal-korsijiet."

msgid "Hide course catalogue’s public link"
msgstr "Aħbi l-link pubbliku tal-katalgu tal-korsijiet"

msgid "Hides the link to the course catalogue in the menu when the catalogue is public."
msgstr "Jaħbi l-link għall-katalgu tal-korsijiet fil-menu meta l-katalgu jkun pubbliku."

msgid "User extra fields by default in course stats page"
msgstr "Oqsma addizzjonali tal-utent b’mod awtomatiku fil-paġna tal-istatistika tal-kors"

msgid "Configure this array with the internal IDs of the extra fields you want to show by default in the main course stats page."
msgstr "Ikkonfigura dan l-array bl-IDs interni tal-oqsma addizzjonali li trid turi b’mod awtomatiku fil-paġna ewlenija tal-istatistika tal-kors."

msgid "Only show matching courses in catalogue"
msgstr "Uri biss korsijiet li jaqblu fil-katalgu"

msgid "When enabled, only the courses with the extra field ‘show_in_catalogue’ set to 1 will appear in the catalogue."
msgstr "Meta tkun attivata, biss il-korsijiet bl-oqsma addizzjonali ‘show_in_catalogue’ issettjat għal 1 jidhru fil-katalgu."

msgid "Only show matching categories in courses catalogue"
msgstr "Uri biss kategoriji li jaqblu fil-katalgu tal-korsijiet"

msgid "When not empty, only the courses from the given categories will appear in the courses catalogue."
msgstr "Meta ma tkunx vojta, biss il-korsijiet mill-kategoriji mogħtija jidhru fil-katalgu tal-korsijiet."

msgid "Extra fields to show on course creation form"
msgstr "Oqsma addizzjonali li jintwerew fil-formola tal-ħolqien tal-kors"

msgid "The fields defined in this array will appear as additional fields in the course creation form."
msgstr "L-oqsma definiti f’dan l-array jidhru bħala oqsma addizzjonali fil-formola tal-ħolqien tal-kors."

msgid "Extra fields to require on course creation form"
msgstr "Oqsma addizzjonali li huma obbligatorji fil-formola tal-ħolqien tal-kors"

msgid "The fields defined in this array will be mandatory in the course creation form."
msgstr "Il-oqsma definiti f'din l-array se jkunu obbligatorji fil-formola tal-ħolqien tal-kors."

msgid "Extra fields to show in course settings"
msgstr "Oqsma addizzjonali li jidhru fis-settings tal-kors"

msgid "The fields defined in this array will appear on the course settings page."
msgstr "Il-oqsma definiti f'din l-array se jidhru fil-paġna tas-settings tal-kors."

msgid "Prefill course fields with fields from user"
msgstr "Imla minn qabel l-oqsma tal-kors b'oqsma mill-utent"

msgid "If not empty, the course creation process will look for some fields in the user profile and auto-fill them for the course. For example, a teacher specialized in digital marketing could automatically set a « digital marketing » flag on each course (s)he creates."
msgstr "Jekk mhux vojt, il-proċess tal-ħolqien tal-kors ifittex xi oqsma fil-profil tal-utent u jimlihom awtomatikament għall-kors. Per eżempju, għalliem speċjalizzat fil-marketing diġitali jista' awtomatikament jistabbilixxi bandiera « marketing diġitali » fuq kull kors li joħloq."

msgid "Allow tool visibility edition in sessions"
msgstr "Ħalli l-editjar tal-viżibilità tal-għodda fis-sessjonijiet"

msgid "When using sessions, the default behaviour is to use the tool visibility defined in the base course. This setting changes that to allow coaches in session courses to adapt tool visibilities to their needs."
msgstr "Meta jintużaw sessjonijiet, l-imġiba default hija li tintuża l-viżibilità tal-għodda definita fil-kors bażi. Dan is-setting jibdel dan biex jippermetti lill-kowċis fil-korsijiet tas-sessjoni li jadattaw il-viżibilità tal-għodod għall-bżonnijiet tagħhom."

msgid "Order of user lastname and firstname"
msgstr "Ordni tal-kunjom u l-isem tal-utent"

msgid "Sort users by specific info by default"
msgstr "Issortja l-utenti b'informazzjoni speċifika b'mod default"

msgid "Use virtual keyboard"
msgstr "Uża tastiera virtwali"

msgid "Make a virtual keyboard appear. This is useful when setting up restrictive exams in a physical room where students have no keyboard to limit their ability to cheat."
msgstr "Ħalli tastiera virtwali tidher. Dan huwa utli meta jiġu stabbiliti eżamijiet restrittivi f'kamra fiżika fejn l-istudenti m'għandhomx tastiera biex jillimitaw il-ħila tagħhom li jqarrqu."

msgid "Disable copy-pasting"
msgstr "Iddiżattiva l-kopja u l-pejst"

msgid "When enabled, this option disables as well as possible the copy-pasting mechanisms. Useful in restrictive exams setups."
msgstr "Meta jkun attivat, dan l-għażla tiddiżattiva kemm jista' jkun il-mekkaniżmi tal-kopja u l-pejst. Utile f'settups ta' eżamijiet restrittivi."

msgid "Bug report link"
msgstr "Link tar-rapport tal-bug"

msgid "Provide link to a bug reporting platform if not using the internal ticket manager."
msgstr "Ipprovdi link għal pjattaforma ta' rapportar tal-bugs jekk ma jintużax il-maniġer intern tal-tickets."

msgid "Layout template"
msgstr "Mudell tat-tqassim"

msgid "Provide the name of the template folder from main/template/ to change the appearance and structure of this portal."
msgstr "Ipprovdi l-isem tal-folder tal-mudell minn main/template/ biex tibdel id-dehra u l-istruttura ta' dan il-portal."

msgid "Hide social media links"
msgstr "Aħbi l-links tal-midja soċjali"

msgid "Some pages allow you to promote the portal or a course on social networks. Enable this setting to remove the links."
msgstr "Xi paġni jippermettulek tippromwovi l-portal jew kors fuq in-networks soċjali. Attiva dan is-setting biex tneħħi l-links."

msgid "Send notification to students when document added"
msgstr "Ibgħat notifika lill-istudenti meta jiżdied dokument"

msgid "Whenever someone creates a new item in the documents tool, send a notification to users."
msgstr "Kull meta xi ħadd joħloq element ġdid fl-għodda tad-dokumenti, ibgħat notifika lill-utenti."

msgid "PDF orientation for course progress"
msgstr "Orjentazzjoni PDF għall-progress tal-kors"

msgid "In the course progress tool, you can print a PDF of the different elements. Set ‘portrait’ or ‘landscape’ (technical terms) to change it."
msgstr "Fl-għodda tal-progress tal-kors, tista' tipprintja PDF tal-elementi differenti. Issettja 'portrait' jew 'landscape' (termini tekniċi) biex tibdlu."

msgid "PDF orientation for certificates"
msgstr "Orjentazzjoni PDF għaċ-ċertifikati"

msgid "Set ‘portrait’ or ‘landscape’ (technical terms) for PDF certificates."
msgstr "Issettja 'portrait' jew 'landscape' (termini tekniċi) għaċ-ċertifikati PDF."

msgid "Enable general certificate"
msgstr "Attiva ċertifikat ġenerali"

msgid "A general certificate is a certificate grouping all the accomplishments by the user in the courses (s)he followed."
msgstr "Ċertifikat ġenerali huwa ċertifikat li jgħaqqad l-kisbiet kollha tal-utent fil-korsijiet li segwa."

msgid "Enable sharing options for group document"
msgstr "Attiva l-għażliet tal-qsim għad-dokument tal-grupp"

msgid "Enable sharing options for document inside group category"
msgstr "Attiva l-għażliet tal-qsim għad-dokument fil-kategorija tal-grupp"

msgid "Enable Compilatio"
msgstr "Attiva Compilatio"

msgid "Compilatio is an anti-cheating service that compares text between two submissions and reports if there is a high probability the content (usually assignments) is not genuine."
msgstr "Compilatio huwa servizz kontra l-qarrieq li jqabbel it-test bejn żewġ sottomissjonijiet u jirrapporta jekk hemmx probabbiltà għolja li l-kontenut (normalment assenjazzjonijiet) mhuwiex ġenwin."

msgid "Compilatio settings"
msgstr "Settings ta' Compilatio"

msgid "Configure the Compilatio connection details here."
msgstr "Ikkonfigura d-dettalji tal-konnessjoni ta' Compilatio hawnhekk."

msgid "Hide documents download icon"
msgstr "Aħbi l-ikona tat-tniżżil tad-dokumenti"

msgid "In the documents tool, hide the download icon from users."
msgstr "Fl-għodda tad-dokumenti, aħbi l-ikona tat-tniżżil mill-utenti."

msgid "Enable X-sendfile headers"
msgstr "Attiva headers X-sendfile"

msgid "Enable this if you have X-sendfile enabled at the web server level and you want to add the required headers for browsers to pick it up."
msgstr "Attiva dan jekk għandek X-sendfile attivat fil-livell tas-server tal-web u trid iżżid l-headers meħtieġa biex il-browsers jaqbduhom."

msgid "Set strict hosts list for cloud links"
msgstr "Issettja lista stretta ta' hosts għal links tal-cloud"

msgid "The documents tool can integrate links to files in the cloud. The list of cloud services is limited to a hardcoded list, but you can define the ‘links’ array that will contain a list of your own list of services/URLs. The list defined here will replace the default list."
msgstr "L-għodda tad-dokumenti tista' tintegra links għal fajls fil-cloud. Il-lista tas-servizzi tal-cloud hija limitata għal lista hardcoded, iżda tista' tiddefinixxi l-array 'links' li se jkun fiha lista tal-lista tiegħek stess ta' servizzi/URLs. Il-lista definita hawnhekk se tissostitwixxi l-lista default."

msgid "Support multi-language HTML content"
msgstr "Appoġġ kontenut HTML b'lingwi multipli"

msgid "If enabled, this option allows users to use a ‘lang’ attribute in HTML elements to define the langage the content of that element is written in. Enable multiple elements with different ‘lang’ attributes and Chamilo will display the content in the langage of the user only."
msgstr "Jekk attivat, din l-għażla tippermetti lill-utenti jużaw attribut 'lang' fl-elementi HTML biex jiddefinixxu l-lingwa li fiha jkun miktub il-kontenut ta' dak l-element. Attiva elementi multipli b'attributi 'lang' differenti u Chamilo se juri l-kontenut biss fil-lingwa tal-utent."

msgid "Save titles as HTML"
msgstr "Issejvja t-titoli bħala HTML"

msgid "Allow users to include HTML in title fields in several places. This allows for some styling of titles, notably in test questions."
msgstr "Ħalli l-utenti jinkludu HTML fl-oqsma tat-titoli f'diversi postijiet. Dan jippermetti xi stilizzazzjoni tat-titoli, notevolment fil-mistoqsijiet tat-test."

msgid "Full WYSIWYG editor toolbar"
msgstr "Toolbar sħiħa tal-editur WYSIWYG"

msgid "Show the full toolbar in all WYSIWYG editor boxes around the platform."
msgstr "Uri t-toolbar sħiħa fil-kaxxi kollha tal-editur WYSIWYG madwar il-pjattaforma."

msgid "Prevent copy-pasting images in WYSIWYG editor"
msgstr "Ipprevjeni l-kopja u l-pejst ta' stampi fl-editur WYSIWYG"

msgid "Prevent the use of images copy-paste as base64 in the editor to avoid filling the database with images."
msgstr "Ipprevjeni l-użu tal-kopja u l-pejst ta' stampi bħala base64 fl-editur biex tevita li timla d-database b'istampi."

msgid "List of WYSIWYG files drivers"
msgstr "Lista ta' drivers tal-fajls WYSIWYG"

msgid "Array containing the names of the drivers for files access from the WYSIWYG editor."
msgstr "Array li jkun fiha l-ismijiet tad-drivers għall-aċċess tal-fajls mill-editur WYSIWYG."

msgid "Allow images drag&drop in WYSIWYG editor"
msgstr "Ħalli drag&drop ta' stampi fl-editur WYSIWYG"

msgid "Enable image upload as file when doing a copy in the content or a drag and drop."
msgstr "Ippermetti t-tlugħ ta' immaġni bħala fajl meta tagħmel kopja fil-kontenut jew permezz ta' drag and drop."

msgid "WYSIWYG editor settings"
msgstr "Settings tal-editur WYSIWYG"

msgid "Generic configuration array to reconfigure the WYSIWYG editor globally."
msgstr "Array ġenerali ta' konfigurazzjoni biex terġa' tikkonfigura l-editur WYSIWYG globalment."

msgid "Hide the context menu on video player"
msgstr "Aħbi l-menu tal-kuntest fuq il-plejer tal-vidjow"

msgid "Video player renderers"
msgstr "Renderers tal-plejer tal-vidjow"

msgid "Enable player renderers for YouTube, Vimeo, Facebook, DailyMotion, Twitch medias"
msgstr "Ippermetti renderers tal-plejer għal midja YouTube, Vimeo, Facebook, DailyMotion, Twitch"

msgid "Allow teachers to edit tests in learning paths"
msgstr "Ħalli l-għalliema jeditjaw it-testijiet fil-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "By default, Chamilo prevents you from editing tests that are included inside a learning path. This is to avoid changes that would affect learners (past and future) differently regarding the results and/or progress in the learning path. This option allows teachers to bypass this restriction."
msgstr "B'mod awtomatiku, Chamilo jipprevjeni milli teditja testijiet li huma inklużi f'mogħdija tat-tagħlim. Dan huwa biex tevita bidliet li jaffettwaw lill-istudenti (preżenti u futuri) b'mod differenti fir-rigward tar-riżultati u/jew il-progress fil-mogħdija tat-tagħlim. Din l-għażla tippermetti lill-għalliema jgħaddu minn din ir-restrizzjoni."

msgid "Hide question ribbon (right/wrong) in test results"
msgstr "Aħbi r-ribbon tal-mistoqsija (tajjeb/ħażin) fir-riżultati tat-test"

msgid "In test results, a ribbon appears by default to indicate if the answer was right or wrong. Enable this option to remove the ribbon globally."
msgstr "Fir-riżultati tat-test, jidher ribbon b'mod awtomatiku biex jindika jekk it-tweġiba kinitx tajba jew ħażina. Ippermetti din l-għażla biex tneħħi r-ribbon globalment."

msgid "Block sending test notifications to general coach"
msgstr "Imblokka n-notifiki tat-test lill-coach ġenerali"

msgid "Learners completing a test usually sends notifications to coaches, including the general session coach. Enable this option to omit the general coach from these notifications."
msgstr "L-istudenti li jtemmu test normalment jibagħtu notifiki lill-coaches, inkluż il-coach ġenerali tas-sessjoni. Ippermetti din l-għażla biex tħalli barra l-coach ġenerali minn dawn in-notifiki."

msgid "Add question feedback if incorrect answer"
msgstr "Żid feedback tal-mistoqsija jekk it-tweġiba tkun ħażina"

msgid "By default, Chamilo allows you to show feedback on each answer in a question. With this option, an additional field is created to provide pre-defined feedback to the whole question. This feedback will only appear if the user answered incorrectly."
msgstr "B'mod awtomatiku, Chamilo jippermettilek turi feedback fuq kull tweġiba f'mistoqsija. B'din l-għażla, jinħoloq qasam addizzjonali biex jipprovdi feedback predefinit għall-mistoqsija kollha. Dan il-feedback jidher biss jekk l-utent wieġeb ħażin."

msgid "Show 'previous' button in test to navigate questions"
msgstr "Uri l-buttuna 'preċedenti' fit-test biex tinnaviga l-mistoqsijiet"

msgid "Set this to false to disable the 'previous' button when answering questions in a test, thus forcing users to always move ahead."
msgstr "Issettja dan għal false biex tiddiżattiva l-buttuna 'preċedenti' meta twieġeb mistoqsijiet f'test, u b'hekk iġġiegħel lill-utenti dejjem jimxu 'l quddiem."

msgid "Audio feedback to submitted answers"
msgstr "Feedback bl-awdjo għat-tweġibiet sottomessi"

msgid "Allow teachers to provide feedback to users through audio (alternatively to text) on each question in a test."
msgstr "Ħalli l-għalliema jipprovdu feedback lill-utenti permezz tal-awdjo (alternattivament għat-test) fuq kull mistoqsija f'test."

msgid "Block copy-pasting in tests"
msgstr "Imblokka l-kopja u l-pejst fit-testijiet"

msgid "Block copy/paste/save/print keys and right-clicks in exercises."
msgstr "Imblokka l-kopja/pejst/save/print u l-klikks tal-lemin fl-eżerċizzji."

msgid "Always show test description on results page"
msgstr "Uri dejjem id-deskrizzjoni tat-test fil-paġna tar-riżultati"

msgid "Generate certificate on test end"
msgstr "Iġġenera ċertifikat meta jintemm it-test"

msgid "Generate certificate when ending a quiz. The quiz needs to be linked in the gradebook tool and have a pass percentage configured."
msgstr "Iġġenera ċertifikat meta jintemm quiz. Il-quiz irid ikun marbut fl-għodda tal-gradebook u jkollu perċentwal tal-għadd konfigurati."

msgid "Decimal score in open question types"
msgstr "Punteġġ deċimali fit-tipi ta' mistoqsijiet miftuħa"

msgid "Allow the teacher to rate the open, oral expression and annotation question types with a decimal score."
msgstr "Ħalli l-għalliema jivvalutaw it-tipi ta' mistoqsijiet miftuħa, espressjoni orali u annotazzjoni b'punteġġ deċimali."

msgid "Add answer-saving process check before test"
msgstr "Żid kontroll tal-proċess tas-salvataġġ tat-tweġibiet qabel it-test"

msgid "Make sure users are all set to start the test by providing a simulation of the question-saving process before entering the test. This allows for early detection of some connection issues and reduces user experience frictions."
msgstr "Kun żgur li l-utenti kollha huma lesti biex jibdew it-test billi tipprovdi simulazzjoni tal-proċess tas-salvataġġ tal-mistoqsijiet qabel ma tidħol fit-test. Dan jippermetti skoperta bikrija ta' xi problemi ta' konnessjoni u jnaqqas il-frizzjonijiet fl-esperjenza tal-utent."

msgid "Test notification settings at test-level"
msgstr "Settings tan-notifiki tat-test fil-livell tat-test"

msgid "Enable the configuration of test submission notifications at the test level rather than the course level. Falls back to course-level settings if not defined at test-level."
msgstr "Ippermetti l-konfigurazzjoni tan-notifiki tas-sottomissjoni tat-test fil-livell tat-test aktar milli fil-livell tal-kors. Jirritorna għas-settings tal-livell tal-kors jekk ma jkunux definiti fil-livell tat-test."

msgid "Hide open questions' score"
msgstr "Aħbi l-punteġġ tal-mistoqsijiet miftuħa"

msgid "Hide the fact that open questions (including audio and annotations) have a score by hiding the score display in all learner-facing reports."
msgstr "Aħbi l-fatt li l-mistoqsijiet miftuħa (inkluż awdjo u annotazzjonijiet) għandhom punteġġ billi taħbi d-dehra tal-punteġġ fir-rapporti kollha li jidhru lill-istudenti."

msgid "Hide user info on test results page"
msgstr "Aħbi l-informazzjoni tal-utent fil-paġna tar-riżultati tat-test"

msgid "The default test results page shows a user datasheet (photo, name, etc) which might, in some contexts, be considered as pushing the limits of personal data treatment. Enable this option to remove user details from the test results."
msgstr "Il-paġna tar-riżultati tat-test awtomatika turi datasheet tal-utent (ritratt, isem, eċċ.) li f'xi kuntesti jista' jitqies bħala li jimbotta l-limiti tat-trattament tad-data personali. Ippermetti din l-għażla biex tneħħi d-dettalji tal-utent mir-riżultati tat-test."

msgid "Show username in test results page"
msgstr "Uri l-username fil-paġna tar-riżultati tat-test"

msgid "Show the username (instead or, or as well as, the user info) on the test results page."
msgstr "Uri l-username (minflok, jew flimkien mal-informazzjoni tal-utent) fil-paġna tar-riżultati tat-test."

msgid "Allow tests auto-launch"
msgstr "Ħalli t-testijiet jibdew awtomatikament"

msgid "The auto-launch feature allows the teacher to set an exercise to open immediately upon accessing the course homepage. Enable this option and click on the rocket icon in the list of tests to enable."
msgstr "Il-karatteristika tal-awto-lanċjar tippermetti lill-għalliema jissettjaw eżerċizzju biex jinfetaħ immedjatament meta jidħol fil-homepage tal-kors. Ippermetti din l-għażla u kklikkja fuq l-ikona tar-rocket fil-lista tat-testijiet biex tippermetti."

msgid "Disable 'clean results' for teachers"
msgstr "Iddiżattiva 'naddaf ir-riżultati' għall-għalliema"

msgid "Disable the option to delete test results from the tests list. This is often used when less-careful teachers manage courses, to avoid critical mistakes."
msgstr "Iddiżattiva l-għażla li tħassar ir-riżultati tat-test mil-lista tat-testijiet. Dan spiss jintuża meta għalliema inqas attenti jimmaniġġjaw korsijiet, biex jevitaw żbalji kritiċi."

msgid "Show score for certainty degree questions"
msgstr "Uri l-punteġġ għall-mistoqsijiet tal-grad ta' ċertezza"

msgid "By default, Chamilo does not show a score for the certainty degree question types."
msgstr "B'mod awtomatiku, Chamilo ma juri punteġġ għat-tipi ta' mistoqsijiet tal-grad ta' ċertezza."

msgid "Show link to download test results"
msgstr "Uri link biex tniżżel ir-riżultati tat-test"

msgid "On the test results page, display a link to download the results as a file."
msgstr "Fil-paġna tar-riżultati tat-test, uri link biex tniżżel ir-riżultati bħala fajl."

msgid "Add score in mail notification of test submission"
msgstr "Żid il-punteġġ fin-notifika bl-email tas-sottomissjoni tat-test"

msgid "Add the learner's score to the e-mail notification sent to the teacher after a test was submitted."
msgstr "Żid il-punteġġ tal-istudent fin-notifika bl-email mibgħuta lill-għalliem wara li t-test ikun ġie sottomess."

msgid "Show expected choice in test results"
msgstr "Uri l-għażla mistennija fir-riżultati tat-test"

msgid "Show the expected choice and a status (right/wrong) for each answer on the test results page (if the test has been configured to show results)."
msgstr "Uri l-għażla mistennija u status (tajjeb/ħażin) għal kull tweġiba fil-paġna tar-riżultati tat-test (jekk it-test ikun ġie konfigurati biex juri r-riżultati)."

msgid "Round score in test exports"
msgstr "Arrotonda l-punteġġ fl-esportazzjonijiet tat-test"

msgid "Disable new test attempts"
msgstr "Iddiżattiva tentattivi ġodda tat-test"

msgid "Disable new test attempts globally. Usually used when there is a problem with tests in general and you want some time to analyse without blocking the whole platform."
msgstr "Iddiżattiva tentattivi ġodda tat-test globalment. Normalment jintuża meta jkun hemm problema bit-testijiet b'mod ġenerali u trid xi żmien biex tanalizza mingħajr ma timblokka l-pjattaforma kollha."

msgid "Show question IDs in tests"
msgstr "Uri l-IDs tal-mistoqsijiet fit-testijiet"

msgid "Show questions' internal IDs to let users take note of issues on specific questions and report them more efficiently."
msgstr "Uri l-IDs interni tal-mistoqsijiet biex l-utenti jkunu jistgħu jinnotaw problemi fuq mistoqsijiet speċifiċi u jirrappurtawhom b’mod aktar effiċjenti."

msgid "Show question pagination for teachers"
msgstr "Uri l-paġinazzjoni tal-mistoqsijiet għall-għalliema"

msgid "For tests with many questions, use pagination if the number of questions is higher than this setting. Set to 0 to prevent using pagination."
msgstr "Għal testijiet b’ħafna mistoqsijiet, uża l-paġinazzjoni jekk in-numru ta’ mistoqsijiet ikun ogħla minn din l-issettjar. Issettja għal 0 biex tevita l-użu tal-paġinazzjoni."

msgid "Question pagination length for teachers"
msgstr "Tul tal-paġinazzjoni tal-mistoqsijiet għall-għalliema"

msgid "Number of questions to show on every page when using the question pagination for teachers option."
msgstr "Numru ta’ mistoqsijiet li għandhom jintwerew f’kull paġna meta tintuża l-għażla tal-paġinazzjoni tal-mistoqsijiet għall-għalliema."

msgid "Limit teachers' permissions over tests"
msgstr "Illimita l-permessi tal-għalliema fuq it-testijiet"

msgid "When enabled, teachers cannot delete tests nor questions, change tests visibility, download to QTI, clean results, etc."
msgstr "Meta tkun attivata, l-għalliema ma jistgħux iħassru t-testijiet jew il-mistoqsijiet, ibiddlu l-viżibilità tat-testijiet, jniżżlu f’QTI, inaddfu r-riżultati, eċċ."

msgid "Lock questions of previous categories in a test"
msgstr "Issakkar il-mistoqsijiet tal-kategoriji preċedenti f’test"

msgid "When using this option, an additional option will appear in the test's configuration. When using a test with multiple question categories and asking for a distribution by category, this will allow the user to navigate questions per category. Once a category is finished, (s)he moves to the next category and cannot return to the previous category."
msgstr "Meta tuża din l-għażla, se tidher għażla addizzjonali fil-konfigurazzjoni tat-test. Meta tuża test b’diversi kategoriji ta’ mistoqsijiet u titlob distribuzzjoni skont il-kategorija, dan jippermetti lill-utent jinnaviga l-mistoqsijiet skont il-kategorija. Ladarba kategorija tkun lesta, (s)he jgħaddi għall-kategorija li jmiss u ma jistax jirritorna għall-kategorija preċedenti."

msgid "Tests score format"
msgstr "Format tal-punteġġ tat-testijiet"

msgid "Select between the following forms for the display of users' score in various reports: 1 = SCORE_AVERAGE (5 / 10); 2 = SCORE_PERCENT (50%); 3 = SCORE_DIV_PERCENT (5 / 10 (50%)). Use the numerical ID of the form you want to use."
msgstr "Agħżel bejn il-forom li ġejjin għall-wiri tal-punteġġ tal-utenti f’diversi rapporti: 1 = SCORE_AVERAGE (5 / 10); 2 = SCORE_PERCENT (50%); 3 = SCORE_DIV_PERCENT (5 / 10 (50%)). Uża l-ID numeriku tal-forma li trid tuża."

msgid "Additional links for teachers in tests list"
msgstr "Links addizzjonali għall-għalliema fil-lista tat-testijiet"

msgid "Configure callback elements to generate new action icons for teachers to the right side of the tests list, in the form of an array, e.g. ['myplugin' => ['MyPlugin', 'urlGeneratorCallback']]"
msgstr "Ikkonfigura elementi ta’ callback biex tiġġenera ikoni ta’ azzjoni ġodda għall-għalliema fuq in-naħa tal-lemin tal-lista tat-testijiet, fil-forma ta’ array, eż. ['myplugin' => ['MyPlugin', 'urlGeneratorCallback']]"

msgid "Add checkbox for answers count confirmation"
msgstr "Żid checkbox għall-konferma tan-numru ta’ tweġibiet"

msgid "This option adds a checkbox at the end of each test asking the user to confirm the number of answers saved. This provides better auditing data for critical tests."
msgstr "Din l-għażla żżid checkbox fl-aħħar ta’ kull test li titlob lill-utent jikkonferma n-numru ta’ tweġibiet salvati. Dan jipprovdi data ta’ verifika aħjar għal testijiet kritiċi."

msgid "Enable test categories"
msgstr "Attiva l-kategoriji tat-testijiet"

msgid "Test categories are not enabled by default because they add a level of complexity. Enable this feature to show all test categories related management icons appear."
msgstr "Il-kategoriji tat-testijiet mhumiex attivati b’mod awtomatiku għax iżidu livell ta’ kumplessità. Attiva din il-karatteristika biex juru l-ikoni kollha ta’ ġestjoni relatati mal-kategoriji tat-testijiet."

msgid "Enable test results page configuration"
msgstr "Attiva l-konfigurazzjoni tal-paġna tar-riżultati tat-testijiet"

msgid "Define an array of settings you want to apply to all tests results pages. Settings can be 'hide_question_score', 'hide_expected_answer', 'hide_category_table', 'hide_correct_answered_questions', 'hide_total_score' and possibly more in the future. Look for ‘getPageConfigurationAttribute’ in the code to see what’s in use."
msgstr "Iddefinixxi array ta’ settings li trid tapplika għall-paġni tar-riżultati tat-testijiet kollha. Is-settings jistgħu jkunu 'hide_question_score', 'hide_expected_answer', 'hide_category_table', 'hide_correct_answered_questions', 'hide_total_score' u possibbilment aktar fil-futur. Fittex ‘getPageConfigurationAttribute’ fil-kodiċi biex tara x’qed jintuża."

msgid "Enable test images zooming"
msgstr "Attiva ż-żum tal-immaġini tat-testijiet"

msgid "Enable this feature to allow users to zoom on images used in the tests."
msgstr "Attiva din il-karatteristika biex tippermetti lill-utenti jżumu fuq l-immaġini użati fit-testijiet."

msgid "Enable extra test answers recording"
msgstr "Attiva r-reġistrazzjoni addizzjonali tat-tweġibiet tat-testijiet"

msgid "Enable recording of all answers (even temporary) in the track_e_attempt_recording table. This feautre is experimentaland can create issues in the reporting pages when attempting to grade a test."
msgstr "Attiva r-reġistrazzjoni tat-tweġibiet kollha (anki temporanji) fit-tabella track_e_attempt_recording. Din il-karatteristika hija sperimentali u tista’ toħloq problemi fil-paġni tar-rapporti meta tipprova tikkoreġi test."

msgid "Enable selecting mandatory questions"
msgstr "Attiva l-għażla ta’ mistoqsijiet obbligatorji"

msgid "Enable the selection of mandatory questions in a test when using random categories."
msgstr "Attiva l-għażla ta’ mistoqsijiet obbligatorji f’test meta jintużaw kategoriji każwali."

msgid "Enable display of best score attempt"
msgstr "Attiva l-wiri tal-aħjar punteġġ"

msgid "Provide a list of courses and tests' IDs that will show the best score attempt for any learner in the reports. "
msgstr "Ipprovdi lista ta’ korsijiet u IDs tat-testijiet li juru l-aħjar punteġġ għal kwalunkwe student fir-rapporti."

msgid "Add user extra fields in exercise category report"
msgstr "Żid oqsma extra tal-utent fir-rapport tal-kategorija tal-eżerċizzju"

msgid "Define an array with the list of user extra fields to add to the report."
msgstr "Iddefinixxi array bil-lista ta’ oqsma extra tal-utent li għandhom jiżdiedu mar-rapport."

msgid "Score grades model"
msgstr "Mudell tal-gradi tal-punteġġ"

msgid "Define an array of score ranges and colors to display reports using this model. This allows you to show colors rather than numerical grades."
msgstr "Iddefinixxi array ta’ firxiet ta’ punteġġ u kuluri biex turi rapporti bl-użu ta’ dan il-mudell. Dan jippermettilek turi kuluri minflok gradi numeriċi."

msgid "Enable time per question in tests"
msgstr "Attiva l-ħin għal kull mistoqsija fit-testijiet"

msgid "By default, it is only possible to limit the time per test. Limiting it per question adds an extra layer of possibilities, and you can (carefully) combine both."
msgstr "B’mod awtomatiku, huwa possibbli biss tillimita l-ħin għal kull test. Illimitaha għal kull mistoqsija żżid saff addizzjonali ta’ possibbiltajiet, u tista’ (b’attenzjoni) tgħaqqad it-tnejn."

msgid "Global pending tests list"
msgstr "Lista globali tat-testijiet pendenti"

msgid "Enable to display to the final user a page with the list of pending tests across all courses."
msgstr "Attiva biex turi lill-utent finali paġna bil-lista tat-testijiet pendenti f’korsijiet kollha."

msgid "Quick image addition to question"
msgstr "Żieda rapida ta’ immaġni għall-mistoqsija"

msgid "Enable an additional icon in the test questions list to add an image as question description. This vastly accelerates question edition when the questions are in the title and the description only includes an image."
msgstr "Attiva ikona addizzjonali fil-lista tal-mistoqsijiet tat-test biex iżżid immaġni bħala deskrizzjoni tal-mistoqsija. Dan jaċċellera ħafna l-editjar tal-mistoqsijiet meta l-mistoqsijiet ikunu fit-titlu u d-deskrizzjoni tinkludi biss immaġni."

msgid "Hide user IP from test reports"
msgstr "Aħbi l-IP tal-utent mir-rapporti tat-testijiet"

msgid "By default, we show user information and its IP address, but this might be considered personal data, so this option allows you to remove this info from all test reports."
msgstr "B’mod awtomatiku, nuru l-informazzjoni tal-utent u l-indirizz IP tiegħu, iżda dan jista’ jitqies bħala data personali, għalhekk din l-għażla tippermettilek tneħħi din l-informazzjoni mir-rapporti tat-testijiet kollha."

msgid "Show deleted tests in 'My progress'"
msgstr "Uri t-testijiet imħassra f’'Il-progress tiegħi'"

msgid "Enable this option to display, on the 'My progress' page, the results of all tests you have taken, even the ones that have been deleted."
msgstr "Attiva din l-għażla biex turi, fil-paġna 'Il-progress tiegħi', ir-riżultati tat-testijiet kollha li ħadt, anki dawk li tħassru."

msgid "Show test attempts from all sessions in pending tests report"
msgstr "Uri l-attentati tat-testijiet minn sessjonijiet kollha fir-rapport tat-testijiet pendenti"

msgid "Show test attempts from users in all sessions where the general coach has access in pending tests report."
msgstr "Uri l-attentati tat-testijiet tal-utenti f’sessjonijiet kollha fejn il-kowċ ġenerali għandu aċċess fir-rapport tat-testijiet pendenti."

msgid "Show test attempts from all sessions in base course"
msgstr "Uri l-attentati tat-testijiet minn sessjonijiet kollha fil-kors bażi"

msgid "Show test attempts from users in all sessions to the teacher in the base course."
msgstr "Uri l-attentati tat-testijiet tal-utenti f’sessjonijiet kollha lill-għalliem fil-kors bażi."

msgid "Check all answers before submitting test"
msgstr "Iċċekkja t-tweġibiet kollha qabel tissottometti t-test"

msgid "Display a popup with the list of answered/unanswered questions before submitting the test."
msgstr "Uri popup bil-lista tal-mistoqsijiet imwieġba/mhux imwieġba qabel tissottometti t-test."

msgid "Discard orphan questions in course export"
msgstr "Armi mistoqsijiet orfni fl-esportazzjoni tal-kors"

msgid "When exporting a course, do not export the questions that are not part of any test."
msgstr "Meta tesporta kors, ma tesportax il-mistoqsijiet li mhumiex parti minn ebda test."

msgid "Bypass HTML filtering in test end messages"
msgstr "Bypass HTML filtering in test end messages"

msgid "Consider messages at the end of tests are always safe. Removing the filter makes it possible to use JavaScript there."
msgstr "Consider messages at the end of tests are always safe. Removing the filter makes it possible to use JavaScript there."

msgid "Bypass HTML filtering in test questions"
msgstr "Bypass HTML filtering in test questions"

msgid "Consider questions text in tests are always safe. Removing the filter makes it possible to use JavaScript there."
msgstr "Consider questions text in tests are always safe. Removing the filter makes it possible to use JavaScript there."

msgid "Automatically delete questions when deleting test"
msgstr "Automatically delete questions when deleting test"

msgid "The default behaviour is to make questions orphan when the only test using them is deleted. When enabled, this option ensure that all questions that would otherwise end up orphan are deleted as well."
msgstr "The default behaviour is to make questions orphan when the only test using them is deleted. When enabled, this option ensure that all questions that would otherwise end up orphan are deleted as well."

msgid "Hide test attempts table on test start page"
msgstr "Hide test attempts table on test start page"

msgid "Hide the table showing all previous attempts on the test start page."
msgstr "Hide the table showing all previous attempts on the test start page."

msgid "Hide the question incremental numbering when taking a test."
msgstr "Hide the question incremental numbering when taking a test."

msgid "Keep session active in tests"
msgstr "Keep session active in tests"

msgid "Keep session active by maintaining a regular ping signal to the server every x seconds, define here. We recommend once every 300 seconds."
msgstr "Keep session active by maintaining a regular ping signal to the server every x seconds, define here. We recommend once every 300 seconds."

msgid "Embeddable question types"
msgstr "Embeddable question types"

msgid "By default, only single answer and multiple answer questions are considered when deciding whether a test can be embedded in a video or not. With this option, you can decide that more question types are available. Be aware that not all question types fit nicely in the space assigned to videos. Questions types are availalble in the code in question.class.php."
msgstr "B'mod awtomatiku, biss mistoqsijiet b'risposta waħda u b'risposti multipli jitqiesu meta jiġi deċiż jekk test jistax jiġi inkorporat f'vidjo jew le. B'din l-għażla, tista' tiddeċiedi li aktar tipi ta' mistoqsijiet ikunu disponibbli. Kun konxju li mhux it-tipi kollha ta' mistoqsijiet jidħlu sew fl-ispazju assenjat għall-vidjows. It-tipi ta' mistoqsijiet huma disponibbli fil-kodiċi f'question.class.php."

msgid "Use course as global forum"
msgstr "Uża l-kors bħala forum globali"

msgid "Set the course ID (numerical) of a course reserverd to use as a global forum. This replaces the 'Social groups' link in the social network by a link to the forum of that course."
msgstr "Issettja l-ID tal-kors (numru) ta' kors riżervat biex jintuża bħala forum globali. Dan jissostitwixxi l-link 'Gruppi soċjali' fin-netwerk soċjali b'link għall-forum ta' dak il-kors."

msgid "Hide forum post review language"
msgstr "Aħbi l-lingwa tar-reviżjoni tal-post tal-forum"

msgid "Hide the possibility to assign a language to a forum post review."
msgstr "Aħbi l-possibbiltà li tingħata lingwa għal reviżjoni ta' post fil-forum."

msgid "Forum post review"
msgstr "Reviżjoni tal-post tal-forum"

msgid "Enable this option to allow asking for a review or a translation to one's post in a forum. When extensively configured, can be used to collaborate with other users in a language-learning forum."
msgstr "Attiva din l-għażla biex tippermetti li tintalab reviżjoni jew traduzzjoni ta' post fil-forum. Meta tiġi kkonfigurata b'mod estensiv, tista' tintuża biex tikkollabora ma' utenti oħra f'forum ta' tagħlim tal-lingwa."

msgid "Fold forum categories"
msgstr "Iġbor kategoriji tal-forum"

msgid "Visual effect to enable forum categories folding/unfolding."
msgstr "Effett viżiv biex tippermetti l-ġbir/u l-ftuħ tal-kategoriji tal-forum."

msgid "Forum categories language filter"
msgstr "Filtru tal-lingwa tal-kategoriji tal-forum"

msgid "Add a language filter to the forum view to only see categries configured in a specific language. Requires using the 'language' extra field on the 'forum_category' entity."
msgstr "Żid filtru tal-lingwa fil-vista tal-forum biex tara biss kategoriji kkonfigurati b'lingwa speċifika. Jeħtieġ l-użu tal-qasam żejjed 'language' fuq l-entità 'forum_category'."

msgid "Forum notifications from base course as well"
msgstr "Notifiki tal-forum mill-kors bażi wkoll"

msgid "Enable this option to enable notifications coming from the base course forum, even if following the course through a session."
msgstr "Attiva din l-għażla biex tippermetti notifiki li jiġu mill-forum tal-kors bażi, anke jekk issegwi l-kors permezz ta' sessjoni."

msgid "Default glossary view"
msgstr "Vista default tal-glossarju"

msgid "Choose which view ('table' or 'list') will be used by default in the glossary tool."
msgstr "Agħżel liema vista ('tabella' jew 'lista') tintuża b'mod awtomatiku fl-għodda tal-glossarju."

msgid "Remove HTML tags in glossary export"
msgstr "Neħħi t-tags HTML fl-esportazzjoni tal-glossarju"

msgid "Hide gradebook charts"
msgstr "Aħbi l-grafiċi tal-gradebook"

msgid "If your portal is resources-limited, reducing the generation of the dynamic gradebok charts with potentially thousands of results is a good option."
msgstr "Jekk il-portal tiegħek għandu riżorsi limitati, tnaqqis fil-ġenerazzjoni tal-grafiċi dinamiċi tal-gradebook b'potenzjalment eluf ta' riżultati hija għażla tajba."

msgid "Hide gradebook button 'download PDF report'"
msgstr "Aħbi l-buttuna tal-gradebook 'niżżel rapport PDF'"

msgid "Hide percentage in best/average gradebook results"
msgstr "Aħbi l-perċentwali fir-riżultati tal-aħjar/medja tal-gradebook"

msgid "Use test settings for grades display"
msgstr "Uża s-settings tat-test għall-wiri tal-gradi"

msgid "Use APCu caching to speed up gradebok"
msgstr "Uża l-caching APCu biex tħaffef il-gradebook"

msgid "Improve speed when rendering gradebook student reports using Doctrine APCU cache. APCu is an optional but recommended PHP extension."
msgstr "Ittejjeb il-veloċità meta tirrendi r-rapporti tal-istudenti tal-gradebook billi tuża l-cache Doctrine APCU. APCu huwa estensjoni PHP fakultattiva iżda rakkomandata."

msgid "Gradebook reports score style"
msgstr "Stil tal-punteġġ tar-rapporti tal-gradebook"

msgid "Add gradebook score style configuration in the flat view. See api.lib.php in order to find the options: examples SCORE_DIV = 1, SCORE_PERCENT = 2, etc"
msgstr "Żid konfigurazzjoni tal-istil tal-punteġġ tal-gradebook fil-vista ċatta. Ara api.lib.php biex issib l-għażliet: eżempji SCORE_DIV = 1, SCORE_PERCENT = 2, eċċ."

msgid "Custom score display in gradebook's standalone column"
msgstr "Wiri tal-punteġġ personalizzat fil-kolonna indipendenti tal-gradebook"

msgid "Use global score display setting in gradebook"
msgstr "Uża s-setting globali tal-wiri tal-punteġġ fil-gradebook"

msgid "Inter-gradebook dependencies"
msgstr "Dipendenzi bejn il-gradebooks"

msgid "Enables a mechanism of gradebook dependencies that lets people know which other items they need to go through first in order to complete the gradebook."
msgstr "Jippermetti mekkaniżmu ta' dipendenzi tal-gradebook li jgħarraf lill-utenti liema oġġetti oħra għandhom jgħaddu minnhom l-ewwel sabiex jikkompletaw il-gradebook."

msgid "Mandatory courses for gradebook dependencies"
msgstr "Korsijiet obbligatorji għad-dipendenzi tal-gradebook"

msgid "When using inter-gradebook dependencies, you can choose a list of mandatory courses that will be required before approving any gradebook that has dependencies."
msgstr "Meta tuża d-dipendenzi bejn il-gradebooks, tista' tagħżel lista ta' korsijiet obbligatorji li jkunu meħtieġa qabel ma jiġi approvat kwalunkwe gradebook li għandu dipendenzi."

msgid "Gradebook badges sidebar"
msgstr "Bar tal-badge tal-gradebook"

msgid "Generate a block inside the side menu where a few badges can be shown as pending approval. Requires gradebooks to be listed here, by (numerical) ID."
msgstr "Iġġenera blokk fil-menu laterali fejn jistgħu jintwerew ftit badges bħala pendenti għall-approvazzjoni. Jeħtieġ li l-gradebooks jiġu elenkati hawn, bl-ID (numru)."

msgid "Allow multiple evaluation attempts in gradebook"
msgstr "Ħalli tentattivi multipli ta' evalwazzjoni fil-gradebook"

msgid "Cache results in the gradebook"
msgstr "Ħażen ir-riżultati fil-gradebook"

msgid "Put some of the large calculations of averages in cached fields for the links and evaluations to increase speed (considerably). The potential negative impact is that it can take some time to refresh the gradebook results tables."
msgstr "Poġġi xi wħud mill-kalkoli kbar tal-medji f'oqsma maħżuna għall-links u l-evalwazzjonijiet biex iżżid il-veloċità (b'mod konsiderevoli). L-impatt negattiv potenzjali huwa li jista' jieħu ftit żmien biex jirrifreska t-tabelli tar-riżultati tal-gradebook."

msgid "User extra fields in gradebook flat view"
msgstr "Oqsma addizzjonali tal-utent fil-gradebook f'vista ċatta"

msgid "Add the given columns ('variables' array) to the main results table in the gradebook."
msgstr "Żid il-kolonni mogħtija (array 'variables') mat-tabella prinċipali tar-riżultati fil-gradebook."

msgid "Gradebook PDF export options"
msgstr "Għażliet ta' esportazzjoni PDF tal-Gradebook"

msgid "Change the PDF export for learners based on the provided settings ('hide_score_weight', 'hide_feedback_textarea', ...)"
msgstr "Ibdel l-esportazzjoni PDF għall-istudenti skont is-settings mogħtija ('hide_score_weight', 'hide_feedback_textarea', ...)"

msgid "Gradebook comments"
msgstr "Kummenti tal-Gradebook"

msgid "Enable gradebook comments so teachers can add a comment to the overall performance of the learner in this course. The comment will appear in the PDF export for the learner."
msgstr "Attiva kummenti tal-gradebook sabiex l-għalliema jkunu jistgħu jżidu kumment dwar il-prestazzjoni ġenerali tal-istudent f'dan il-kors. Il-kumment jidher fl-esportazzjoni PDF għall-istudent."

msgid "Gradebook extra statistics"
msgstr "Statistiċi addizzjonali tal-Gradebook"

msgid "Add additional columns to the gradebook's main report (1 = ranking, 2 = best score, 3 = average)."
msgstr "Żid kolonni addizzjonali fir-rapport prinċipali tal-gradebook (1 = klassifikazzjoni, 2 = l-aħjar punteġġ, 3 = medja)."

msgid "Hide gradebook table for learners"
msgstr "Aħbi t-tabella tal-gradebook għall-istudenti"

msgid "Reduce gradebook load time by hiding the results table (but still giving access to certificates, skills, etc)."
msgstr "Naqqas iż-żmien tat-tagħbija tal-gradebook billi taħbi t-tabella tar-riżultati (imma xorta tagħti aċċess għaċ-ċertifikati, il-ħiliet, eċċ)."

msgid "Hide item links for learners in gradebook"
msgstr "Aħbi l-links tal-oġġetti għall-istudenti fil-gradebook"

msgid "Avoid learners clicking on items from the gradebook by removing the links on the items."
msgstr "Evita li l-istudenti jikklikkjaw fuq oġġetti mill-gradebook billi tneħħi l-links fuq l-oġġetti."

msgid "Enable skills by gradebook's subcategory"
msgstr "Attiva ħiliet skont is-subkategorija tal-gradebook"

msgid "Skills are normally attributed for completing a whole gradebook. By enabling this option, you allow skills to be attached to sub-sections of gradebooks."
msgstr "Il-ħiliet normalment jingħataw għat-tlestija ta' gradebook sħiħ. Billi tattiva din l-għażla, tippermetti li l-ħiliet jiġu marbuta ma' taqsimiet sekondarji tal-gradebooks."

msgid "Language switcher in main menu"
msgstr "Bidla tal-lingwa fil-menu prinċipali"

msgid "Display a language selector in the main menu that immediately updates the language preference of the user. This can be useful in multilingual portals where learners have to switch from one language to another for their learning."
msgstr "Uri selettur tal-lingwa fil-menu prinċipali li jaġġorna immedjatament il-preferenza tal-lingwa tal-utent. Dan jista' jkun utli f'portals multilingwi fejn l-istudenti jkollhom jibdlu minn lingwa għal oħra għat-tagħlim tagħhom."

msgid "Language flags"
msgstr "Bnadra tal-lingwi"

msgid "Use country flags for languages. This is not enabled by default because some languages are not strictly attached to a country, which can lead to frustration for some users."
msgstr "Uża bnadra tal-pajjiżi għal-lingwi. Dan mhux attivat b'mod awtomatiku għax xi lingwi mhumiex marbuta strettament ma' pajjiż, li jista' jwassal għal frustrazzjoni għal xi utenti."

msgid "Multiple-language courses"
msgstr "Korsijiet b'lingwi multipli"

msgid "Enable courses managed in more than one language. This option adds a language selector within the course page to let users switch easily, and adds a 'multiple_language' extra field to courses which allows for remote management procedures."
msgstr "Attiva korsijiet immexxija f'aktar minn lingwa waħda. Din l-għażla żżid selettur tal-lingwa fil-paġna tal-kors biex l-utenti jkunu jistgħu jibdlu faċilment, u żżid qasam addizzjonali 'multiple_language' għall-korsijiet li jippermetti proċeduri ta' ġestjoni remota."

msgid "Multiple-language document templates"
msgstr "Mudelli ta' dokumenti b'lingwi multipli"

msgid "Enable document templates (at the platform or course level) to be configured for specific languages."
msgstr "Attiva mudelli ta' dokumenti (fil-livell tal-pjattaforma jew tal-kors) li jistgħu jiġu kkonfigurati għal lingwi speċifiċi."

msgid "Invisible tests visible in learning paths"
msgstr "Testijiet inviżibbli viżibbli fil-mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim"

msgid "Make tests marked as 'invisible' in the tests tool appear when they are included in a learning path."
msgstr "Agħmel it-testijiet immarkati bħala 'inviżibbli' fl-għodda tat-testijiet jidhru meta jkunu inklużi f'mogħdija ta' tagħlim."

msgid "Export all files when exporting a learning path"
msgstr "Esporta l-fajls kollha meta tesporta mogħdija ta' tagħlim"

msgid "When exporting a LP, all files and folders in the same path of an html will be exported too."
msgstr "Meta tesporta LP, il-fajls u l-folders kollha fl-istess mogħdija ta' HTML jiġu esportati wkoll."

msgid "Learning path's prerequisites"
msgstr "Prerekwiżiti tal-mogħdija ta' tagħlim"

msgid "On the learning paths lists, display a visual element to show that other learning paths are currently blocked by some prerequisites rule."
msgstr "Fil-listi tal-mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim, uri element viżwali biex turi li mogħdijiet oħra ta' tagħlim huma bħalissa mblukkati minn xi regola ta' prerekwiżiti."

msgid "Hide time from learning paths records"
msgstr "Aħbi l-ħin mir-rekords tal-mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim"

msgid "Hide learning paths time spent in reports in general."
msgstr "Aħbi l-ħin imqatta' fil-mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim fir-rapporti b'mod ġenerali."

msgid "Foldable learning paths' categories"
msgstr "Kategoriji tal-mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim li jistgħu jintlew"

msgid "Enable to allow users to fold the categories in the learning paths list."
msgstr "Attiva biex tippermetti lill-utenti jlew il-kategoriji fil-lista tal-mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim."

msgid "Foldable learning paths' items"
msgstr "Oġġetti tal-mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim li jistgħu jintlew"

msgid "Disable JS in learning paths view"
msgstr "Iddiżattiva JS fil-vista tal-mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim"

msgid "Disable JS files that Chamilo usually adds to HTML files in the learning path (while displaying them)."
msgstr "Iddiżattiva fajls JS li Chamilo normalment iżid ma' fajls HTML fil-mogħdija ta' tagħlim (waqt li jurihom)."

msgid "Teachers can access blocked learning paths"
msgstr "L-għalliema jistgħu jaċċessaw mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim imblukkati"

msgid "Teachers do not need to pass complete learning paths to have access to a prerequisites-blocked learning path."
msgstr "L-għalliema m'għandhomx bżonn jgħaddu minn mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim sħaħ biex ikollhom aċċess għal mogħdija ta' tagħlim imblukkata minn prerekwiżiti."

msgid "Export learning paths in the Chamilo backup format"
msgstr "Esporta mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim fil-format ta' backup ta' Chamilo"

msgid "Enable the possibility to export any of your learning paths in a Chamilo course backup format."
msgstr "Attiva l-possibbiltà li tesporta kwalunkwe waħda mill-mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim tiegħek f'format ta' backup ta' kors ta' Chamilo."

msgid "Hide requirements label in learning paths"
msgstr "Aħbi t-tikketta tar-rekwiżiti fil-mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim"

msgid "Hide the pre-requisites tooltip on learning path items. This is mostly an estaethic choice."
msgstr "Aħbi t-tooltip tal-prerekwiżiti fuq l-oġġetti tal-mogħdija ta' tagħlim. Din hija l-aktar għażla estetika."

msgid "Minimum time to complete learning path"
msgstr "Ħin minimu biex titlesta l-mogħdija ta' tagħlim"

msgid "Add a minimum time field to learning paths. If the user has not spent that much time on the learning path, the last item of the learning path cannot be completed."
msgstr "Żid qasam ta' ħin minimu għall-mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim. Jekk l-utent ma jkunx qatta' dak il-ħin fuq il-mogħdija ta' tagħlim, l-aħħar oġġett tal-mogħdija ta' tagħlim ma jistax jitlesta."

msgid "Use learning path item status from other sessions"
msgstr "Uża l-istatus tal-oġġett tal-mogħdija ta' tagħlim minn sessjonijiet oħra"

msgid "Allow users to complete prerequisites in a learning path if the corresponding item was already completed in another session."
msgstr "Ħalli lill-utenti jlestu prerekwiżiti f'mogħdija ta' tagħlim jekk l-oġġett korrispondenti kien diġà tlesta f'sessjoni oħra."

msgid "Display tests from learning paths even if invisible"
msgstr "Uri t-testijiet mill-mogħdijiet ta' tagħlim anke jekk inviżibbli"

msgid "Show hidden exercises that were added to a LP in the exercise list. If we are in a session, the test is invisible in the base course, it is included in a LP and the setting to show it is not specifically set to true, then hide it."
msgstr "Uri eżerċizzji moħbija li ġew miżjuda ma' LP fil-lista tal-eżerċizzji. Jekk inkunu f'sessjoni, it-test huwa inviżibbli fil-kors bażi, huwa inkluż f'LP u s-setting biex jintwera mhux speċifikatament issettjat għal true, allura aħbih."

msgid "Learning path menu location"
msgstr "Post tal-menu tal-mogħdija ta' tagħlim"

msgid "Set this to 'left' or 'right' to change the side of the learning path menu."
msgstr "Issettja dan għal 'left' jew 'right' biex tibdel in-naħa tal-menu tal-mogħdija ta' tagħlim."

msgid "Use learning path score as progress"
msgstr "Uża l-punteġġ tal-mogħdija ta' tagħlim bħala progress"

msgid "This is useful when using SCORM content with only one large SCO. SCORM does not communicate progress, so this is a trick to use the score as progress. Enabling this option will let you configure this on a per-learning path basis."
msgstr "Dan huwa utli meta tuża kontenut SCORM b'SCO wieħed kbir biss. SCORM ma jikkomunikax il-progress, għalhekk din hija trick biex tuża l-punteġġ bħala progress. L-attivazzjoni ta' din l-għażla tħallik tikkonfigura dan fuq bażi ta' mogħdija ta' tagħlim."

msgid "Prevent beforeunload JS event in learning path"
msgstr "Evita l-avveniment JS beforeunload fil-mogħdija ta' tagħlim"

msgid "This helps with browser compatibility by preventing tricky JS events to execute."
msgstr "Dan jgħin fil-kompatibilità tal-browser billi jipprevjeni avvenimenti JS delikati milli jiġu esegwiti."

msgid "Hide 'My learning paths' page"
msgstr "Aħbi l-paġna 'Il-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim tiegħi'"

msgid "The page 'My learning path' was added in 1.11. Use this option to hide it."
msgstr "Il-paġna 'Il-mogħdija tat-tagħlim tiegħi' ġiet miżjuda fl-1.11. Uża din l-għażla biex taħbiha."

msgid "Use username as student_id in SCORM communication"
msgstr "Uża l-isem tal-utent bħala student_id fil-komunikazzjoni SCORM"

msgid "Use extra field as student_id in SCORM communication"
msgstr "Uża oqsma addizzjonali bħala student_id fil-komunikazzjoni SCORM"

msgid "Give the name of the extra field to be used as student_id for all SCORM communication."
msgstr "Agħti l-isem tal-oqsma addizzjonali li għandhom jintużaw bħala student_id għall-komunikazzjoni SCORM kollha."

msgid "SCORM import within course import"
msgstr "Importazzjoni SCORM fi ħdan l-importazzjoni tal-kors"

msgid "Enable to copy the directory structure of SCORM packages when restoring a course (from the course maintenance tool)."
msgstr "Ippermetti li tikkopja l-istruttura tad-direttorju tal-pakketti SCORM meta tirrestawra kors (mill-għodda tal-manutenzjoni tal-kors)."

msgid "Allow .htaccess from SCORM packages"
msgstr "Ippermetti .htaccess mill-pakketti SCORM"

msgid "Normally, all .htaccess files are filtered and removed when importing content in Chamilo. This feature allows .htaccess to be imported if it is present in a SCORM package."
msgstr "Normalment, il-fajls .htaccess kollha jiġu ffiltrati u mneħħija meta jkun qed jiġi importat kontenut f'Chamilo. Din il-karatteristika tippermetti li .htaccess jiġi importat jekk ikun preżenti f'pakett SCORM."

msgid "Learning paths categories can be managed in sessions"
msgstr "Il-kategoriji tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim jistgħu jiġu mmaniġġjati fis-sessjonijiet"

msgid "Add learning paths and tests info to ticket reporting"
msgstr "Żid informazzjoni dwar il-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim u t-testijiet fir-rapportar tal-biljetti"

msgid "Learning paths subscription settings"
msgstr "Settings tal-abbonament għall-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "Configure additional options for the learning paths subscription feature. Options include 'allow_add_users_to_lp' and 'allow_add_users_to_lp_category'."
msgstr "Ikkonfigura għażliet addizzjonali għall-karatteristika tal-abbonament għall-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim. L-għażliet jinkludu 'allow_add_users_to_lp' u 'allow_add_users_to_lp_category'."

msgid "Learning path display settings"
msgstr "Settings tal-wiri tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "Configure additional options for the learning paths display. Options include 'show_reporting_icon', 'hide_lp_arrow_navigation', 'show_toolbar_by_default', 'navigation_in_the_middle' and 'add_extra_quit_to_home_icon'."
msgstr "Ikkonfigura għażliet addizzjonali għall-wiri tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim. L-għażliet jinkludu 'show_reporting_icon', 'hide_lp_arrow_navigation', 'show_toolbar_by_default', 'navigation_in_the_middle' u 'add_extra_quit_to_home_icon'."

msgid "Download button after finishing learning paths"
msgstr "Buttun tat-tniżżil wara li jintemmu l-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "Show download files button after finishing all LP. Example: if ABC is the course code, and 1 and 100 are the doc id, choose: ['courses' => ['ABC' => [1, 100]]]."
msgstr "Uri l-buttun tat-tniżżil tal-fajls wara li jintemmu l-LP kollha. Eżempju: jekk ABC huwa l-kodiċi tal-kors, u 1 u 100 huma l-id tad-dokument, agħżel: ['courses' => ['ABC' => [1, 100]]]."

msgid "Learning paths subscription for classes"
msgstr "Abbonament għall-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim għall-klassijiet"

msgid "Enable subscription to learning paths and learning path categories to groups/classes."
msgstr "Ippermetti abbonament għall-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim u l-kategoriji tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim għall-gruppi/klassijiet."

msgid "Fixed encoding in learning path"
msgstr "Kodifikazzjoni fissa fil-mogħdija tat-tagħlim"

msgid "Reduce resource usage by ignoring a check on the text encoding in imported learning paths."
msgstr "Naqqas l-użu tar-riżorsi billi tinjora kontroll fuq il-kodifikazzjoni tat-test fil-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim importati."

msgid "Use last score in learning path test prerequisites"
msgstr "Uża l-aħħar punteġġ fil-prerekwiżiti tat-test tal-mogħdija tat-tagħlim"

msgid "When a test is used as prerequisite for an item in the learning path, use the last attempt of the test only as validation for the prerequisite (default is to use best attempt)."
msgstr "Meta test jintuża bħala prerekwiżit għal element fil-mogħdija tat-tagħlim, uża biss l-aħħar tentattiv tat-test bħala validazzjoni għall-prerekwiżit (id-difolt huwa li jintuża l-aħjar tentattiv)."

msgid "Display tests in list of learning path tests even if invisible"
msgstr "Uri t-testijiet fil-lista tat-testijiet tal-mogħdija tat-tagħlim anke jekk huma inviżibbli"

msgid "Edition of tests included in learning paths"
msgstr "Editjar tat-testijiet inklużi fil-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "Enable editing tests even if they have been included in a learning path. The default is to prevent edition if the test is in a learning path, because that can affect consistency of tracking among many learners if test modifications are significant."
msgstr "Ippermetti l-editjar tat-testijiet anke jekk dawn ġew inklużi f'mogħdija tat-tagħlim. Id-difolt huwa li jipprevjeni l-editjar jekk it-test ikun f'mogħdija tat-tagħlim, għax dan jista' jaffettwa l-konsistenza tat-traċċar fost ħafna studenti jekk il-modifiki tat-test ikunu sinifikanti."

msgid "Unlocked information in learning paths list"
msgstr "Informazzjoni mhux imsakkra fil-lista tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "This adds an 'unlocked' column in the learning paths list if the learner is subscribed to the given learning path and has access to it."
msgstr "Dan iżid kolonna 'mhux imsakkra' fil-lista tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim jekk l-istudent ikun abbonat għall-mogħdija tat-tagħlim mogħtija u jkollu aċċess għaliha."

msgid "Show max progress instead of average for learning paths reporting"
msgstr "Uri l-progress massimu minflok il-medja għar-rapportar tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "Select max progress vs average for learning paths at course level"
msgstr "Agħżel progress massimu vs medja għall-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim fil-livell tal-kors"

msgid "Enable redefinition of the setting to show the best progress instead of averages in reporting of learnpaths at a course level."
msgstr "Ippermetti ridifinizzjoni tas-setting biex turi l-aħjar progress minflok il-medji fir-rapportar tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim fil-livell tal-kors."

msgid "Learners can export learning paths"
msgstr "L-istudenti jistgħu jesportaw il-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "Enable this to allow learners to download the learning paths as SCORM packages."
msgstr "Ippermetti dan biex l-istudenti jkunu jistgħu jniżżlu l-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim bħala pakketti SCORM."

msgid "Display link to learning path on course home when invisible"
msgstr "Uri link għall-mogħdija tat-tagħlim fil-homepage tal-kors meta tkun inviżibbli"

msgid "If a learning path is set to invisible but the teacher/coach decided to make it available from the course homepage, this option prevents Chamilo from hiding the link on the course homepage."
msgstr "Jekk mogħdija tat-tagħlim tkun issettjata bħala inviżibbli iżda l-għalliem/kowċ iddeċieda li jagħmilha disponibbli mill-homepage tal-kors, din l-għażla tipprevjeni lil Chamilo milli jaħbi l-link fuq il-homepage tal-kors."

msgid "Display learning path availability to learners"
msgstr "Uri d-disponibbiltà tal-mogħdija tat-tagħlim lill-istudenti"

msgid "Show learning paths to learners with their availability dates, rather than hiding them until the date comes."
msgstr "Uri l-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim lill-istudenti bid-dati tad-disponibbiltà tagħhom, minflok ma taħbihom sakemm tiġi d-data."

msgid "Update SCO status autonomously"
msgstr "Aġġorna l-istatus SCO b'mod awtonomu"

msgid "If the SCO is not sending a status, take over and update the status based on what can be observed in Chamilo."
msgstr "Jekk l-SCO ma jkunx qed jibgħat status, ħu f'idejk u aġġorna l-istatus ibbażat fuq dak li jista' jiġi osservat f'Chamilo."

msgid "Upload SCORM from cache dir"
msgstr "Tella' SCORM mid-direttorju cache"

msgid "Allow admins to upload a SCORM package (in zip form) into the cache directory and to use it as import source on the SCORM upload page."
msgstr "Ippermetti lill-amministraturi jtellgħu pakketti SCORM (f'forma ta' zip) fid-direttorju cache u jużawhom bħala sors ta' importazzjoni fil-paġna tat-tlugħ SCORM."

msgid "Unlock learning path item if max attempt is reached for test prerequisite"
msgstr "Iftaħ l-element tal-mogħdija tat-tagħlim jekk jintlaħaq l-ammont massimu ta' tentattivi għall-prerekwiżit tat-test"

msgid "Hide percentage sign in average of tests in learning paths in learner follow-up"
msgstr "Aħbi s-sinjal tal-perċentwali fil-medja tat-testijiet fil-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim fil-follow-up tal-istudenti"

msgid "Hides the icon of percentage in 'Average of tests in Learning Paths' indication on a student tracking"
msgstr "Jaħbi l-ikona tal-perċentwali fl-indikazzjoni 'Medja tat-testijiet fil-Mogħdijiet tat-Tagħlim' fuq it-traċċar tal-istudent"

msgid "Add acquisition column in learner follow-up"
msgstr "Żid kolonna tal-akkwist fil-follow-up tal-istudenti"

msgid "Add column to learner follow-up page to show acquisition status by a learner on a learning path."
msgstr "Żid kolonna fil-paġna ta' segwiment tal-istudenti biex turi l-istatus tal-akkwist ta' student f'perkors ta' tagħlim."

msgid "Add visibility information for learning paths on learner follow-up page"
msgstr "Żid informazzjoni dwar il-viżibilità tal-perkorsi ta' tagħlim fil-paġna ta' segwiment tal-istudenti"

msgid "Include learning paths not subscribed to on learner follow-up page"
msgstr "Inkludi perkorsi ta' tagħlim li l-istudent ma jkunx irreġistra għalihom fil-paġna ta' segwiment tal-istudenti"

msgid "Order of tools on 'My progress' page"
msgstr "Ordni tal-għodod fil-paġna 'Il-progress tiegħi'"

msgid "Change the order of tools shown on the 'My progress' page for learners. Options include 'quizzes', 'learning_paths' and 'skills'."
msgstr "Ibdel l-ordni tal-għodod murija fil-paġna 'Il-progress tiegħi' għall-istudenti. L-għażliet jinkludu 'quizzes', 'learning_paths' u 'skills'."

msgid "Navigate between learning paths"
msgstr "Innaviga bejn il-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "Add the possibility to select a 'next' learning path and show buttons inside the learning path to move from one to the next."
msgstr "Żid il-possibbiltà li tagħżel 'li jmiss' mogħdija tat-tagħlim u turi buttuni ġewwa l-mogħdija tat-tagħlim biex tmur minn waħda għall-oħra."

msgid "Date-based learning path items prerequisites"
msgstr "Prerekwiżiti tal-oġġetti tal-mogħdija tat-tagħlim ibbażati fuq id-data"

msgid "Adds the option to define prerequisites with start and end dates for learnpath items."
msgstr "Iżżid l-għażla li tiddefinixxi prerekwiżiti bid-dati tal-bidu u tat-tmiem għall-oġġetti tal-mogħdija tat-tagħlim."

msgid "Update users e-mail to dummy value during imports"
msgstr "Aġġorna l-e-mails tal-utenti għal valur fittizju waqt l-importazzjonijiet"

msgid "During special CSV cron imports of users, automatically replace e-mails with dummy e-mail username@example.com."
msgstr "Waqt importazzjonijiet speċjali ta' CSV tal-utenti permezz ta' cron, ibdel awtomatikament l-e-mails b'e-mail fittizju username@example.com."

msgid "Extra e-mail HTML header attributes"
msgstr "Attributi HTML addizzjonali tal-header tal-e-mail"

msgid "Extra e-mail HTML body attributes"
msgstr "Attributi HTML addizzjonali tal-body tal-e-mail"

msgid "E-mail editor for anonymous"
msgstr "Editur tal-e-mail għall-anonimi"

msgid "Allow anonymous users to send e-mails from the platform. In this day and age of information security this is not a recommended option."
msgstr "Ħalli l-utenti anonimi jibagħtu e-mails mill-pjattaforma. F'dan iż-żmien ta' sigurtà tal-informazzjoni din mhix għażla rakkomandata."

msgid "Hide e-mail content to bring users to platform"
msgstr "Aħbi l-kontenut tal-e-mail biex iġġib l-utenti lejn il-pjattaforma"

msgid "Prefer short e-mail versions with a link to the messaging space on the platform to increase platform-based engagement."
msgstr "Ippreferixxi verżjonijiet qosra tal-e-mail b'link għall-ispazju tal-messaġġi fuq il-pjattaforma biex iżżid l-involviment ibbażat fuq il-pjattaforma."

msgid "Send 2 registration e-mails"
msgstr "Ibgħat 2 e-mails ta' reġistrazzjoni"

msgid "Send two separate e-mails on registration. One for the username, another one for the password."
msgstr "Ibgħat żewġ e-mails separati waqt ir-reġistrazzjoni. Wieħed għall-username, ieħor għall-password."

msgid "Show sender's e-mail address in notifications"
msgstr "Uri l-indirizz tal-e-mail tal-mittent fin-notifiki"

msgid "Send score in percentage in test results notification"
msgstr "Ibgħat il-punteġġ f'persentaġġ fin-notifika tar-riżultati tat-test"

msgid "E-mail addresses to send cronjobs execution reports"
msgstr "Indirizzi tal-e-mail biex tibgħat rapporti ta' eżekuzzjoni tal-cronjobs"

msgid "Given as array of e-mail addresses. Does not work for all cronjobs yet."
msgstr "Mogħtija bħala array ta' indirizzi tal-e-mail. Għadha ma taħdimx għall-cronjobs kollha."

msgid "Extended notifications footer"
msgstr "Footer estiż tan-notifiki"

msgid "Add a custom extra footer for notifications emails for a specific language, for example for privacy policy notices. Multiple languages and paragraphs can be added."
msgstr "Żid footer addizzjonali personalizzat għall-e-mails tan-notifiki għal lingwa speċifika, pereżempju għal avviżi tal-politika tal-privatezza. Jistgħu jiżdiedu lingwi u paragrafi multipli."

msgid "Allow private messages between teachers about a learner"
msgstr "Ħalli messaġġi privati bejn l-għalliema dwar student"

msgid "Allow exchange of messages from teachers/bosses about a user from the tracking page of that user."
msgstr "Ħalli l-iskambju ta' messaġġi mill-għalliema/kapijiet dwar utent mill-paġna tat-traċċar ta' dak l-utent."

msgid "Allow learners to see messages about them between teachers"
msgstr "Ħalli l-istudenti jaraw messaġġi dwarhom bejn l-għalliema"

msgid "If exchange of messages about a user are enabled, this option will allow the corresponding user to see the messages. This is to comply with rules of transparency the organization may need to comply to."
msgstr "Jekk l-iskambju ta' messaġġi dwar utent ikun attivat, din l-għażla tippermetti lill-utent korrispondenti jara l-messaġġi. Dan huwa biex jikkonforma mar-regoli tat-trasparenza li l-organizzazzjoni tista' tkun teħtieġ tikkonforma magħhom."

msgid "Like/Dislike for social posts"
msgstr "Like/Dislike għall-posts soċjali"

msgid "Allows users to add feedback (likes or dislikes) to posts in social wall."
msgstr "Jippermetti lill-utenti jżidu feedback (likes jew dislikes) għall-posts fil-ħajt soċjali."

msgid "Disable 'dislike' for social posts"
msgstr "Itfi 'dislike' għall-posts soċjali"

msgid "Remove the thumb down option for social posts feedback. Only keep thumb up (like)."
msgstr "Neħħi l-għażla ta' thumb down għall-feedback tal-posts soċjali. Żomm biss thumb up (like)."

msgid "Admins can see personal messages"
msgstr "L-amministraturi jistgħu jaraw messaġġi personali"

msgid "Allow administrators to see personal messages between a teacher and a learner. Please make sure you include a note in your terms and conditions as this might affect privacy protection."
msgstr "Ħalli l-amministraturi jaraw messaġġi personali bejn għalliem u student. Kun żgur li tinkludi nota fit-termini u l-kundizzjonijiet tiegħek peress li dan jista' jaffettwa l-protezzjoni tal-privatezza."

msgid "Teachers can access learners messages only within session timeframe"
msgstr "L-għalliema jistgħu jaċċessaw messaġġi tal-istudenti biss fil-perjodu tas-sessjoni"

msgid "Filter messages between a teacher and a learner between the session start end dates"
msgstr "Iffiltra l-messaġġi bejn għalliem u student bejn id-dati tal-bidu u tat-tmiem tas-sessjoni"

msgid "UNO converter binaries"
msgstr "Binaries tal-konvertitur UNO"

msgid "Give the system path to the UNO converter library to enable some extra exporting features."
msgstr "Agħti l-path tas-sistema għal-librerija tal-konvertitur UNO biex tippermetti xi karatteristiċi addizzjonali ta' esportazzjoni."

msgid "Hide main navigation menu"
msgstr "Aħbi l-menu ewlieni tan-navigazzjoni"

msgid "When using Chamilo for a specific purpose (like one massive online exam), you might want to reduce distraction even more by removing the side menu."
msgstr "Meta tuża Chamilo għal skop speċifiku (bħal eżami online massiv), tista' trid tnaqqas id-distrazzjoni aktar billi tneħħi l-menu laterali."

msgid "PDF export resolution"
msgstr "Riżoluzzjoni tal-esportazzjoni PDF"

msgid "This represents the resolution of generated PDF files (in dot per inch, or dpi). The default is 96. Increasing it will give you better resolution PDF files but will also increase the weight and generation time of the files."
msgstr "Dan jirrappreżenta r-riżoluzzjoni tal-fajls PDF ġġenerati (f'punti għal kull pulzier, jew dpi). Id-default huwa 96. Iż-żieda tagħha tagħtik fajls PDF b'riżoluzzjoni aħjar iżda se żżid ukoll il-piż u l-ħin tal-ġenerazzjoni tal-fajls."

msgid "Skip generic data in learner self-tracking page"
msgstr "Aqbeż id-data ġenerika fil-paġna ta' self-tracking tal-istudent"

msgid "If the 'My progress' page takes too long to load, you might want to remove the processing of generic statistics for the user. In this case enable this setting."
msgstr "Jekk il-paġna 'Il-progress tiegħi' tieħu wisq ħin biex titgħabba, tista' trid tneħħi l-ipproċessar tal-istatistiċi ġeneriċi għall-utent. F'dan il-każ attiva din l-issettjar."

msgid "Hide the complete username in 'who is online'"
msgstr "Aħbi l-username sħiħ f' 'min hu online'"

msgid "The 'who is online' page (if enabled) will show a picture and a name for each user currently online. Enable this option to hide the names."
msgstr "Il-paġna 'min hu online' (jekk attivat) se turi stampa u isem għal kull utent li jkun online bħalissa. Attiva din l-għażla biex taħbi l-ismijiet."

msgid "Default number of table rows"
msgstr "Numru default ta' ringieli tat-tabella"

msgid "How many rows should be shown in all tables by default."
msgstr "Kemm ringieli għandhom jintwerew fit-tabelli kollha b'mod default."

msgid "Double validation for registration process"
msgstr "Validazzjoni doppja għall-proċess tar-reġistrazzjoni"

msgid "Simply display a confirmation request on the registration page before going forward with the user creation."
msgstr "Sempliċement uri talba ta' konferma fil-paġna tar-reġistrazzjoni qabel ma tkompli bil-ħolqien tal-utent."

msgid "Prevent access to 'My progress'"
msgstr "Ipprevjeni l-aċċess għal 'Il-progress tiegħi'"

msgid "In specific implementations like online exams, you might want to prevent user access to the 'My progress' page."
msgstr "F'implimentazzjonijiet speċifiċi bħal eżamijiet online, tista' trid tipprevjeni l-aċċess tal-utent għall-paġna 'Il-progress tiegħi'."

msgid "Generate random username"
msgstr "Iġġenera username każwali"

msgid "When importing users (batch processes), automatically generate a random string for username. Otherwise, the username will be generated on the basis of the firstname and lastname, or the prefix of the e-mail."
msgstr "Meta timporta utenti (proċessi f'lott), iġġenera awtomatikament stringa każwali għall-isem tal-utent. Inkella, l-isem tal-utent jiġi ġġenerat abbażi tal-isem u l-kunjom, jew il-prefiss tal-email."

msgid "Timepicker increment"
msgstr "Żieda tal-għażla tal-ħin"

msgid "Minimal time increment (in minutes) when selecting a date and time with the timepicker widget. For example, it might not be useful to have less than 5 or 15 minutes increments when talking about assignment submission, availability of a test, start time of a session, etc."
msgstr "L-iżgħar żieda ta' ħin (f'minuti) meta tagħżel data u ħin bil-widget tal-għażla tal-ħin. Per eżempju, jista' ma jkunx utli li jkollok inqas minn 5 jew 15-il minuta żieda meta tkun qed titkellem dwar sottomissjoni ta' kompiti, disponibbiltà ta' test, ħin tal-bidu ta' sessjoni, eċċ."

msgid "Proxy settings"
msgstr "Settings tal-proxy"

msgid "Some features of Chamilo will connect to the exterior from the server. For example to make sure an external content exists when creating a link or showing an embedded page in the learning path. If your Chamilo server uses a proxy to get out of its network, this would be the place to configure it.<br><pre> [ 'stream_context_create' => [ 'http' => [ 'proxy' => 'tcp://example.com:8080', 'request_fulluri' => true ] ], 'curl_setopt_array' => [ 'CURLOPT_PROXY' => 'http://example.com', 'CURLOPT_PROXYPORT' => '8080' ] ] </pre>"
msgstr "Xi karatteristiċi ta' Chamilo jikkonnettjaw mal-barra mis-server. Per eżempju biex jiżguraw li kontenut estern jeżisti meta jinħoloq link jew tintwera paġna inkorporata fil-perkors ta' tagħlim. Jekk is-server Chamilo tiegħek juża proxy biex joħroġ min-network tiegħu, dan ikun il-post fejn tikkonfigura dan.<br><pre> [ 'stream_context_create' => [ 'http' => [ 'proxy' => 'tcp:\/\/example.com:8080', 'request_fulluri' => true ] ], 'curl_setopt_array' => [ 'CURLOPT_PROXY' => 'http:\/\/example.com', 'CURLOPT_PROXYPORT' => '8080' ] ] </pre>"

msgid "Video features"
msgstr "Karatteristiċi tal-vidjow"

msgid "Array of extra features you can enable for the video player in Chamilo. Options include 'speed', which allows you to change the playback speed of a video.<br><pre> ['features' => ['speed']] </pre>"
msgstr "Array ta' karatteristiċi żejda li tista' tippermetti għall-plejer tal-vidjow f'Chamilo. L-għażliet jinkludu 'speed', li tippermettilek tibdel il-veloċità tal-playback ta' vidjow.<br><pre> ['features' => ['speed']] </pre>"

msgid "Default offered pagination numbers in tables"
msgstr "Numri ta' paginazzjoni offruti b'mod default fit-tabelli"

msgid "Set the options you want to appear in the navigation around a table to show less or more rows on one page. e.g. [50, 100, 200, 500].<br><pre> ['options' => [50, 100, 200, 500]] </pre>"
msgstr "Issettja l-għażliet li trid jidhru fin-navigazzjoni madwar tabella biex turi inqas jew aktar ringieli f'paġna waħda. eż. [50, 100, 200, 500].<br><pre> ['options' => [50, 100, 200, 500]] </pre>"

msgid "Webservices return user field"
msgstr "Webservices jirritornaw il-qasam tal-utent"

msgid "Ask REST webservices (v2.php) to return another identifier for fields related to user ID. This is useful if the external system doesn't really deal with user IDs as they are in Chamilo, as it helps the external system match the user data return with some external data that is know to Chamilo. For example, if you use an external authentication system, you can return the extra field used to match the user with the external authentication system rather than user.id."
msgstr "Itlob webservices REST (v2.php) biex jirritornaw identifikatur ieħor għall-oqsma relatati mal-ID tal-utent. Dan huwa utli jekk is-sistema esterna ma tittrattax l-IDs tal-utenti kif huma f'Chamilo, peress li jgħin lis-sistema esterna tqabbel ir-ritorn tad-data tal-utent ma' xi data esterna magħrufa minn Chamilo. Per eżempju, jekk tuża sistema ta' awtentikazzjoni esterna, tista' tirritorna l-qasam żejjed użat biex tqabbel l-utent mas-sistema ta' awtentikazzjoni esterna minflok user.id."

msgid "Hide disabled settings in sub-URLs"
msgstr "Aħbi s-settings diżattivati fis-sub-URLs"

msgid "Set to yes to hide settings completely in a sub-URL if the setting is disabled in the main URL (where the access_url_changeable field = 0)"
msgstr "Issettja għal iva biex taħbi s-settings kompletament f'sub-URL jekk is-setting ikun diżattivat fil-URL prinċipali (fejn il-qasam access_url_changeable = 0)"

msgid "Max login attempts before lockdown"
msgstr "Numru massimu ta' tentattivi ta' login qabel il-lockdown"

msgid "Number of failed login attempts to tolerate before the user account is locked and has to be unlocked by an admin."
msgstr "Numru ta' tentattivi ta' login falluti li jistgħu jiġu tollerati qabel ma l-kont tal-utent jiġi msakkar u jkollu jiġi miftuħ minn admin."

msgid "Force password renewal at first login"
msgstr "Ġiegħel it-tiġdid tal-password fl-ewwel login"

msgid "This is one simple measure to increase the security of your portal by asking users to immediately change their password, so the one that was transfered by e-mail is no longer valid and they then will use one that they came up with and that they are the only person to know."
msgstr "Din hija miżura sempliċi waħda biex iżżid is-sigurtà tal-portal tiegħek billi titlob lill-utenti jibdlu l-password immedjatament, sabiex dik li ġiet trasferita bl-email ma tibqax valida u mbagħad jużaw waħda li ħasbuha huma stess u li huma biss jafuha."

msgid "Hide breadcrumb if 'not allowed'"
msgstr "Aħbi l-breadcrumb jekk 'mhux permess'"

msgid "If the user is not allowed to access a specific page, also hide the breadcrumb. This increases security by avoiding the display of unnecessary information."
msgstr "Jekk l-utent ma jkunx permess jaċċessa paġna speċifika, aħbi wkoll il-breadcrumb. Dan iżid is-sigurtà billi jevita l-wiri ta' informazzjoni mhux meħtieġa."

msgid "LDAP connection configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurazzjoni tal-konnessjoni LDAP"

msgid "Array defining host and port for the LDAP server.<br><pre> ['host' => '', 'port' => ''] </pre>"
msgstr "Array li tiddefinixxi l-host u l-port għas-server LDAP.<br><pre> ['host' => '', 'port' => ''] </pre>"

msgid "Set expiration date on first login"
msgstr "Issettja d-data ta' skadenza fl-ewwel login"

msgid "Array defining the 'days' and 'months' to set the account expiration date when the user first logs in.<br><pre> [ 'days' => 0, 'months' => 0, ] </pre>"
msgstr "Array li tiddefinixxi l-'ġranet' u x-'xhur' biex tissettja d-data ta' skadenza tal-kont meta l-utent jidħol għall-ewwel darba.<br><pre> [ 'days' => 0, 'months' => 0, ] </pre>"

msgid "Selective display of roles"
msgstr "Wirja selettiva tar-rwoli"

msgid "An array of role => true/false that defines whether that role should be shown or hidden.<br><pre> [ 'COURSEMANAGER' => true, 'STUDENT' => true, 'DRH' => false, 'SESSIONADMIN' => false, 'STUDENT_BOSS' => false, 'INVITEE' => false ] </pre>"
msgstr "An array of role => true/false that defines whether that role should be shown or hidden.<br><pre> [ 'COURSEMANAGER' => true, 'STUDENT' => true, 'DRH' => false, 'SESSIONADMIN' => false, 'STUDENT_BOSS' => false, 'INVITEE' => false ] </pre>"

msgid "Roles display options"
msgstr "Għażliet tal-wiri tar-rwoli"

msgid "An array of role => true/false that defines whether that role should be shown or hidden."
msgstr "Array ta' role => true/false li tiddefinixxi jekk dak ir-rwol għandux jintwera jew jinħeba."

msgid "Default expiration days by role"
msgstr "Ġranet ta' skadenza default skont ir-rwol"

msgid "An array of role = > number which represents the number of days an account has before expiration, depending on the role.<br><pre> [ 'COURSEMANAGER' => 365, 'STUDENT' => 31, 'DRH' => 31, 'SESSIONADMIN' => 60, 'STUDENT_BOSS' => 60, 'INVITEE' => 31 ] </pre>"
msgstr "Array ta' role = > numru li jirrappreżenta n-numru ta' ġranet li kont għandu qabel ma jiskadi, skont ir-rwol.<br><pre> [ 'COURSEMANAGER' => 365, 'STUDENT' => 31, 'DRH' => 31, 'SESSIONADMIN' => 60, 'STUDENT_BOSS' => 60, 'INVITEE' => 31 ] </pre>"

msgid "Set an extra field as trigger for registration as ex-learner"
msgstr "Issettja qasam żejjed bħala trigger għar-reġistrazzjoni bħala ex-learner"

msgid "Give an extra field label here. If this extra field is updated for any user, a process is triggered to check the access to this user to courses with the same given extra field."
msgstr "Agħti tikketta ta' qasam żejjed hawn. Jekk dan il-qasam żejjed jiġi aġġornat għal kwalunkwe utent, proċess jiġi attivat biex jiċċekkja l-aċċess ta' dan l-utent għal korsijiet bl-istess qasam żejjed mogħti."

msgid "Hide 'never expires' option for users"
msgstr "Aħbi l-għażla 'qatt ma jiskadi' għall-utenti"

msgid "Remove the option 'never expires' when creating/editing a user account."
msgstr "Neħħi l-għażla 'qatt ma jiskadi' meta toħloq/teditja kont tal-utent."

msgid "URL for alternative platform logo"
msgstr "URL għal logo alternattiv tal-pjattaforma"

msgid "Replaces the Chamilo logo by loading a (possibly remote) URL. Make sure this is allowed by your security policies."
msgstr "Jissostitwixxi l-logo ta' Chamilo billi jgħabbi URL (possibbilment remot). Kun żgur li dan huwa permess mill-politiki tas-sigurtà tiegħek."

msgid "Use external career ID in diagrams"
msgstr "Uża ID tal-karriera esterna fid-dijagrammi"

msgid "If using career diagrams, show an extra field instead of the internal career ID."
msgstr "Jekk tuża dijagrammi tal-karriera, uri qasam żejjed minflok l-ID intern tal-karriera."

msgid "Disable web services"
msgstr "Diżattiva s-servizzi web"

msgid "If you do not use web services, enable this to avoid any unnecessary security risk."
msgstr "Jekk ma tużax servizzi web, attiva dan biex tevita kwalunkwe riskju ta' sigurtà mhux meħtieġ."

msgid "Enable admin-only web services"
msgstr "Attiva servizzi web għall-amministraturi biss"

msgid "Some REST web services are marked for admins only and are disabled by default. Enable this feature to give access to these web services (to users with admin credentials, obviously)."
msgstr "Xi servizzi web REST huma mmarkati għall-amministraturi biss u huma diżattivati b'mod default. Attiva din il-karatteristika biex tagħti aċċess għal dawn is-servizzi web (lill-utenti b'kredenzjali ta' admin, ovvjament)."

msgid "Enable edition of course work time"
msgstr "Attiva l-editjar tal-ħin tax-xogħol tal-kors"

msgid "Enable this feature to let teachers manually update the time spent in the course by learners."
msgstr "Attiva din il-karatteristika biex tħalli lill-għalliema jaġġornaw manwalment il-ħin li jintefaq fil-kors mill-istudenti."

msgid "Internal ID of the user used to send disabled account notifications"
msgstr "ID intern tal-utent użat biex jibgħat notifiki dwar kontijiet diżattivati"

msgid "Avoid being too personal with users by using a 'bot' account to send e-mails to users when their account is disabled for some reason."
msgstr "Evita li tkun wisq personali mal-utenti billi tuża kont 'bot' biex tibgħat emails lill-utenti meta l-kont tagħhom jiġi diżattivat għal xi raġuni."

msgid "Enable portfolio advanced sharing"
msgstr "Attiva l-qsim avvanzat tal-portafoll"

msgid "Decide who can view the posts and comments of the portfolio."
msgstr "Iddeċiedi min jista' jara l-posts u l-kummenti tal-portafoll."

msgid "Redirect index.php to given URL for authenticated users"
msgstr "Irridirezzjona index.php għal URL mogħti għall-utenti awtentikati"

msgid "If you do not want to use the index page (announcements, popular courses, etc), you can define here the script (from the document root) where users will be redirected when trying to load the index."
msgstr "Jekk ma tridx tuża l-paġna tal-indiċi (avviżi, korsijiet popolari, eċċ), tista' tiddefinixxi hawn l-iskript (mill-għerq tad-dokumenti) fejn l-utenti jiġu ridiretti meta jippruvaw jitgħabbew l-indiċi."

msgid "Default menu entry for courses"
msgstr "Entrata default tal-menu għall-korsijiet"

msgid "Define the default sub-elements of the 'Courses' entry to display if user is not registered to any course nor session."
msgstr "Iddefinixxi l-elementi subordnati default tal-entrata 'Korsijiet' li għandhom jintwerew jekk l-utent ma jkunx irreġistrat għal ebda kors jew sessjoni."

msgid "Fields users are allowed to change in their profile"
msgstr "Oqsma li l-utenti jistgħu jibdlu fil-profil tagħhom"

msgid "Select the fields users will be able to change on their profile page."
msgstr "Agħżel l-oqsma li l-utenti jkunu jistgħu jibdlu fil-paġna tal-profil tagħhom."

msgid "Filter users on profile fields on subscription to course"
msgstr "Iffiltra l-utenti fuq oqsma tal-profil meta jissottoskrivu għal kors"

msgid "Allow teachers to filter the users based on extra fields on the page to subscribe users to their course."
msgstr "Ħalli l-għalliema jiffiltraw l-utenti abbażi ta' oqsma addizzjonali fil-paġna biex jissottoskrivu l-utenti għall-kors tagħhom."

msgid "Hide username when already showing complete name"
msgstr "Aħbi l-isem tal-utent meta diġà jintwera l-isem sħiħ"

msgid "Some internal functions will return the username when returning the user's complete name. With this option enabled, you ensure the username will not appear."
msgstr "Xi funzjonijiet interni jirritornaw l-isem tal-utent meta jirritornaw l-isem sħiħ tal-utent. B'din l-għażla attivata, tiżgura li l-isem tal-utent ma jidhirx."

msgid "Hide username in course chat"
msgstr "Aħbi l-isem tal-utent fiċ-chat tal-kors"

msgid "In the course chat, hide the username. Only display people's names."
msgstr "Fiċ-chat tal-kors, aħbi l-isem tal-utent. Uri biss l-ismijiet tan-nies."

msgid "Enable career diagrams"
msgstr "Attiva d-dijagrammi tal-karriera"

msgid "Career diagrams allow you to display diagrams of careers, skills and courses."
msgstr "Id-dijagrammi tal-karriera jippermettulek turi dijagrammi tal-karrieri, il-ħiliet u l-korsijiet."

msgid "Disable making tool users visible in public courses"
msgstr "Iddiżattiva li l-utenti tal-għodda jsiru viżibbli f'korsijiet pubbliċi"

msgid "Avoid anyone making the 'users' tool visible in a public course."
msgstr "Evita li ħaddieħor jagħmel l-għodda 'utenti' viżibbli f'kors pubbliku."

msgid "Default number of items per page in mySpace"
msgstr "Numru default ta' oġġetti għal kull paġna f'mySpace"

msgid "Pre-fill the mail with user and course info in footer contact"
msgstr "Imla minn qabel l-email bl-informazzjoni tal-utent u tal-kors fil-footer tal-kuntatt"

msgid "Add subject and body in the mailto: footer."
msgstr "Żid is-suġġett u l-korp fil-mailto: tal-footer."

msgid "Custom page for password reminder"
msgstr "Paġna personalizzata għat-tfakkira tal-password"

msgid "Set your own URL to a password reset page. Useful when using a federated account management system."
msgstr "Issettja l-URL tiegħek stess għal paġna ta' reset tal-password. Utile meta tuża sistema ta' ġestjoni tal-kontijiet federati."

msgid "Add helper to add two names in registration"
msgstr "Żid għajnuna biex iżżid żewġ ismijiet fir-reġistrazzjoni"

msgid "Add help text for users to enter two names in the registration form when double lastnames are common."
msgstr "Żid test ta' għajnuna għall-utenti biex idaħħlu żewġ ismijiet fil-formola tar-reġistrazzjoni meta l-kunjomijiet doppji jkunu komuni."

msgid "Disable GDPR features"
msgstr "Iddiżattiva l-karatteristiċi tal-GDPR"

msgid "If you already manage your personal data protection declaration to users elsewhere, you can safely disable this feature."
msgstr "Jekk diġà tmexxi d-dikjarazzjoni tal-protezzjoni tad-data personali tal-utenti x'imkien ieħor, tista' tiddiżattiva b'mod sigur din il-karatteristika."

msgid "Data protection officer name"
msgstr "Isem l-uffiċjal tal-protezzjoni tad-data"

msgid "Data protection officer role"
msgstr "Rwol tal-uffiċjal tal-protezzjoni tad-data"

msgid "Data protection officer e-mail address"
msgstr "Indirizz tal-email tal-uffiċjal tal-protezzjoni tad-data"

msgid "Hide fields from users list in course"
msgstr "Aħbi oqsma mil-lista tal-utenti fil-kors"

msgid "By default, we show all data from users in the users tool in the course. This array allows you to specify which fields you do not want to display. Only affects main fields (not extra fields)."
msgstr "B'mod default, nuru d-data kollha tal-utenti fl-għodda tal-utenti fil-kors. Dan l-array jippermettilek tispeċifika liema oqsma ma tridx turi. Jaffettwa biss l-oqsma prinċipali (mhux oqsma addizzjonali)."

msgid "Send mail to admin when user created"
msgstr "Ibgħat email lill-amministratur meta jinħoloq utent"

msgid "Send email notification to admin when a user is created."
msgstr "Ibgħat notifika bl-email lill-amministratur meta jinħoloq utent."

msgid "Show specific registration conditions"
msgstr "Uri kundizzjonijiet speċifiċi tar-reġistrazzjoni"

msgid "Show multiple conditions to user during sign up process. Provide an array with each element containing 'variable' (internal extra field name), 'display_text' (simple text for a checkbox), 'text_area' (long text of conditions)."
msgstr "Uri kundizzjonijiet multipli lill-utent waqt il-proċess tal-iffirmar. Ipprovdi array b'kull element li jkun fih 'variable' (isem intern tal-qasam addizzjonali), 'display_text' (test sempliċi għal checkbox), 'text_area' (test twil tal-kundizzjonijiet)."

msgid "Allow teachers to manage classes"
msgstr "Ħalli l-għalliema jimmaniġġjaw il-klassijiet"

msgid "Fields visible on profile page"
msgstr "Oqsma viżibbli fil-paġna tal-profil"

msgid "Array of fields and whether (boolean) they are visible or not on the user's profile page (also works with extra fields labels)."
msgstr "Array ta' oqsma u jekk (boolean) humiex viżibbli jew le fil-paġna tal-profil tal-utent (jaħdem ukoll ma' tikketti ta' oqsma addizzjonali)."

msgid "Options for user import"
msgstr "Għażliet għall-importazzjoni tal-utenti"

msgid "Array of options to apply as default parameters in the CSV/XML user import."
msgstr "Array ta' għażliet li għandhom jiġu applikati bħala parametri default fl-importazzjoni tal-utenti CSV/XML."

msgid "Search users by extra fields in users list for admins"
msgstr "Fittex utenti skont oqsma addizzjonali fil-lista tal-utenti għall-amministraturi"

msgid "Naturally include the given extra fields (array of extra fields labels) in the user searches."
msgstr "Inkludi b'mod naturali l-oqsma addizzjonali mogħtija (array ta' tikketti ta' oqsma addizzjonali) fit-tfittxijiet tal-utenti."

msgid "Enable career diagrams for users"
msgstr "Attiva d-dijagrammi tal-karriera għall-utenti"

msgid "If career diagrams are enabled, users can only see them (and only the diagrams that correspond to their studies) if you enable this option."
msgstr "Jekk id-dijagrammi tal-karriera huma attivati, l-utenti jistgħu jarawhom biss (u biss id-dijagrammi li jikkorrispondu għall-istudji tagħhom) jekk tattiva din l-għażla."

msgid "Community managers list"
msgstr "Lista tal-maniġers tal-komunità"

msgid "Provide an array of user IDs that will be considered community managers in the special course designated as global forum. Community managers have additional privileges on the global forum."
msgstr "Ipprovdi array ta' IDs tal-utenti li se jitqiesu bħala maniġers tal-komunità fil-kors speċjali ddeżinjat bħala forum globali. Il-maniġers tal-komunità għandhom privileġġi addizzjonali fuq il-forum globali."

msgid "Users geolocation on a map"
msgstr "Ġeolokalizzazzjoni tal-utenti fuq mappa"

msgid "Enable the display of a map in the social network allowing you to locate other users. This includes several positions (current and destination) which have to be defined as addresses or coordinates in separate extra fields. The extra fields must be set as an array here."
msgstr "Attiva l-wiri ta' mappa fin-netwerk soċjali li jippermettilek tidentifika utenti oħra. Dan jinkludi diversi pożizzjonijiet (attwali u destinazzjoni) li jridu jiġu definiti bħala indirizzi jew koordinati f'oqsma addizzjonali separati. L-oqsma addizzjonali għandhom jiġu ssettjati bħala array hawnhekk."

msgid "Display a legend below the career diagram"
msgstr "Uri leġġenda taħt id-dijagramma tal-karriera"

msgid "Add a career legend below the career diagram. A language variable called 'Career diagram legend' must exist in your sub-language."
msgstr "Żid leġġenda tal-karriera taħt id-dijagramma tal-karriera. Varjabbli tal-lingwa msejħa 'Leġġenda tad-dijagramma tal-karriera' trid teżisti fis-sottolingwa tiegħek."

msgid "Display a disclaimer below the career diagram"
msgstr "Uri ċaħda ta' responsabbiltà taħt id-dijagramma tal-karriera"

msgid "Add a disclaimer below the career diagram. A language variable called 'Career diagram disclaimer' must exist in your sub-language."
msgstr "Żid ċaħda ta' responsabbiltà taħt id-dijagramma tal-karriera. Varjabbli tal-lingwa msejħa 'Ċaħda ta' responsabbiltà tad-dijagramma tal-karriera' trid teżisti fis-sottolingwa tiegħek."

msgid "LinkedIn Orgnization ID"
msgstr "ID tal-Organizzazzjoni LinkedIn"

msgid "When sharing a badge on LinkedIn, LinkedIn allows you to set an organization ID that will link to the LinkedIn's page of your organization (to link the organization attributing the badge)."
msgstr "Meta taqsam badge fuq LinkedIn, LinkedIn jippermettilek tissettja ID tal-organizzazzjoni li se tikkollega mal-paġna ta' LinkedIn tal-organizzazzjoni tiegħek (biex tikkollega l-organizzazzjoni li tattribwixxi l-badge)."

msgid "Required fields during registration"
msgstr "Oqsma obbligatorji waqt ir-reġistrazzjoni"

msgid "Required extra fields during registration"
msgstr "Oqsma żejda obbligatorji waqt ir-reġistrazzjoni"

msgid "Restrict fields shown during registration"
msgstr "Oqsma limitati murija waqt ir-reġistrazzjoni"

msgid "If you only want to show some of the available profile field, your can complete the array here with sub-elements 'fields' and 'extra_fields' containing arrays with a list of the fields to show."
msgstr "Jekk trid turi biss xi wħud mill-oqsma tal-profil disponibbli, tista' tikkompleta l-array hawn b'sott-elementi 'fields' u 'extra_fields' li jkun fihom arrays b'lista tal-oqsma li għandhom jintwerew."

msgid "Send the welcome message to e-mail and inbox"
msgstr "Ibgħat il-messaġġ ta' merħba bl-email u fl-inbox"

msgid "By default, the welcome message (with credentials) is sent only by e-mail. Enable this option to send it to the user's Chamilo inbox as well."
msgstr "B'mod awtomatiku, il-messaġġ ta' merħba (bil-kredenzjali) jintbagħat biss bl-email. Attiva din l-għażla biex tibgħatu wkoll fl-inbox ta' Chamilo tal-utent."

msgid "Admins can set users passwords manually"
msgstr "L-amministraturi jistgħu jissettjaw il-passwords tal-utenti manwalment"

msgid "Check password strength"
msgstr "Iċċekkja s-saħħa tal-password"

msgid "HTTP Strict Transport Security"
msgstr "HTTP Strict Transport Security"

msgid "HTTP Strict Transport Security is an excellent feature to support on your site and strengthens your implementation of TLS by getting the User Agent to enforce the use of HTTPS. Recommended value: 'strict-transport-security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains'. See https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Strict-Transport-Security. You can include the 'preload' suffix, but this has consequences on the top level domain (TLD), so probably not to be done lightly. See https://hstspreload.org/. Leave blank to disable."
msgstr "HTTP Strict Transport Security hija karatteristika eċċellenti li għandha tiġi appoġġjata fuq is-sit tiegħek u ssaħħaħ l-implimentazzjoni tiegħek ta' TLS billi ġġiegħel lill-User Agent juża HTTPS. Valur rakkomandat: 'strict-transport-security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains'. Ara https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Strict-Transport-Security. Tista' tinkludi s-suffiss 'preload', iżda dan għandu konsegwenzi fuq id-dominju ta' livell għoli (TLD), għalhekk probabbilment mhux għandu jsir b'mod ħafif. Ara https://hstspreload.org/. Ħalli vojt biex tiddiżattiva."

msgid "Content Security Policy"
msgstr "Content Security Policy"

msgid "Content Security Policy is an effective measure to protect your site from XSS attacks. By whitelisting sources of approved content, you can prevent the browser from loading malicious assets. This setting is particularly complicated to set with WYSIWYG editors, but if you add all domains that you want to authorize for iframes inclusion in the child-src statement, this example should work for you. You can prevent JavaScript from executing from external sources (including inside SVG images) by using a strict list in the 'script-src' argument. Leave blank to disable. Example setting: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; child-src 'self' *.youtube.com yt.be *.vimeo.com *.slideshare.com;"
msgstr "Il-Politika tas-Sigurtà tal-Kontenut hija miżura effettiva biex tipproteġi s-sit tiegħek minn attakki XSS. Billi telenka sorsi ta' kontenut approvat, tista' tipprevjeni lill-browser milli jgħabbi assi malizzjużi. Din l-issettjar hija partikolarment ikkumplikata biex tissettja ma' edituri WYSIWYG, iżda jekk iżżid id-dominji kollha li trid tawtorizza għall-inklużjoni ta' iframes fid-dikjarazzjoni child-src, dan l-eżempju għandu jaħdem għalik. Tista' tipprevjeni JavaScript milli jeżegwixxi minn sorsi esterni (inkluż ġewwa stampi SVG) billi tuża lista stretta fl-argument 'script-src'. Ħalli vojt biex tiddiżattiva. Eżempju ta' issettjar: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; child-src 'self' *.youtube.com yt.be *.vimeo.com *.slideshare.com;"

msgid "Content Security Policy report only"
msgstr "Politika tas-Sigurtà tal-Kontenut tirrapporta biss"

msgid "This setting allows you to experiment by reporting but not enforcing some Content Security Policy."
msgstr "Dan l-issettjar jippermettilek tesperimenta billi tirrapporta iżda ma tinforzax xi Politika tas-Sigurtà tal-Kontenut."

msgid "HTTP Public Key Pinning"
msgstr "HTTP Public Key Pinning"

msgid "HTTP Public Key Pinning protects your site from MiTM attacks using rogue X.509 certificates. By whitelisting only the identities that the browser should trust, your users are protected in the event a certificate authority is compromised."
msgstr "HTTP Public Key Pinning jipproteġi s-sit tiegħek minn attakki MiTM billi juża ċertifikati X.509 foloz. Billi telenka biss l-identitajiet li l-browser għandu jafda, l-utenti tiegħek huma protetti fil-każ li awtorità ta' ċertifikati tiġi kompromessa."

msgid "HTTP Public Key Pinning report only"
msgstr "HTTP Public Key Pinning tirrapporta biss"

msgid "This setting allows you to experiment by reporting but not enforcing some HTTP Public Key Pinning."
msgstr "Dan l-issettjar jippermettilek tesperimenta billi tirrapporta iżda ma tinforzax xi HTTP Public Key Pinning."

msgid "X-Frame-Options"
msgstr "X-Frame-Options"

msgid "X-Frame-Options tells the browser whether you want to allow your site to be framed or not. By preventing a browser from framing your site you can defend against attacks like clickjacking. If defining a URL here, it should define the URL(s) from which your content should be visible, not the URLs from which your site accepts content. For example, if your main URL (root_web above) is https://11.chamilo.org/, then this setting should be: 'ALLOW-FROM https://11.chamilo.org'. These headers only apply to pages where Chamilo is responsible of the HTTP headers generation (i.e. '.php' files). It does not apply to static files. If playing with this feature, make sure you also update your web server configuration to add the right headers for static files. See CDN configuration documentation above (search for 'add_header') for more information. Recommended (strict) value for this setting, if enabled: 'SAMEORIGIN'."
msgstr "X-Frame-Options jgħid lill-browser jekk tridx tippermetti li s-sit tiegħek jiġi framed jew le. Billi tipprevjeni browser milli jiframja s-sit tiegħek tista' tiddefendi kontra attakki bħal clickjacking. Jekk tiddefinixxi URL hawnhekk, għandu jiddefinixxi l-URL(s) minn fejn il-kontenut tiegħek għandu jkun viżibbli, mhux l-URLs minn fejn is-sit tiegħek jaċċetta kontenut. Per eżempju, jekk l-URL prinċipali tiegħek (root_web hawn fuq) hija https://11.chamilo.org/, allura dan l-issettjar għandu jkun: 'ALLOW-FROM https://11.chamilo.org'. Dawn l-headers japplikaw biss għal paġni fejn Chamilo huwa responsabbli għall-ġenerazzjoni tal-headers HTTP (jiġifieri fajls '.php'). Ma japplikax għal fajls statiċi. Jekk tilgħab b'din il-funzjoni, kun żgur li taġġorna wkoll il-konfigurazzjoni tas-server tal-web tiegħek biex iżżid l-headers it-tajbin għal fajls statiċi. Ara d-dokumentazzjoni tal-konfigurazzjoni CDN hawn fuq (fittex 'add_header') għal aktar informazzjoni. Valur rakkomandat (strett) għal dan l-issettjar, jekk attivat: 'SAMEORIGIN'."

msgid "X-XSS-Protection"
msgstr "X-XSS-Protection"

msgid "X-XSS-Protection sets the configuration for the cross-site scripting filter built into most browsers. Recommended value '1; mode=block'."
msgstr "X-XSS-Protection tissettja l-konfigurazzjoni għall-filtru cross-site scripting inkorporat fil-biċċa l-kbira tal-browsers. Valur rakkomandat '1; mode=block'."

msgid "X-Content-Type-Options"
msgstr "X-Content-Type-Options"

msgid "X-Content-Type-Options stops a browser from trying to MIME-sniff the content type and forces it to stick with the declared content-type. The only valid value for this header is 'nosniff'."
msgstr "X-Content-Type-Options twaqqaf browser milli jipprova MIME-sniff it-tip ta' kontenut u ġġiegħlu jżomm mat-tip ta' kontenut iddikjarat. L-uniku valur validu għal dan l-header huwa 'nosniff'."

msgid "Security Referrer Policy"
msgstr "Politika tas-Sigurtà tar-Referrer"

msgid "Referrer Policy is a new header that allows a site to control how much information the browser includes with navigation away from a document and should be set by all sites."
msgstr "Referrer Policy huwa header ġdid li jippermetti sit jikkontrolla kemm informazzjoni l-browser jinkludi man-navigazzjoni 'l barra minn dokument u għandu jiġi ssettjat minn siti kollha."

msgid "Block disabled users immediately"
msgstr "Imblokka utenti diżattivati immedjatament"

msgid "Immediately block users who have been disabled by the admin through users management. Otherwise, users who have been disabled will keep their previous privileges until they logout."
msgstr "Imblokka immedjatament utenti li ġew diżattivati mill-amministratur permezz tal-ġestjoni tal-utenti. Inkella, utenti li ġew diżattivati se jżommu l-privileġġi preċedenti tagħhom sakemm joħorġu."

msgid "Session cookie samesite"
msgstr "Session cookie samesite"

msgid "Enable samesite:None parameter for session cookie. More info: https://www.chromium.org/updates/same-site and https://developers.google.com/search/blog/2020/01/get-ready-for-new-samesitenone-secure"
msgstr "Attiva l-parametru samesite:None għas-session cookie. Aktar informazzjoni: https://www.chromium.org/updates/same-site u https://developers.google.com/search/blog/2020/01/get-ready-for-new-samesitenone-secure"

msgid "Hide link to session page"
msgstr "Aħbi link għall-paġna tas-session"

msgid "Hide link to the session page from the sessions list."
msgstr "Aħbi link għall-paġna tas-session mil-lista tas-sessjonijiet."

msgid "Hide tabs on the session page"
msgstr "Aħbi tabs fil-paġna tas-session"

msgid "Session admins can edit course content"
msgstr "L-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet jistgħu jeditjaw il-kontenut tal-kors"

msgid "Session admins can 'login as' teachers"
msgstr "L-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet jistgħu 'jilloggjaw bħala' għalliema"

msgid "Enable sessions search diagnosis"
msgstr "Attiva d-dijanjosi tat-tfittxija tas-sessjonijiet"

msgid "Allow tutors to get a diagnosis that will allow them to search for the best sessions for learners."
msgstr "Ħalli tuturi jiksbu dijanjosi li tippermettilhom ifittxu l-aħjar sessjonijiet għall-istudenti."

msgid "Redirect to session after registration in session's 'About' page"
msgstr "Irridirezzjona għas-session wara r-reġistrazzjoni fil-paġna 'Dwar' tas-session"

msgid "Show number of users in sessions list"
msgstr "Uri n-numru ta' utenti fil-lista tas-sessjonijiet"

msgid "The admin can see the number of users in each session. This adds additional weight to the sessions list, so if you use it often, consider carefully whether you want the extra waiting time."
msgstr "L-amministratur jista' jara n-numru ta' utenti f'kull session. Dan iżid piż addizzjonali għal-lista tas-sessjonijiet, għalhekk jekk tużaha spiss, ikkunsidra bir-reqqa jekk tridx iż-żmien ta' stennija addizzjonali."

msgid "Session admins can access all course content"
msgstr "L-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet jistgħu jaċċessaw il-kontenut kollu tal-kors"

msgid "Session admins are forbidden access to the users list"
msgstr "L-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet huma pprojbiti milli jaċċessaw il-lista tal-utenti"

msgid "Hide search form in sessions list"
msgstr "Aħbi l-formola tat-tfittxija fil-lista tas-sessjonijiet"

msgid "Session admins can delete users"
msgstr "L-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet jistgħu jħassru utenti"

msgid "Session admins can disable users"
msgstr "L-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet jistgħu jiddiżattivaw utenti"

msgid "Prevent emptying the subscribed users in session subscription"
msgstr "Ipprevjeni li jkun vojt l-utenti abbonati fl-abbonament tas-session"

msgid "When using the multiple learners subscription to a session, prevent the normal behaviour which is to unsubscribe users who are not in the right panel when clicking submit. Keep all users there."
msgstr "Meta tintuża s-sottoskrizzjoni ta' diversi studenti għal sessjoni, tevita l-imġieba normali li tneħħi l-abbunament tal-utenti li mhumiex fil-pannell tal-lemin meta tagħfas issottometti. Żomm l-utenti kollha hemmhekk."

msgid "Hide sessions list in reporting tool"
msgstr "Aħbi l-lista tas-sessjonijiet fl-għodda tar-rapporti"

msgid "Sessions that include the course are listed in the reporting tool inside the course itself, which can add considerable weight if the same course is used in hundreds of sessions. This option removes that list."
msgstr "Is-sessjonijiet li jinkludu l-kors huma elenkati fl-għodda tar-rapporti ġewwa l-kors innifsu, li jista' jżid piż konsiderevoli jekk l-istess kors jintuża f'mijiet ta' sessjonijiet. Din l-għażla tneħħi dik il-lista."

msgid "Session admins can view careers"
msgstr "L-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet jistgħu jaraw il-karrieri"

msgid "Sessions support manual sorting"
msgstr "Is-sessjonijiet jappoġġjaw l-issortjar manwali"

msgid "Allow user to collapse sessions in My sessions"
msgstr "Ħalli l-utent jiġġarraf is-sessjonijiet fis-Sessjonijiet tiegħi"

msgid "Auto-create single-user session on course auto-subscription"
msgstr "Oħloq awtomatikament sessjoni għal utent wieħed meta jkun hemm abbonament awtomatiku għall-kors"

msgid "When a user subscribes to an open course through the courses catalogue, create a single-user session instead of subscribing him/her to the base course."
msgstr "Meta utent jabbuna għal kors miftuħ permezz tal-katalgu tal-korsijiet, oħloq sessjoni għal utent wieħed minflok ma tabbonah fil-kors bażi."

msgid "Default sessions list view"
msgstr "Vista default tal-lista tas-sessjonijiet"

msgid "Select the default tab you want to see when opening the sessions list as admin."
msgstr "Agħżel it-tab default li trid tara meta tiftaħ il-lista tas-sessjonijiet bħala amministratur."

msgid "Auto-created session's creator ID"
msgstr "ID tal-ħallieq tas-sessjonijiet maħluqa awtomatikament"

msgid "Set the user to use as creator of the automatically-created sessions (to avoid assigning every session to user '1' which is often the portal administrator)."
msgstr "Issettja l-utent li jintuża bħala ħallieq tas-sessjonijiet maħluqa awtomatikament (biex tevita li kull sessjoni tiġi assenjata lill-utent '1' li ħafna drabi huwa l-amministratur tal-portal)."

msgid "Auto-created sessions duration"
msgstr "Tul tas-sessjonijiet maħluqa awtomatikament"

msgid "Duration (in days) of the single-user, auto-created sessions. After expiry, the user cannot register to the same course (no other session is created)."
msgstr "Tul (f'jiem) tas-sessjonijiet għal utent wieħed maħluqa awtomatikament. Wara l-iskadenza, l-utent ma jistax jirreġistra għall-istess kors (ma tinħoloq l-ebda sessjoni oħra)."

msgid "Change the default sorting of session in My sessions"
msgstr "Ibdel l-issortjar default tas-sessjoni fis-Sessjonijiet tiegħi"

msgid "By default, sessions are ordered by start date. Change this by providing an array of type ['field' => 'end_date', 'order' => 'desc']."
msgstr "B'mod default, is-sessjonijiet huma ordnati skont id-data tal-bidu. Ibdel dan billi tipprovdi array tat-tip ['field' => 'end_date', 'order' => 'desc']."

msgid "Set course read-only in session"
msgstr "Issettja l-kors bħala qari biss fis-sessjoni"

msgid "Let teachers set some courses in read-only mode when opened through sessions. In the course properties, check the 'Lock course in session' option."
msgstr "Ħalli l-għalliema jissettjaw xi korsijiet f'modalità ta' qari biss meta jinfetħu permezz tas-sessjonijiet. Fil-proprjetajiet tal-kors, iċċekkja l-għażla 'Lock course in session'."

msgid "Options for session import"
msgstr "Għażliet għall-importazzjoni tas-sessjonijiet"

msgid "Array of options to apply as default parameters in the CSV/XML session import."
msgstr "Array ta' għażliet li għandhom jiġu applikati bħala parametri default fl-importazzjoni tas-sessjonijiet CSV/XML."

msgid "Fields to search by in catalogue"
msgstr "Oqsma li għandhom jiġu mfittxija fil-katalgu"

msgid "Set preferences for the courses and sessions catalogues search options. If defined, this array will be used as a strict list of fields to let users search by."
msgstr "Issettja l-preferenzi għall-għażliet tat-tiftix tal-korsijiet u s-sessjonijiet. Jekk definit, dan l-array jintuża bħala lista stretta ta' oqsma li l-utenti jistgħu jfittxu bihom."

msgid "Customize course-session tracking columns"
msgstr "Ippersonalizza l-kolonni tat-traċċar tal-kors-sessjoni"

msgid "Define an array of columns for the following reports: 'course_session', 'my_students_lp', 'my_progress_lp', 'my_progress_courses'."
msgstr "Iddefinixxi array ta' kolonni għar-rapporti li ġejjin: 'course_session', 'my_students_lp', 'my_progress_lp', 'my_progress_courses'."

msgid "My progress: show course details in session"
msgstr "Il-progress tiegħi: uri d-dettalji tal-kors fis-sessjoni"

msgid "Display all details of each course in session when clicking on session details."
msgstr "Uri d-dettalji kollha ta' kull kors fis-sessjoni meta tikklikkja fuq id-dettalji tas-sessjoni."

msgid "Base course teacher can see assignments from all sessions"
msgstr "L-għalliem tal-kors bażi jista' jara l-inkarigi minn is-sessjonijiet kollha"

msgid "Show all learner publications (from base course and from all sessions) in the work/pending.php page of the base course."
msgstr "Uri l-pubblikazzjonijiet kollha tal-istudenti (mill-kors bażi u mis-sessjonijiet kollha) fil-paġna work/pending.php tal-kors bażi."

msgid "Session admin can access batch user import, update and export"
msgstr "L-amministratur tas-sessjoni jista' jaċċessa l-importazzjoni, l-aġġornament u l-esportazzjoni tal-utenti f'lott"

msgid "Hide session chart in My progress"
msgstr "Aħbi l-grafika tas-sessjoni fil-Progress tiegħi"

msgid "Only display users from active sessions in tracking"
msgstr "Uri biss l-utenti mis-sessjonijiet attivi fit-traċċar"

msgid "Sessions by duration always available to coaches"
msgstr "Sessjonijiet skont it-tul dejjem disponibbli għall-kowċis"

msgid "Otherwise, session coaches only have access to sessions by duration during the active duration."
msgstr "Inkella, il-kowċis tas-sessjoni jkollhom aċċess biss għas-sessjonijiet skont it-tul matul it-tul attiv."

msgid "Limit subscriptions to course to only users of the session"
msgstr "Illimita l-abbonamenti għall-kors għall-utenti tas-sessjoni biss"

msgid "Restrict the list of students to subscribe in the course session. And disable registration for users in all courses from Resume Session page."
msgstr "Irrestriġġi l-lista tal-istudenti li jistgħu jabbunaw fil-kors tas-sessjoni. U iddiżattiva r-reġistrazzjoni għall-utenti fil-korsijiet kollha mill-paġna Resume Session."

msgid "Disable add class in session course for non-admin"
msgstr "Iddiżattiva ż-żieda ta' klassi fil-kors tas-sessjoni għal dawk li mhumiex amministraturi"

msgid "Disable tab to add classes in session course for non-admins."
msgstr "Iddiżattiva t-tab biex iżżid klassijiet fil-kors tas-sessjoni għal dawk li mhumiex amministraturi."

msgid "Add username to e-mail notification of subscription to session"
msgstr "Żid l-isem tal-utent fin-notifika bl-email tal-abbonament għas-sessjoni"

msgid "Add reset password link to e-mail notification of subscription to session"
msgstr "Żid link għar-risettjar tal-password fin-notifika bl-email tal-abbonament għas-sessjoni"

msgid "Pre-fill session fields with user fields"
msgstr "Imla minn qabel l-oqsma tas-sessjoni bl-oqsma tal-utent"

msgid "Array of relationships between user extra fields and session extra fields, so the session can be pre-filled with data matching the user's data."
msgstr "Array ta' relazzjonijiet bejn oqsma extra tal-utent u oqsma extra tas-sessjoni, sabiex is-sessjoni tista' timtela minn qabel bid-data li tqabbel mad-data tal-utent."

msgid "Set mandatory extra fields in session creation form"
msgstr "Issettja oqsma extra obbligatorji fil-formola tal-ħolqien tas-sessjoni"

msgid "Require the listed fields during session creation."
msgstr "Irrikjedi l-oqsma elenkati waqt il-ħolqien tas-sessjoni."

msgid "Sort session templates by id in session creation form"
msgstr "Issortja t-templates tas-sessjoni skont l-id fil-formola tal-ħolqien tas-sessjoni"

msgid "Send notification to learner when a skill/badge has been acquired"
msgstr "Ibgħat notifika lill-istudent meta jkun inkiseb ħila/badge"

msgid "Hide skills from learners"
msgstr "Aħbi l-ħiliet mill-istudenti"

msgid "If enabled, skills can only be visible for admins, teachers (related to a user via a course), and HRM users (if related to a user)."
msgstr "Jekk attivat, il-ħiliet jistgħu jkunu viżibbli biss għall-amministraturi, l-għalliema (relatati ma' utent permezz ta' kors), u l-utenti HRM (jekk relatati ma' utent)."

msgid "Allow teachers to access learners' skills"
msgstr "Ħalli l-għalliema jaċċessaw il-ħiliet tal-istudenti"

msgid "Allow teachers to set which skills are acquired through their courses"
msgstr "Ħalli l-għalliema jissettjaw liema ħiliet jinkisbu permezz tal-korsijiet tagħhom"

msgid "By default, only admins can decide which skills can be acquired through which course."
msgstr "B'mod default, l-amministraturi biss jistgħu jiddeċiedu liema ħiliet jistgħu jinkisbu permezz ta' liema kors."

msgid "Hide skill levels feature"
msgstr "Aħbi l-karatteristika tal-livelli tal-ħiliet"

msgid "Show skills as a hierarchical table"
msgstr "Uri l-ħiliet bħala tabella ġerarkika"

msgid "Skill levels names"
msgstr "Ismijiet tal-livelli tal-ħiliet"

msgid "Define names for levels of skills as an array of id => name."
msgstr "Iddefinixxi ismijiet għal-livelli tal-ħiliet bħala array ta' id => name."

msgid "Enable linking skills to items"
msgstr "Attiva l-irbit tal-ħiliet mal-oġġetti"

msgid "This enables a major feature that enables any item to be linked to (and as such to allow acquisition of) a skill. The feature still requires the teacher to confirm the acquisition of the skill, so the acquisition is not automatic."
msgstr "Dan jattiva karatteristika ewlenija li tippermetti li kwalunkwe oġġett jiġi marbut ma’ (u b’hekk jippermetti l-akkwist ta’) ħila. Il-karatteristika xorta tirrikjedi li l-għalliem jikkonferma l-akkwist tal-ħila, għalhekk l-akkwist mhuwiex awtomatiku."

msgid "Show language flag next to avatar in social network"
msgstr "Uri l-bandiera tal-lingwa ħdejn l-avatar fin-netwerk soċjali"

msgid "Teachers and admins see students as friends on social network"
msgstr "L-għalliema u l-amministraturi jaraw l-istudenti bħala ħbieb fin-netwerk soċjali"

msgid "Hide survey reporting button"
msgstr "Aħbi l-buttuna tar-rapportaġġ tal-istħarriġ"

msgid "Allows admins to hide survey reporting button if surveys are used to survey teachers."
msgstr "Jippermetti lill-amministraturi jaħbu l-buttuna tar-rapportaġġ tal-istħarriġ jekk l-istħarriġ jintuża biex jistħarreġ lill-għalliema."

msgid "Mark all survey questions as 'required' by default"
msgstr "Immarka l-mistoqsijiet kollha tal-istħarriġ bħala 'meħtieġa' b'mod awtomatiku"

msgid "Allow teachers to see who answered in anonymous surveys"
msgstr "Ħalli lill-għalliema jaraw min wieġeb fl-istħarriġ anonimi"

msgid "Allow teachers to see which learners have already answered an anonymous survey. This only appears once more than one user has answered, so it remains difficult to identify who answered what."
msgstr "Ħalli lill-għalliema jaraw liema studenti diġà wieġbu stħarriġ anonimu. Dan jidher biss meta aktar minn utent wieħed ikun wieġeb, sabiex jibqa’ diffiċli li jiġi identifikat min wieġeb xiex."

msgid "Allow teachers to edit survey questions after students answered"
msgstr "Ħalli lill-għalliema jeditjaw il-mistoqsijiet tal-istħarriġ wara li l-istudenti jkunu wieġbu"

msgid "Order by student name when using survey duplication feature"
msgstr "Ordna skont l-isem tal-istudent meta jintuża l-karatteristika tad-duplikazzjoni tal-istħarriġ"

msgid "The survey duplication feature is oriented towards teachers and is meant to ask teachers to give their appreciation about each student in order. This option will order the questions by learner's lastname."
msgstr "Il-karatteristika tad-duplikazzjoni tal-istħarriġ hija orjentata lejn l-għalliema u hija maħsuba biex titlob lill-għalliema jagħtu l-apprezzament tagħhom dwar kull student b’ordni. Din l-għażla tordna l-mistoqsijiet skont il-kunjom tal-istudent."

msgid "Enable 'previous question' button in surveys"
msgstr "Attiva l-buttuna 'mistoqsija preċedenti' fl-istħarriġ"

msgid "Prevent survey edition"
msgstr "Impedixxi l-editjar tal-istħarriġ"

msgid "Prevent editing surveys for all surveys listed here (by code). Use * to prevent edition of all surveys."
msgstr "Impedixxi l-editjar tal-istħarriġ għall-istħarriġ kollha elenkati hawn (skont il-kodiċi). Uża * biex timpedixxi l-editjar tal-istħarriġ kollha."

msgid "Add additional actions (as links) to survey lists for teachers"
msgstr "Żid azzjonijiet addizzjonali (bħala links) mal-listi tal-istħarriġ għall-għalliema"

msgid "Add actions (usually connected to plugins) in the list of surveys. Use array syntax ['myplugin' => ['MyPlugin', 'urlGeneratorCallback']]."
