msgid "When this feature is enabled on a multi-URL configuration, you can go to the main URL and provide URL-specific versions of any file (in the documents tool). The original file will be replaced by the alternative whenever seeing it from a different URL. This allows you to customize each URL even further, while enjoying the advantage of re-using the same courses many times."
msgstr "Meta din il-funzjoni tkun attivata f'konfigurazzjoni b'ħafna URLs, tista' tmur għall-URL ewlieni u tipprovdi verżjonijiet speċifiċi għall-URL ta' kwalunkwe fajl (fit-tool tad-dokumenti). Il-fajl oriġinali jiġi sostitwit mill-alternattiva kull meta jkun qed jintuża minn URL differenti. Dan jippermettilek tippersonalizza kull URL aktar, filwaqt li tibbenefika mill-vantaġġ li tuża l-istess korsijiet diversi drabi."

msgid "Project manager"
msgstr "Maniġer tal-proġett"

msgid "Select classes for which this course will be visible for subscription in the catalogue. Subscription rules still apply apart from it being visible in the catalogue."
msgstr "Agħżel il-klassijiet li għalihom dan il-kors ikun viżibbli għas-sottoskrizzjoni fil-katalgu. Ir-regoli tas-sottoskrizzjoni jibqgħu japplikaw apparti li jkun viżibbli fil-katalgu."

msgid "Remove the checkbox to enable sending announcements to users with HR roles (still requires to confirm in the announcements tool)."
msgstr "Neħħi l-kaxxa biex tippermetti li jintbagħtu avviżi lill-utenti b'rwoli HR (xorta jkun hemm bżonn ta' konferma fit-tool tal-avviżi)."

msgid "Sets which user appears as the sender of agenda reminder emails."
msgstr "Tissettja liema utent jidher bħala min jibgħat l-emails ta' tfakkira tal-aġenda."

msgid "Enable Multi-Level Attendance Grading"
msgstr "Attiva l-Gradazzjoni Multi-Livell tal-Attendenza"

msgid "Allows grading attendance with multiple levels instead of a simple present/absent system."
msgstr "Tippermetti l-gradazzjoni tal-attendenza b'livelli multipli minflok sistema sempliċi ta' preżenti/assenti."

msgid "Show courses duration"
msgstr "Uri t-tul tal-korsijiet"

msgid "Display the course duration next to the course title in the course catalogue and the courses list."
msgstr "Uri t-tul tal-kors ħdejn it-titlu tal-kors fil-katalgu tal-korsijiet u fil-lista tal-korsijiet."

msgid "Display colors for scores in the gradebook"
msgstr "Uri kuluri għall-punteġġi fil-gradebook"

msgid "Enables color coding for better score visibility in the gradebook."
msgstr "Jattiva l-kodifikazzjoni bil-kulur għal viżibilità aħjar tal-punteġġi fil-gradebook."

msgid "Default platform language"
msgstr "Lingwa awtomatika tal-pjattaforma"

msgid "Main language, used by default when no user language is set."
msgstr "Lingwa ewlenija, użata b'mod awtomatiku meta ma tkunx issettjata lingwa tal-utent."

msgid "Unlock prerequisites after last test attempt"
msgstr "Aħles il-prerekwiżiti wara l-aħħar tentattiv tat-test"

msgid "Allows users to continue in a learning path after using all quiz attempts of a test used as prerequisite for other items."
msgstr "Tippermetti lill-utenti jkomplu f'path tat-tagħlim wara li jużaw l-attempts kollha tal-quiz ta' test użat bħala prerekwiżit għal oġġetti oħra."

msgid "Send all e-mails as one single sender"
msgstr "Ibgħat l-emails kollha bħala mittent wieħed biss"

msgid "Overrides sender for all emails to appear from a unique address."
msgstr "Jissostitwixxi l-mittent għall-emails kollha biex jidhru minn indirizz uniku."

msgid "Send all e-mails from this e-mail address"
msgstr "Ibgħat l-emails kollha minn dan l-indirizz tal-email"

msgid "Sets the default email address used in the \"from\" field of emails."
msgstr "Tissettja l-indirizz tal-email awtomatiku użat fil-qasam \"from\" tal-emails."

msgid "Send all e-mails as originating from this (organizational) name"
msgstr "Ibgħat l-emails kollha bħala li ġejjin minn dan l-isem (organizzattiv)"

msgid "Sets the default display name used for sending platform emails. e.g. \"Support team\"."
msgstr "Tissettja l-isem tal-wiri awtomatiku użat biex jintbagħtu l-emails tal-pjattaforma. eż. \"Tim ta' appoġġ\"."

msgid "Current version of the database schema used by Chamilo"
msgstr "Verżjoni attwali tal-iskema tad-database użata minn Chamilo"

msgid "Displays the current DB version to match the Chamilo core version."
msgstr "Juri l-verżjoni attwali tad-DB biex tqabbelha mal-verżjoni ewlenija ta' Chamilo."

msgid "Enable the notification tool for a more impactful communication channel with students"
msgstr "Attiva t-tool tan-notifiki għal kanal ta' komunikazzjoni aktar effettiv mal-istudenti"

msgid "Activates popup or system notifications for important platform events."
msgstr "Jattiva notifiki popup jew tas-sistema għal avvenimenti importanti tal-pjattaforma."

msgid "List of visible fields in profile"
msgstr "Lista ta' oqsma viżibbli fil-profil"

msgid "Controls which profile fields are visible to users and others."
msgstr "Tikkontrolla liema oqsma tal-profil huma viżibbli għall-utenti u oħrajn."

msgid "Minimal password syntax requirements"
msgstr "Rekwiżiti minimi tas-sintassi tal-password"

msgid "Defines the required structure for user passwords."
msgstr "Jiddefinixxi l-istruttura meħtieġa għall-passwords tal-utenti."

msgid "Filter users that can be seen as online"
msgstr "Iffiltra l-utenti li jistgħu jidhru online"

msgid "Limits online user visibility to specific user roles."
msgstr "Tillimita l-viżibilità tal-utenti online għal rwoli speċifiċi tal-utenti."

msgid "Auto-provision more anonymous users"
msgstr "Ipprovdi aktar utenti anonimi awtomatikament"

msgid "Dynamically creates new anonymous users to support high visitor traffic."
msgstr "Joħloq utenti anonimi ġodda b'mod dinamiku biex jappoġġja traffiku għoli ta' viżitaturi."

msgid "Access to personal file for all"
msgstr "Aċċess għall-fajl personali għal kulħadd"

msgid "Allows all users to access, view, and manage their personal files within the system."
msgstr "Jippermetti lill-utenti kollha jaċċessaw, jaraw u jimmaniġġjaw il-fajls personali tagħhom fis-sistema."

msgid "Enable the copy of session-specific content to another session"
msgstr "Ippermetti l-kopja ta' kontenut speċifiku għas-sessjoni għal sessjoni oħra"

msgid "Allows duplication of resources that were created in the session when duplicating the session."
msgstr "Jippermetti d-duplikazzjoni tar-riżorsi li ġew maħluqa fis-sessjoni meta tiġi duplikata s-sessjoni."

msgid "Enable Automatic Reinscription"
msgstr "Ippermetti r-reġistrazzjoni mill-ġdid awtomatika"

msgid "Enable or disable automatic re-subscription when course validity expires. The related cron job must also be activated."
msgstr "Ippermetti jew iddiżattiva r-reġistrazzjoni mill-ġdid awtomatika meta tiskadi l-validità tal-kors. Il-cron job relatat irid jiġi attivat ukoll."

msgid "Enable Session Replication"
msgstr "Ippermetti r-replikazzjoni tas-sessjoni"

msgid "Enable or disable automatic session replication. The related cron job must also be activated."
msgstr "Ippermetti jew iddiżattiva r-replikazzjoni awtomatika tas-sessjoni. Il-cron job relatat irid jiġi attivat ukoll."

msgid "Assigning skills to user: sub-skills auto-loading"
msgstr "L-assenjazzjoni ta' ħiliet lill-utent: it-tlugħ awtomatiku tas-sub-ħiliet"

msgid "When manually assigning skills to a user, the form can be set to automatically offer you to assign a sub-skill instead of the skill you selected."
msgstr "Meta jiġu assenjati ħiliet manwalment lil utent, il-formola tista' tiġi ssettjata biex toffri awtomatikament li tiġi assenjata sub-ħila minflok il-ħila li għażilt."

msgid "Hide groups block in social network"
msgstr "Aħbi l-blokk tal-gruppi fin-netwerk soċjali"

msgid "Removes the groups section from the social network view."
msgstr "Tneħħi s-sezzjoni tal-gruppi mill-vista tan-netwerk soċjali."

msgid "Enable the AI helper tool"
msgstr "Ippermetti l-għodda tal-għajnuna bl-AI"

msgid "Enables all available AI-powered features in the platform."
msgstr "Jippermetti l-karatteristiċi kollha disponibbli li huma mħaddma bl-AI fil-pjattaforma."

msgid "AI providers connection data"
msgstr "Data tal-konnessjoni tal-fornituri tal-AI"

msgid "Configuration data to connect with external AI services."
msgstr "Data tal-konfigurazzjoni biex tikkonnettja mas-servizzi esterni tal-AI."

msgid "Learning paths generator"
msgstr "Ġeneratur tal-mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim"

msgid "Generates personalized learning paths using AI suggestions."
msgstr "Jiġġenera mogħdijiet tat-tagħlim personalizzati bl-użu ta' suġġerimenti tal-AI."

msgid "Exercise generator"
msgstr "Ġeneratur tal-eżerċizzji"

msgid "Generates personalized tests with AI based on course content."
msgstr "Jiġġenera testijiet personalizzati bl-AI ibbażati fuq il-kontenut tal-kors."

msgid "Open answers grader"
msgstr "Valutatur tat-tweġibiet miftuħa"

msgid "Automatically grades open-ended answers using AI."
msgstr "Jivvaluta awtomatikament it-tweġibiet miftuħa bl-użu tal-AI."

msgid "Tutor chatbot energized by AI"
msgstr "Chatbot tutor imħaddem bl-AI"

msgid "Provides students with an AI-powered tutoring assistant."
msgstr "Jipprovdi lill-istudenti assistent tutor mħaddem bl-AI."

msgid "Assignments grader"
msgstr "Valutatur tal-inkarigi"

msgid "Uses AI to evaluate and grade uploaded assignments."
msgstr "Juża l-AI biex jevalwa u jivvaluta l-inkarigi mtellgħa."

msgid "Content analyser"
msgstr "Analizzatur tal-kontenut"

msgid "Analyses learning materials to extract insights or improve quality."
msgstr "Janalizza l-materjali tat-tagħlim biex jiġbed għarfien jew itejjeb il-kwalità."

msgid "Image generator"
msgstr "Ġeneratur tal-immaġni"

msgid "Generates images based on prompts or content using AI."
msgstr "Jiġġenera immaġni bbażati fuq prompts jew kontenut bl-użu tal-AI."

