msgstr "Sessjonijiet li jiddependu fuq din is-sessjoni"

msgid "My Sessions display mode"
msgstr "Mod ta' wiri tas-Sessjonijiet Tiegħi"

msgid "Choose how the \"My Sessions\" page is displayed: as a modern visual block (card) view or the classic list style."
msgstr "Agħżel kif tintwera l-paġna \"Is-Sessjonijiet Tiegħi\": bħala blokki viżwali moderni (kards) jew bħala lista klassika."

msgid "Validate prerequisites only within the same session"
msgstr "Ikkonferma l-prerekwiżiti biss fl-istess sessjoni"

msgid "When enabled, a course will be considered validated only if passed within the current session. If disabled, courses passed in other sessions will also unlock dependent courses."
msgstr "Meta attivat, kors jitqies validat biss jekk jgħaddi fis-sessjoni attwali. Jekk diżattivat, korsijiet li jgħaddu f'sessjonijiet oħra jiftħu wkoll korsijiet dipendenti."

msgid "Password rotation interval (days)"
msgstr "Intervall ta' rotazzjoni tal-password (ġranet)"

msgid "Number of days before users must rotate their password (0 = disabled)."
msgstr "Numru ta' ġranet qabel ma l-utenti jkollhom jibdlu l-password tagħhom (0 = diżattivat)."

msgid "CSRF token is invalid. Please try again."
msgstr "It-token CSRF mhuwiex validu. Erġa' pprova."

msgid "User not found or invalid."
msgstr "Utent mhux misjub jew invalidu."

msgid "Email Settings"
msgstr "Settings tal-Email"

msgid "The DSN fully includes all parameters needed to connect to the mail service. You can learn more at %s. The default value is null://null and will disable e-mail sending. Use native://default to use the default PHP configuration on your server. Here are a few examples of supported DSN syntaxes: %s."
msgstr "Id-DSN jinkludi l-parametri kollha meħtieġa biex tikkonnettja mas-servizz tal-posta. Tista' titgħallem aktar fuq %s. Il-valur default huwa null://null u jiddiżattiva l-ibgħat tal-email. Uża native://default biex tuża l-konfigurazzjoni PHP default fuq is-server tiegħek. Hawn xi eżempji ta' sintassi DSN appoġġjati: %s."

msgid "Mail DSN"
msgstr "Mail DSN"

msgid "The e-mail address from which e-mails will be sent when the platform sends an e-mail, also used as 'reply-to' header. We recommend using a 'no-reply' e-mail address here, to avoid excessive filling of an e-mail box. The support e-mail address defined in the Platform section should be used to contact you, but replying to automatic notifications should not be encouraged."
msgstr "L-indirizz tal-email minn fejn jintbagħtu l-emails meta l-pjattaforma tibgħat email, użat ukoll bħala header 'reply-to'. Nirrakkomandaw li tuża indirizz 'no-reply' hawnhekk, biex tevita mili eċċessiv ta' kaxxa tal-email. L-indirizz tal-email ta' appoġġ definit fis-sezzjoni Pjattaforma għandu jintuża biex tikkuntattjana, iżda m'għandux jiġi mħeġġeġ li twieġeb għan-notifiki awtomatiċi."

msgid "Mail: 'From' address"
msgstr "Email: indirizz 'Minn'"

msgid "The name that appears as the sender (next to the From e-mail address) when the platform sends an e-mail."
msgstr "L-isem li jidher bħala l-mittent (ħdejn l-indirizz tal-email 'Minn') meta l-pjattaforma tibgħat email."

msgid "Mail: 'From' name"
msgstr "Email: isem 'Minn'"

msgid "Installer data is missing."
msgstr "Id-dejta tal-installer hija nieqsa."

msgid "Test email sent successfully"
msgstr "Email tat-test intbagħtet b'suċċess"

msgid "Test email failed: "
msgstr "Email tat-test falliet: "

msgid "Error during test email: "
msgstr "Żball waqt l-email tat-test: "

msgid "Destination of test e-mail"
msgstr "Destinazzjoni tal-email tat-test"

msgid "A database with the same name already exists. It will be deleted."
msgstr "Database bl-istess isem diġà teżisti. Se titħassar."

msgid "Dear user"
msgstr "Għażiż utent"

msgid "You are about to start using one of the best Open Source e-learning platforms on the market. Like many other Open Source projects, Chamilo is backed up by a large community of students, teachers, developers, content creators and businesses who would like to promote the project better."
msgstr "Int se tibda tuża waħda mill-aqwa pjattaformi open source għat-tagħlim elettroniku fis-suq. Bħal ħafna proġetti open source oħra, Chamilo huwa appoġġjat minn komunità kbira ta' studenti, għalliema, żviluppaturi, kreaturi ta' kontenut u negozji li jixtiequ jippromwovu l-proġett aħjar."

msgid "By knowing a little bit more about you, a platform administrator, one of the most important user type for us, who will manage this e-learning system, we will be able to let people know, statistically, how our software is used while respecting your privacy. We will also be able to let you know when we organize events that might be relevant to you or offer additional services that might be of value to your organisation."
msgstr "Billi tkun taf ftit aktar dwarek, amministratur tal-pjattaforma, wieħed mit-tipi ta' utenti l-aktar importanti għalina, li se jimmaniġġja dan is-sistema ta' tagħlim elettroniku, inkunu nistgħu ngħarrfu lin-nies, statistikament, kif jintuża s-softwer tagħna filwaqt li nirrispettaw il-privatezza tiegħek. Inkunu nistgħu ngħarrfuk ukoll meta norganizzaw avvenimenti li jistgħu jkunu rilevanti għalik jew noffru servizzi addizzjonali li jistgħu jkunu ta' valur għall-organizzazzjoni tiegħek."

msgid "By filling this form, you agree that the editor of Chamilo, the %s company, registered in Belgium, and/or members of its network of partners (exclusively Chamilo services providers) might occasionally send you information by e-mail about important events or updates in the Chamilo software or community. This will help the community grow as an organized entity where information flows, with a thorough respect of your time and your privacy."
msgstr "Billi timla dan il-formola, taqbel li l-editur ta' Chamilo, il-kumpanija %s, irreġistrata fil-Belġju, u/jew membri tan-network tal-imsieħba tagħha (esklussivament fornituri ta' servizzi Chamilo) jistgħu kultant jibgħatulek informazzjoni bl-email dwar avvenimenti importanti jew aġġornamenti fis-softwer jew fil-komunità ta' Chamilo. Dan jgħin lill-komunità tikber bħala entità organizzata fejn l-informazzjoni tiċċirkola, b'rispett sħiħ għaż-żmien u l-privatezza tiegħek."

msgid "Please note that you are NOT REQUIRED to fill this form. If you want to remain anonymous, we will lose the opportunity to offer you all the privileges of being a registered portal administrator, but we will respect your decision. Simply leave this form empty and click Next."
msgstr "Jekk jogħġbok innota li M'GĦANDIX BŻONN timla dan il-formola. Jekk trid tibqa' anonimu, nitilfu l-opportunità li noffrulek il-privileġġi kollha li tkun amministratur irreġistrat tal-portal, iżda nirrispettaw id-deċiżjoni tiegħek. Sempliċement ħalli dan il-formola vojta u kklikkja Li jmiss."

msgid "In person"
msgstr "Personalment"

msgid "Blended learning"
msgstr "Tagħlim imħallat"

