msgid "Clear filters"
msgstr "Ħassar il-filtri"

msgid "Attendances (tablet)"
msgstr "Attendenzi (tablet)"

msgid "Exit tablet mode"
msgstr "Oħroġ mill-modalità tablet"

msgid "No members found."
msgstr "Ma nstab l-ebda membru."

msgid "Health check"
msgstr "Kontroll tas-saħħa"

msgid "Export to CC 1.3"
msgstr "Esporta għal CC 1.3"

msgid "Loading resources..."
msgstr "Qed jitgħabbew ir-riżorsi..."

msgid "Failed to load resources."
msgstr "Ma setgħux jitgħabbew ir-riżorsi."

msgid "Please select at least one exportable resource (document, web link, discussion,...)."
msgstr "Jekk jogħġbok agħżel mill-inqas riżorsa esportabbli waħda (dokument, link tal-web, diskussjoni,...)."

msgid "Export finished."
msgstr "L-esportazzjoni spiċċat."

msgid "Export failed."
msgstr "L-esportazzjoni falliet."

msgid "Import failed."
msgstr "L-importazzjoni falliet."

msgid "Local file (.zip, .mbz, .tgz, .gz)"
msgstr "Fajl lokali (.zip, .mbz, .tgz, .gz)"

msgid "Ready to import"
msgstr "Lest għall-importazzjoni"

msgid "We will restore the backup into this course. You can go back to change options."
msgstr "Se nirkupraw il-backup f’dan il-kors. Tista’ tmur lura biex tibdel l-għażliet."

msgid "Select resources to import"
msgstr "Agħżel ir-riżorsi li trid timporta"

msgid "No resources available in this backup."
msgstr "M’hemm l-ebda riżorsa disponibbli f’dan il-backup."

msgid "Import selection"
msgstr "Importa l-għażla"

msgid "Import completed"
msgstr "L-importazzjoni tlestiet"

msgid "Could not load options."
msgstr "Ma setgħux jitgħabbew l-għażliet."

msgid "Please select a backup file (.zip, .mbz, .tgz, .gz)"
msgstr "Jekk jogħġbok agħżel fajl tal-backup (.zip, .mbz, .tgz, .gz)"

msgid "Please choose a backup from the server"
msgstr "Jekk jogħġbok agħżel backup mis-server"

msgid "Error selecting source."
msgstr "Żball fl-għażla tas-sors."

msgid "Recycling options"
msgstr "Għażliet tar-riċiklaġġ"

msgid "Type the course code to confirm"
msgstr "Ittajpja l-kodiċi tal-kors biex tikkonferma"

msgid "This will remove or reset selected resources. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "Dan se jneħħi jew jirrissetta r-riżorsi magħżula. Din l-azzjoni ma tistax titħassar."

msgid "Select resources to recycle"
msgstr "Agħżel ir-riżorsi li trid tirriċikla"

msgid "No resources available in this course."
msgstr "M’hemm l-ebda riżorsa disponibbli f’dan il-kors."

msgid "Recycle selected"
msgstr "Irriċikla l-għażliet"

msgid "Error loading resources."
msgstr "Żball fit-tagħbija tar-riżorsi."

msgid "Clear search"
msgstr "Ħassar it-tfittxija"

msgid "Only letters, digits and underscore (_) are allowed in the database name. Invalid characters will be removed automatically."
msgstr "Fil-isem tad-database huma permessi biss ittri, ċifri u l-underscore (_). Il-karattri invalidi jitneħħew awtomatikament."

msgid "What general terms and conditions are given to users to use this platform?"
msgstr "X’termini u kundizzjonijiet ġenerali jingħataw lill-utenti biex jużaw din il-pjattaforma?"

msgid "ex. %s"
msgstr "eż. %s"

msgid "Welcome to Chamilo!"
msgstr "Merħba f’Chamilo!"

msgid "Welcome to this platform"
msgstr "Merħba f’din il-pjattaforma"

msgid "For more details visit %s"
msgstr "Għal aktar dettalji żur %s"

msgid "Manager"
msgstr "Maniger"

msgid "Mark as"
msgstr "Immarka bħala"

msgid "Reply to all"
msgstr "Irrispondi lil kulħadd"

msgid "SCIM external ID"
msgstr "SCIM external ID"

msgid "OAuth2 ID"
msgstr "OAuth2 ID"

msgid "Please accept the latest version of the terms and conditions."
msgstr "Jekk jogħġbok aċċetta l-aħħar verżjoni tat-termini u l-kundizzjonijiet."

msgid "Required value for operation without path"
msgstr "Valur meħtieġ għall-operazzjoni mingħajr mogħdija"

msgid "Available space (%s)"
msgstr "Spazju disponibbli (%s)"

msgid "Index this description for the global search"
msgstr "Indiċja din id-deskrizzjoni għat-tfittxija globali"

msgid "Unknown course"
msgstr "Kors mhux magħruf"

msgid "Certificate not found."
msgstr "Ċertifikat ma nstabx."

msgid "Security token expired. Please reload the page and try again."
msgstr "It-token tas-sigurtà skada. Jekk jogħġbok erġa' tella' l-paġna u erġa' pprova."

msgid "Only platform administrators can change the course visibility."
msgstr "L-amministraturi tal-pjattaforma biss jistgħu jibdlu l-viżibilità tal-kors."

msgid "Unexpected error while subscribing the user"
msgstr "Żball mhux mistenni waqt li s-sottoskrizzjoni tal-utent"

msgid "Search in resource logs"
msgstr "Fittex fil-logs tar-riżorsi"

msgid "Include this learning path in the global search results"
msgstr "Inkludi dan il-perkors tat-tagħlim fir-riżultati tat-tfittxija globali"

msgid "The course code already exists"
msgstr "Il-kodiċi tal-kors diġà jeżisti"

msgid "Latest news"
msgstr "Aħħar aħbarijiet"

msgid "Get the latest news from Chamilo, including security vulnerabilities and events, directly inside your administration panel. These pieces of news will be checked on the Chamilo news server every time you load the administration page and are only visible to administrators."
msgstr "Ikseb l-aħħar aħbarijiet minn Chamilo, inklużi vulnerabbiltajiet tas-sigurtà u avvenimenti, direttament ġewwa l-pannell tal-amministrazzjoni tiegħek. Dawn l-aħbarijiet jiġu ċċekkjati fuq is-server tal-aħbarijiet ta' Chamilo kull darba li ttagħbija l-paġna tal-amministrazzjoni u huma viżibbli biss għall-amministraturi."

msgid "Chamilo support block"
msgstr "Blokk ta' appoġġ ta' Chamilo"

msgid "Get pro tips and an easy way to contact official service providers for professional support, directly from the makers of Chamilo. This block appears on your administration page, is only visible by administrators, and refreshes every time you load the administration page."
msgstr "Ikseb pariri professjonali u mod faċli biex tikkuntattja fornituri uffiċjali tas-servizz għal appoġġ professjonali, direttament mill-ħallieqa ta' Chamilo. Dan il-blokk jidher fuq il-paġna tal-amministrazzjoni tiegħek, huwa viżibbli biss mill-amministraturi, u jġedded kull darba li ttagħbija l-paġna tal-amministrazzjoni."

msgid "Hide option to send announcements to HR users"
msgstr "Aħbi l-għażla li tibgħat avviżi lill-utenti HR"

msgid "Allow session admins to download private certificates"
msgstr "Ħalli l-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet jniżżlu ċertifikati privati"

msgid "If enabled, session administrators can download certificates even if they are not publicly published."
msgstr "Jekk attivat, l-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet jistgħu jniżżlu ċertifikati anke jekk ma jkunux ippubblikati pubblikament."

msgid "If not empty, the course creation process will look for some fields in the user profile and auto-fill them for the course. For example, a teacher specialized in digital marketing could automatically set a « digital marketing » flag on each course (s)he creates."
msgstr "Jekk mhux vojt, il-proċess tal-ħolqien tal-kors ifittex xi oqsma fil-profil tal-utent u jimlihom awtomatikament għall-kors. Per eżempju, għalliem speċjalizzat fil-marketing diġitali jista' awtomatikament jistabbilixxi bandiera « marketing diġitali » fuq kull kors li joħloq."

msgid "Main menu entries"
msgstr "Entrati tal-menu prinċipali"

msgid "Check the entrie you want to see appear in the main menu"
msgstr "Iċċekkja l-entrati li trid tara jidhru fil-menu prinċipali"

msgid "Main menu entries per role"
msgstr "Entrati tal-menu prinċipali għal kull rwol"

msgid "Define header tabs visibility per role."
msgstr "Iddefinixxi l-viżibilità tat-tabs tal-header għal kull rwol."

msgid "Set the options you want to appear in the navigation around a table to show less or more rows on one page. e.g. [50, 100, 200, 500]."
msgstr "Issettja l-għażliet li trid jidhru fin-navigazzjoni madwar tabella biex turi inqas jew aktar ringieli fuq paġna waħda. eż. [50, 100, 200, 500]."

msgid "Array of extra features you can enable for the video player in Chamilo. Options include 'speed', which allows you to change the playback speed of a video."
msgstr "Array ta' karatteristiċi extra li tista' tattiva għall-plejer tal-vidjow f'Chamilo. L-għażliet jinkludu 'speed', li jippermettilek tibdel il-veloċità tal-playback ta' vidjow."

msgid "Mail: character set"
msgstr "Mail: sett ta' karattri"

msgid "In case you need to define the charset to use when sending those e-mails. Leave empty if you're not sure."
msgstr "Fil-każ li jkollok bżonn tiddefinixxi l-charset li tuża meta tibgħat dawk l-emails. Ħalli vojt jekk m'intix ċert."

msgid "Mail: Debug"
msgstr "Mail: Debug"

msgid "Select whether you want to enable the e-mail sending debug logs. These will give you more information on what is happening when connecting to the mail service, but are not elegant and might break page design. Only use when there is not user activity."
msgstr "Agħżel jekk tridx tattiva l-logs tad-debug tal-ibgħat tal-email. Dawn jagħtuk aktar informazzjoni dwar x'jiġri meta tikkonnettja mas-servizz tal-posta, iżda mhumiex eleganti u jistgħu jkissru d-disinn tal-paġna. Uża biss meta ma jkunx hemm attività tal-utent."

msgid "Mail: Avoid using LD+JSON"
msgstr "Mail: Evita li tuża LD+JSON"

msgid "Some e-mail clients do not understand the descriptive LD+JSON format, showing it as a loose JSON string to the final user. If this is your case, you might want to set the variable below to 'false' to disable this header."
msgstr "Xi klijenti tal-email ma jifhmux il-format deskrittiv LD+JSON, juruh bħala string JSON maħlul għall-utent finali. Jekk dan huwa l-każ tiegħek, tista' trid tissettja l-varjabbli hawn taħt għal 'false' biex tiddiżattiva dan l-header."

msgid "Mail: DKIM headers"
msgstr "Mail: headers DKIM"

msgid "Enter a JSON array of your DKIM configuration settings (see example)."
msgstr "Daħħal array JSON tas-settings tal-konfigurazzjoni DKIM tiegħek (ara l-eżempju)."

msgid "Mail: XOAuth2 options"
msgstr "Mail: għażliet XOAuth2"

msgid "If you use some XOAuth2-based e-mail service, use this setting in JSON to save your specific configuration (see example) and select XOAuth2 in the mail service setting."
msgstr "Jekk tuża xi servizz tal-email ibbażat fuq XOAuth2, uża din l-issettjar f'JSON biex issalva l-konfigurazzjoni speċifika tiegħek (ara l-eżempju) u agħżel XOAuth2 fis-setting tas-servizz tal-posta."

msgid "Defines the environment type: \"prod\" (normal production), \"validation\" (like production but without reporting statistics), or \"test\" (debug mode with developer tools such as untranslated string indicators)."
msgstr "Jiddefinixxi t-tip ta' ambjent: \"prod\" (produzzjoni normali), \"validation\" (bħal produzzjoni iżda mingħajr statistika tar-rapporti), jew \"test\" (modalità debug b'għodod għall-iżviluppaturi bħal indikaturi ta' strings mhux tradotti)."

msgid "Global limit of users per course"
msgstr "Limitu globali ta' utenti għal kull kors"

msgid "Defines a global maximum number of users (teachers included) allowed to be subscribed to any single course in the platform. Set this value to 0 to disable the limit. This helps avoid courses being overloaded in open portals."
msgstr "Jiddefinixxi numru massimu globali ta' utenti (għalliema inklużi) li jistgħu jiġu sottoskritti għal kwalunkwe kors wieħed fil-pjattaforma. Issettja dan il-valur għal 0 biex tiddiżattiva l-limitu. Dan jgħin biex jiġu evitati korsijiet li jkunu mgħobbija żżejjed f'portali miftuħa."

msgid "Enable to use an array to define which roles should be clearly displayed and which should be hidden."
msgstr "Attiva biex tuża array biex tiddefinixxi liema rwoli għandhom jintwerew b'mod ċar u liema għandhom jinħbew."

msgid "Show base course posts in session course"
msgstr "Uri l-posts tal-kors bażi fil-kors tas-sessjoni"

msgid "Limit identical email usage"
msgstr "Limita l-użu tal-istess email"

msgid "Maximum number of accounts allowed to share the same e-mail address. Set to 0 to disable this limit."
msgstr "Numru massimu ta' kontijiet li jistgħu jaqsmu l-istess indirizz elettroniku. Issettja għal 0 biex tiddiżattiva dan il-limitu."

msgid "Allow session admins to see all users on all URLs"
msgstr "Ħalli l-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet jaraw l-utenti kollha fuq l-URLs kollha"

msgid "If enabled, session admins can search and list users from all access URLs, regardless of their current URL."
msgstr "Jekk attivat, l-amministraturi tas-sessjonijiet jistgħu jfittxu u jelenkaw utenti minn URLs ta' aċċess kollha, irrispettivament mill-URL attwali tagħhom."

msgid "Enable the possibility for users to select their own timezone. Once configured, users will be able to see assignment deadlines and other time references in their own timezone, which will reduce errors at delivery time."
msgstr "Ippermetti lill-utenti jagħżlu ż-żona tal-ħin tagħhom stess. Ladarba tkun ikkonfigurata, l-utenti jkunu jistgħu jaraw id-dati ta' skadenza tal-kompiti u referenzi oħra tal-ħin fiż-żona tal-ħin tagħhom stess, u b'hekk inaqqsu l-iżbalji fil-ħin tal-kunsinna."

msgid "Redirect after login (per profile)"
msgstr "Irridirezzjona wara l-login (skont il-profil)"

msgid "Define redirection per profile after login using a JSON object like {\"STUDENT\":\"\", \"ADMIN\":\"admin-dashboard\"}"
msgstr "Iddefinixxi r-ridirezzjoni skont il-profil wara l-login billi tuża oġġett JSON bħal {\"STUDENT\":\"\", \"ADMIN\":\"admin-dashboard\"}"

msgid "Hide legal accept checkbox in Terms and Conditions page"
msgstr "Aħbi l-kaxxa tal-aċċettazzjoni legali fil-paġna tat-Termini u Kundizzjonijiet"

msgid "If set to true, removes the \"I have read and accept\" checkbox in the Terms and Conditions page flow."
msgstr "Jekk issettjat għal true, tneħħi l-kaxxa \"Qrajt u naċċetta\" fil-fluss tal-paġna tat-Termini u Kundizzjonijiet."

msgid "Array defining host and port for the LDAP server."
msgstr "Array li tiddefinixxi l-host u l-port għas-server LDAP."

msgid "Enable 2FA"
msgstr "Attiva 2FA"

msgid "Add fields in the password update page to enable 2FA using a TOTP authenticator app. When disabled globally, users won't see 2FA fields and won't be prompted for 2FA at login, even if they had enabled it previously."
msgstr "Żid oqsma fil-paġna tal-aġġornament tal-password biex tattiva 2FA billi tuża app awtentikatur TOTP. Meta tkun diżattivata globalment, l-utenti ma jarawx oqsma 2FA u ma jintalabux 2FA fil-login, anke jekk kienu attivawha qabel."

msgid "Some features of Chamilo will connect to the exterior from the server. For example to make sure an external content exists when creating a link or showing an embedded page in the learning path. If your Chamilo server uses a proxy to get out of its network, this would be the place to configure it."
msgstr "Xi karatteristiċi ta' Chamilo se jikkonnettjaw mal-estern mis-server. Per eżempju biex jiżguraw li kontenut estern jeżisti meta jinħoloq link jew tintwera paġna inkorporata fil-mogħdija tat-tagħlim. Jekk is-server Chamilo tiegħek juża proxy biex joħroġ min-network tiegħu, dan ikun il-post fejn tikkonfigurah."

msgid "Enable or disable automatic reinscription when course validity expires. The related cron job must also be activated."
msgstr "Attiva jew iddiżattiva r-reġistrazzjoni awtomatika meta tiskadi l-validità tal-kors. Il-cron job relatat irid jiġi attivat ukoll."

msgid "Show remaining days in My Sessions"
msgstr "Uri l-ġranet li fadal fis-Sessjonijiet Tiegħi"

msgid "If enabled, the session dates on the \"My Sessions\" page will be replaced by the number of remaining days."
msgstr "Jekk attivat, id-dati tas-sessjoni fil-paġna \"Is-Sessjonijiet Tiegħi\" jiġu sostitwiti bin-numru ta' ġranet li fadal."

msgid "Show \"Pending surveys\" in menu"
msgstr "Uri \"Stħarriġ pendenti\" fil-menu"

msgid "Display a menu item that lets users access their pending surveys."
msgstr "Uri element tal-menu li jippermetti lill-utenti jaċċessaw l-istħarriġ pendenti tagħhom."

msgid "Disclose AI assistance"
msgstr "Żvela l-għajnuna tal-AI"

msgid "Show a tag on any content or feedback that has been generated or co-generated by any AI system, evidencing to the user that the content was built with the help of some AI system. Details about which AI system was used in which case are kept inside the database for audit, but are not directly accessible by the final user."
msgstr "Uri tikketta fuq kwalunkwe kontenut jew feedback li ġie ġġenerat jew ko-ġġenerat minn kwalunkwe sistema tal-AI, biex juri lill-utent li l-kontenut inbena bl-għajnuna ta' xi sistema tal-AI. Id-dettalji dwar liema sistema tal-AI ntużat f'kull każ jinżammu ġewwa d-database għall-verifika, iżda mhumiex aċċessibbli direttament mill-utent finali."

msgid "JSON configuration for course catalog: link settings, filters, sort options, and more."
msgstr "Konfigurazzjoni JSON għall-katalgu tal-korsijiet: settings tal-links, filtri, għażliet ta' ordni, u aktar."

msgid "Session Catalog Settings"
msgstr "Settings tal-Katalgu tas-Sessjonijiet"

msgid "JSON configuration for session catalog: filters and display options."
msgstr "Konfigurazzjoni JSON għall-katalgu tas-sessjonijiet: filtri u għażliet ta' wiri."

msgid "Show Course Descriptions"
msgstr "Uri d-Deskruzzjonijiet tal-Korsijiet"

msgid "Display course descriptions within the catalog listing."
msgstr "Uri d-deskruzzjonijiet tal-korsijiet fil-lista tal-katalgu."

msgid "Published Courses Only"
msgstr "Korsijiet Ippubblikati Biss"

msgid "Limit the catalog to only courses marked as published."
msgstr "Illimita l-katalgu għal korsijiet immarkati biss bħala ppubblikati."

msgid "Display Catalog on Homepage"
msgstr "Uri l-Katalgu fil-Homepage"

msgid "Show the course catalog block on the platform homepage."
msgstr "Uri l-blokk tal-katalgu tal-korsijiet fil-homepage tal-pjattaforma."

msgid "Hide Public Link"
msgstr "Aħbi l-Link Pubbliku"

msgid "Remove the public URL link from course cards."
msgstr "Neħħi l-link tal-URL pubbliku mill-kards tal-korsijiet."

msgid "Only Selected Courses"
msgstr "Korsijiet Magħżula Biss"

msgid "Show only manually selected courses in the catalog."
msgstr "Uri biss korsijiet magħżula manwalment fil-katalgu."

msgid "Allow Student Browsing"
msgstr "Ħalli l-Istudenti Jibbrawżjaw"

msgid "Permit students to browse and filter the course catalog."
msgstr "Ħalli l-istudenti jibbrawżjaw u jiffiltraw il-katalgu tal-korsijiet."

msgid "Hide Private Courses"
msgstr "Aħbi l-Korsijiet Privati"

msgid "Exclude private courses from the catalog display."
msgstr "Escludi l-korsijiet privati mill-wiri tal-katalgu."

msgid "Show Courses & Sessions"
msgstr "Uri Korsijiet u Sessjonijiet"

msgid "Include both courses and sessions in catalog results."
msgstr "Inkludi kemm korsijiet kif ukoll sessjonijiet fir-riżultati tal-katalgu."

msgid "Auto Session Subscription"
msgstr "Abbonament Awtomatiku għas-Sessjoni"

msgid "Enable automatic subscription to sessions for users."
msgstr "Attiva l-abbonament awtomatiku għas-sessjonijiet għall-utenti."

msgid "Subscription in Session View"
msgstr "Abbonament fil-View tas-Sessjoni"

msgid "Allow users to subscribe to courses directly from their session page."
msgstr "Ħalli l-utenti jabbònaw għal korsijiet direttament mill-paġna tas-sessjoni tagħhom."

msgid "Enable redirection plugin"
msgstr "Attiva l-plugin tar-rindirizz"

msgid "Array defining the 'days' and 'months' to set the account expiration date when the user first logs in."
msgstr "Array li jiddefinixxi l-'ġranet' u x-'xhur' biex jissettja d-data ta' skadenza tal-kont meta l-utent jidħol għall-ewwel darba."

msgid "An array of role => number which represents the number of days an account has before expiration, depending on the role."
msgstr "Array ta' rwol => numru li jirrappreżenta n-numru ta' ġranet li kont għandu qabel ma jiskadi, skont ir-rwol."

msgid "Extra user field used to search and name sessions"
msgstr "Qasam addizzjonali tal-utent użat biex tfittex u ssemmi s-sessjonijiet"

msgid "This setting defines the extra user field key (e.g., \"company\") that will be used to search for users and to define the name of the session when registering students from /admin-dashboard/register."
msgstr "Dan is-setting jiddefinixxi ċ-ċavetta tal-qasam addizzjonali tal-utent (eż., \"kumpanija\") li tintuża biex tfittex utenti u biex tiddefinixxi l-isem tas-sessjoni meta tirreġistra studenti minn /admin-dashboard/register."

msgid "Glossary terms generator"
msgstr "Ġeneratur tat-termini tal-glossarju"

msgid "Allow teachers to ask for AI-generated glossary terms in their course. This will generate 20 terms based on the course title and the general description in the course description tool. If used more than once, it will exclude terms already present in that glossary (make sure content can be shared with the configured AI services)."
msgstr "Ħalli l-għalliema jitolbu termini tal-glossarju ġġenerati mill-AI fil-kors tagħhom. Dan jiġġenera 20 terminu bbażat fuq it-titlu tal-kors u d-deskruzzjoni ġenerali fl-għodda tad-deskruzzjoni tal-kors. Jekk jintuża aktar minn darba, jeskludi termini li diġà jinsabu f'dak il-glossarju (kun żgur li l-kontenut jista' jinqasam mas-servizzi tal-AI ikkonfigurati)."

msgid "Video generator"
msgstr "Ġeneratur tal-vidjows"

msgid "Generates videos based on prompts or content using AI (this might consume many tokens)."
msgstr "Jiġġenera vidjows ibbażati fuq prompts jew kontenut bl-użu tal-AI (dan jista' jikkonsma ħafna tokens)."

msgid "Course analyser"
msgstr "Analizzatur tal-kors"

msgid "Analyses all resources in one or many courses and pre-trains the AI model to answer any question on this or these courses (make sure content can be shared with the configured AI services)."
msgstr "Janalizza r-riżorsi kollha f'kors wieħed jew aktar u jippreparra l-mudell tal-AI biex iwieġeb kwalunkwe mistoqsija dwar dan il-kors jew dawn il-korsijiet (kun żgur li l-kontenut jista' jinqasam mas-servizzi tal-AI ikkonfigurati)."

msgid "Test/development"
msgstr "Test/iżvilupp"

msgid "Crons"
msgstr "Crons"

msgid "Editor"
msgstr "Editur"

msgid "Gradebook"
msgstr "Gradebook"

msgid "Internationalization"
msgstr "Internazzjonalizzazzjoni"

msgid "User profiles"
msgstr "Profili tal-utenti"

msgid "Support tickets"
msgstr "Tickets ta' appoġġ"

msgid "Webservices"
msgstr "Webservices"

msgid "Catalogue"
msgstr "Katalgu"

msgid "Workflows"
msgstr "Workflows"

msgid "Setting is editable on sub-URLs"
msgstr "L-issettjar jista' jiġi editjat fuq sub-URLs"

msgid "Show JSON Template"
msgstr "Uri Template JSON"

msgid "JSON Template"
msgstr "Template JSON"

