msgid "EU AI Act – Transparency & risk notice"
msgstr "Att tal-IA tal-UE – Avviż ta' trasparenza u riskju"

msgid "Under the EU Artificial Intelligence Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689), AI systems used in education are generally classified as “high-risk”. This software itself is <strong>not</strong> an AI system, but it can integrate optional internal or external AI systems—depending on your configuration—to enhance user task performance. These systems could access personal data <em>only if</em> users include such data in their prompts. By design, this software does not share personal data with AI systems without the user's active input. By default, all AI features are disabled."
msgstr "Taħt l-Att tal-Intelliġenza Artifiċjali tal-UE (Regolament (UE) 2024/1689), is-sistemi tal-IA użati fl-edukazzjoni huma ġeneralment ikklassifikati bħala “riskju għoli”. Dan is-softwer innifsu <strong>mhuwiex</strong> sistema tal-IA, iżda jista' jintegra sistemi tal-IA interni jew esterni fakultattivi—skont il-konfigurazzjoni tiegħek—biex itejjeb il-prestazzjoni tal-kompiti tal-utent. Dawn is-sistemi jistgħu jaċċessaw data personali <em> biss jekk</em> l-utenti jinkludu tali data fil-prompts tagħhom. Bid-disinn, dan is-softwer ma jaqsamx data personali ma' sistemi tal-IA mingħajr l-input attiv tal-utent. B'mod awtomatiku, il-karatteristiċi kollha tal-IA huma diżattivati."

msgid "Admin responsibility & disclosures"
msgstr "Responsabbiltà u divulgazzjonijiet tal-amministratur"

msgid "This configuration page details each AI feature and its purpose. As a deployer, you should review them carefully and update your GDPR-compliant data privacy policies to reflect the options you enable. While most AI features do not directly share personal data with external systems, user prompts sent to AI may inadvertently include personal information. As a deployer, <strong>you are responsible</strong> for informing users of this risk. For transparency, future releases may show non-intrusive end-user tags indicating that certain content or feedback was generated with the help of AI."
msgstr "Din il-paġna tal-konfigurazzjoni tidħol fid-dettall dwar kull karatteristika tal-IA u l-iskop tagħha. Bħala deployer, għandek tirrevedihom bir-reqqa u taġġorna l-politiki tal-privatezza tad-data konformi mal-GDPR tiegħek biex jirriflettu l-għażliet li tattiva. Filwaqt li ħafna karatteristiċi tal-IA ma jaqsmu direttament data personali ma' sistemi esterni, il-prompts tal-utent mibgħuta lill-IA jistgħu jinkludu informazzjoni personali b'mod involontarju. Bħala deployer, <strong>int responsabbli</strong> li tinforma lill-utenti b'dan ir-riskju. Għat-trasparenza, ir-rilaxxi futuri jistgħu juru tikketti mhux intrużivi għall-utent finali li jindikaw li ċertu kontenut jew feedback ġie ġġenerat bl-għajnuna tal-IA."

