msgid "[%s] Please change your password"
msgstr "[%s] Jekk jogħġbok ibdel il-password tiegħek"

msgid "Dear %s,\n\nOur security enforcing process shows you use a password that is commonly used on the internet, which means your account could easily be stolen. It is probably a simple sequence or a very common word, we don't really know (we cannot see your password), but we ask you to please connect to the platform and request a password change. You can follow the link here: %s to do that now.\n\nPlease note we will never ask for your password in this process. You just enter your username or e-mail and we send you a link. If you are asked to introduce your existing password to do that, someone is probably trying to do Phishing on your account. Be safe, change your password now!\n\n%s\n%s"
msgstr "Għażiż %s,\n\nIl-proċess tas-sigurtà tagħna juri li qed tuża password li tintuża ħafna fuq l-internet, li jfisser li l-kont tiegħek jista' jinqered faċilment. Probabilment hija sekwenza sempliċi jew kelma komuni ħafna, ma nafux eżatt (ma nistgħux naraw il-password tiegħek), imma nitolbuk biex tikkonnettja mal-pjattaforma u titlob bidla fil-password. Tista' ssegwi l-link hawn: %s biex tagħmel dan issa.\n\nJekk jogħġbok innota li qatt ma nitolbu l-password tiegħek f'dan il-proċess. Inti biss iddaħħal l-username jew l-e-mail tiegħek u nibgħatulek link. Jekk tintalab biex tiddaħħal il-password eżistenti tiegħek biex tagħmel dan, xi ħadd probabbilment qed jipprova jagħmel Phishing fuq il-kont tiegħek. Kun sigur, ibdel il-password tiegħek issa!\n\n%s\n%s"

msgid "[%s] Your password has been reset"
msgstr "[%s] Il-password tiegħek ġiet resetjata"

msgid "Dear %s,\n\nOur security enforcing process flagged you as using a password that is commonly used on the internet, which means your account could easily be stolen. As a prevention measure, we have decided to initiate a password reset process. Your new, automatically generated password is now:\n\n%s\n\nPlease login to the platform soon (using this new password) to set your own, personal and secure, password.\n\nBe safe.\n\n%s\n%s"
msgstr "Għażiż %s,\n\nIl-proċess tas-sigurtà tagħna indika li qed tuża password li tintuża ħafna fuq l-internet, li jfisser li l-kont tiegħek jista' jinqered faċilment. Bħala miżura ta' prevenzjoni, iddeċidejna li nibdew proċess ta' reset tal-password. Il-password ġdida tiegħek, ġġenerata awtomatikament, hija issa:\n\n%s\n\nJekk jogħġbok illoggja fil-pjattaforma dalwaqt (bl-użu ta' din il-password il-ġdida) biex tissettja l-password personali u sigura tiegħek stess.\n\nKun sigur.\n\n%s\n%s"

