msgid "This generative AI tool allows you to create images and short videos to illustrate your course. By explaining (in text) what you want in the prompt section, you will give the configured AI model the elements necessary to generate an image or a video. Please be patient. The AI model will take some time and generate some result, which you might want to keep by saving the media in your documents folder, and then embed inside an HTML document. Not all AI models are equal in terms of speed or quality. The AI model might also give you a modified prompt, which is a more detailed interpretation of your request. You can then use this modified prompt to finetune your request. Please be aware that this tool, in particular for videos, might generate considerable costs to your organization, even if you decide not to save the generated media. Please use it accordingly. If you have issues obtaining what you are looking for, please take some time to research prompting tricks online for the AI model at your disposal."
msgstr "Dan l-għodda ġenerattiva tal-AI tippermettilek toħloq immaġini u vidjows qosra biex turi l-kors tiegħek. Billi tispjega (bit-test) dak li trid fis-sezzjoni tal-prompt, tagħti lill-mudell tal-AI kkonfigurat l-elementi meħtieġa biex jiġġenera immaġni jew vidjow. Jekk jogħġbok kun paċenzjuż. Il-mudell tal-AI jieħu ftit żmien u jiġġenera riżultat, li forsi trid iżżommu billi tissejvja l-medja fil-folder tad-dokumenti tiegħek, u mbagħad tinkorporaha f’dokument HTML. Mhux il-mudelli kollha tal-AI huma ugwali f’termini ta’ veloċità jew kwalità. Il-mudell tal-AI jista’ wkoll jagħtik prompt modifikat, li huwa interpretazzjoni aktar dettaljata tat-talba tiegħek. Tista’ mbagħad tuża dan il-prompt modifikat biex tirfina t-talba tiegħek. Jekk jogħġbok kun konxju li din l-għodda, b’mod partikolari għall-vidjows, tista’ tiġġenera spejjeż konsiderevoli għall-organizzazzjoni tiegħek, anke jekk tiddeċiedi li ma tissejvjax il-medja ġġenerata. Jekk jogħġbok użaha kif xieraq. Jekk ikollok problemi biex tikseb dak li qed tfittex, jekk jogħġbok ħu ftit żmien biex tirriċerka tricks tal-prompting online għall-mudell tal-AI li għandek."

